    "{{ManaCost}}: Roll a d20. {{ActivateModifiers(~GraveyardCard)}}.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Put this card on top of your library.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Return this card to your hand.\n{{RawDigits}} | Return this card to the battlefield tapped": "FromGraveyard(ActivatedWithModifiers(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), ActionList([RollAD20, ValueActions(TheDiceResult, [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [PutGraveyardCardOnTopOfLibrary(ThisGraveyardCard)]), ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[2]}}, {{RawDigits[3]}}), [ReturnGraveyardCardToHand(ThisGraveyardCard)]), ValueAction(ExactValue({{RawDigits[4]}}), [PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(ThisGraveyardCard, [EntersTapped])])])]), {{ActivateModifiers(~GraveyardCard=^~GraveyardCard)[0]}}))",
