    "{{ManaCost}}, {{DiscardSelfCost(~HandCard)}}: {{ActivatedActions[ThisDiscardedCard]}}. {{ActivateModifiers[HandActivated]}}": "FromHand(ActivatedWithModifiers(And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), {{DiscardSelfCost(~HandCard=^~HandCard)[0]}}]), {{ActivatedActions[ThisDiscardedCard][0]}}, {{ActivateModifiers[HandActivated][0]}}))",
    "{{ManaCost}}, {{DiscardSelfCost(~HandCard)}}: {{ActivatedActions}}": "FromHand(Activated(And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), {{DiscardSelfCost(~HandCard=^~HandCard)[0]}}]), {{ActivatedActions[0]}}))",
