    "{{TapSelfCost}}: Choose one. X is {{GameNumber}}.\n* Scry X.\n* {{~Permanent}} deals X damage to target {{Creature}}.\n* You gain X life": "Activated({{TapSelfCost[0]}}, Modal_ChooseOne([ActionList([Scry({{GameNumber[0]}})]), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}})], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage({{~Permanent}}, {{GameNumber[0]}}, Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))])), ActionList([GainLife({{GameNumber[0]}})])]))",
    "{{TapSelfCost}}: Exile target instant or sorcery card from a graveyard. Roll a d20. {{ActivateModifiers}}.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Copy that card. You may cast the copy.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Copy that card. You may cast the copy by paying {{ManaCost}} rather than paying its mana cost.\n{{RawDigits}} | Copy each card exiled with this artifact. You may cast any number of the copies without paying their mana costs": "ActivatedWithModifiers({{TapSelfCost[0]}}, Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]))], ActionList([ExileGraveyardCard(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard), RollAD20, ValueActions(TheDiceResult, [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [CopyExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay), MayAction(CastCopiedCard)]), ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[2]}}, {{RawDigits[3]}}), [CopyExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay), MayAction(CastCopiedCardForAlternateCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})))]), ValueAction(ExactValue({{RawDigits[4]}}), [CopyExiledCards(WasExiledWithPermanent({{~Permanent}})), MayAction(CastAnyNumberOfCopiedCardsWithoutPaying)])])])), {{ActivateModifiers[0]}})",
