    "Create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}. Put X {{CounterType}} counters on it": "ActionList([CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])]), PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{X}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, TheCreatedToken)])",
    "Destroy X target {{Permanents}}": "Targeted([NumberTargetPermanents({{X}}, {{Permanents[0]}})], ActionList([DestroyEachPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanents)]))",
    "Destroy all {{Permanents}} with mana value X or less": "ActionList([DestroyEachPermanent(And([{{Permanents[0]}}, ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{X}}))]))])",
