    "Look at the top X cards of your library. You may put a creature card with mana value X or less from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{X}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{X}}))]), [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
