    "Draw a card, then discard a card. If {{Condition}}, exile {{~Permanent}}, then return him to the battlefield transformed under his owner's control": "ActionList([DrawACard, DiscardACard, If({{Condition[0]}}, [ExilePermanent({{~Permanent}}), PutExiledCardOntoBattlefield(TheCardExiledThisWay, [EntersTransformed, EntersUnderOwnersControl])])])",
