    "Exile target creature or Equipment card with mana value less than {{GameNumber(~Permanent)}} from your graveyard. Create a token that's a copy of it. That token gains {{Hasable}}. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step": "Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([Or([IsCardtype(Creature), IsArtifactType(Equipment)]), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{GameNumber(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([ExileGraveyardCard(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard), CreateTokens([TokenCopyOfExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay, NoTokenCopyEffects)]), CreatePermanentLayerEffect(TheCreatedToken, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]), CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheBeginningOfTheNextEndStep, ActionList([ExilePermanent(TheCreatedToken)]))]))",
