    "Exchange control of target artifact, creature, or land you control and target permanent an opponent controls that shares one of those types with it. If those permanents are exchanged this way, destroy all {{Permanents}} attached to them": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Creature), IsCardtype(Land)]), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), TargetPermanent(And([ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent), SharesACardtypeWithPermanentFromAmongCardtypes(Ref_TargetPermanent1, [Artifact, Creature, Land])]))], ActionList([ExchangeControl(Ref_TargetPermanent1, Ref_TargetPermanent2), If(PermanentsChangedControlThisWay, [DestroyEachPermanent(Or([AttachedToPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1), AttachedToPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))])]))",
