    "Exile the top card of your library face down. Put that card into your hand at the beginning of your next end step": "ActionList([ExileTopCardOfLibraryFaceDown, CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheBeginningOfTheNextEndStep, ActionList([PutExiledCardIntoOwnersHand(TheCardExiledThisWay)]))])",
