    "Exile the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it into your hand. Otherwise, put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it": "ActionList([ExileTopCardOfLibrary, IfElse(ACardWasExiledThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [PutExiledCardIntoOwnersHand(TheCardExiledThisWay)], [PutACounterOnExiledCard({{CounterType[0]}}, TheCardExiledThisWay)])])",
