    "Exile the top card of your library. Until the beginning of your next upkeep, you may play that card": "ActionList([ExileTopCardOfLibrary, CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay)], UntilTheBeginningOfPlayersNextUpkeep(You))])",
    "Exile the top card of your library. Until the end of your next turn, you may play that card": "ActionList([ExileTopCardOfLibrary, CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay)], UntilEndOfNextTurn(You))])",
