    "Exile the top card of your library. Until your next turn, you may cast it if it's {{a}} {{PotentialSpell}}": "ActionList([ExileTopCardOfLibrary, CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayCastExiledSpell(TheCardExiledThisWay, {{PotentialSpell[0]}})], UntilPlayersNextTurn(You))])",
