    "Exile the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Choose one of them. Until the end of your next turn, you may play that card": "ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}), ChooseAnExiledCard(TheCardsExiledThisWay), CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCard(TheChosenExiledCard)], UntilEndOfNextTurn(You))])",
    "Exile the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Choose one of them. You may play that card this turn": "ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}), ChooseAnExiledCard(TheCardsExiledThisWay), CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCard(TheChosenExiledCard)], UntilEndOfTurn)])",
    "Exile the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Choose {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} exiled this way and copy it {{Number}} times. You may cast the copies without paying their mana costs": "ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}), CopyAnExiledCardNumberTimes(TheCardsExiledThisWay, {{Number[0]}}), MayAction(CastAnyNumberOfCopiedCardsWithoutPaying)])",
    "Exile the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put all {{SpecificCards}} from among them onto the battlefield": "ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}), PutEachExiledCardOntoTheBattlefield(And([{{SpecificCards[0]}}, WasExiledThisWay]), [EntersNormally])])",
