    "Target {{Permanent}} gains protection from the color of its controller's choice until end of turn": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([PlayerAction(ControllerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), ChooseAColor(AnyColor)), CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent, [AddAbility([Protection(FromColor(TheChosenColor))])], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
