    "Target {{Permanent}}'s controller sacrifices it, then that player creates {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}}": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([PlayerActions(ControllerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), [SacrificePermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}])])])]))",
    "Target {{Permanent}}'s controller sacrifices it. That player may search their library for {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([PlayerAction(ControllerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), SacrificePermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)), PlayerMayAction(ControllerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersNormally]), Shuffle]))]))",
