    "Target {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard gains embalm until end of turn. The embalm cost is equal to its mana cost": "Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreateGraveyardCardEffectUntil(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [AddAbility([Embalm(ItsManaCost)])], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
    "Target {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard gains encore until end of turn. The encore cost is equal to its mana cost": "Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreateGraveyardCardEffectUntil(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [AddAbility([Encore(ItsManaCost)])], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
    "Target {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard gains escape until end of turn. The escape cost is equal to its mana cost plus exile {{Number}} other cards from your graveyard": "Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreateGraveyardCardEffectUntil(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [AddAbility([Escape(And([ItsManaCost, ExileNumberGraveyardCards({{Number[0]}}, And([Other(ThisGraveyardCard), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))]))])], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
