    "The next time {{a}} {{DamageSource}} of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, that damage is dealt to target {{Creature}} instead": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}})], ActionList([ChooseADamageSource({{DamageSource[0]}}), CreateFutureReplaceWouldDealDamage(NextTimeDamageWouldBeDealtThisTurnBySourceToRecipient(TheChosenDamageSource, Player(You)), [DealToCreatureOrPlaneswalkerInstead(Ref_TargetPermanent)])]))",
