    "The next time {{a}} {{Spell}} would deal damage to you this turn, that spell deals that damage to its controller instead": "ActionList([CreateFutureReplaceWouldDealDamage(NextTimeDamageWouldBeDealtThisTurnByASpellToRecipient({{Spell[0]}}, Player(You)), [DealToPlayerInstead(WouldDealDamage_ControllerOfDamageSource)])])",
