    "Whenever you attack this turn, create {{Number}} {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}} that are tapped and attacking. Sacrifice them at the beginning of the next end step": "ActionList([CreateTriggerUntil(WhenAPlayerAttacks(SinglePlayer(You)), ActionList([CreateTokensWithFlags([NumberTokens({{Number[0]}}, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, []))], [EntersTapped, EntersAttacking]), CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheBeginningOfTheNextEndStep, ActionList([SacrificeEachPermanent(TheTokensCreatedThisWay)]))]), UntilEndOfTurn)])",
