    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCostX(PayLife(ValueX)))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, return X {{Permanents}} to their owner's hand": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCostX(PutNumberPermanentsIntoOwnersHand(ValueX, {{Permanents[0]}})))",
