    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may exile {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(Exile([AGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))])))"
