    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from your graveyard": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(ExileNumberGraveyardCards({{Number[0]}}, And([{{SpecificCards[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))))",
