    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, pay {{ManaCost}} or sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(Or([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, put a card an opponent owns from exile into that player's graveyard": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(PutAnExiledCardIntoOwnersGraveyard(OwnedByAPlayer(Opponent))))",
