    "Exile any number of other cards from your graveyard with {{Number}} or more card types among them": "ExileAnyNumberOfGroupCardsFromPlayersGraveyard(Other({{~GraveyardCard}}), You, ANumberOfDifferentCardTypes(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Number[0]}})))",
