    "Exile {{~Permanent}} and artifacts you control named {{NamedCard}} and {{NamedCard}}": "And([ExilePermanent({{~Permanent}}), ExileAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Artifact), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsNamed(NamedCard({{NamedCard[0]}}))])), ExileAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Artifact), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsNamed(NamedCard({{NamedCard[1]}}))]))])"
