  },
  "{{ExiledQuotedAbility}}": {
    "At the beginning of your upkeep, if this card is exiled, it perpetually gets {{PTMod}}, then you may put it onto the battlefield": "FromExile(TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(SinglePlayer(You)), CardIsExiled(ThisExiledCard), ActionList([CreatePerpetualExiledCardEffect(ThisExiledCard, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})]), MayAction(PutExiledCardOntoBattlefield(ThisExiledCard, [EntersNormally]))])))",
    "At the beginning of your upkeep, if this card is exiled, remove {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter from it": "FromExile(TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(SinglePlayer(You)), CardIsExiled(ThisExiledCard), ActionList([RemoveACounterOfTypeFromExiledCard({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisExiledCard)])))",
    "At the beginning of your upkeep, if this card is exiled, remove {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter from it. Then if it has no {{CounterType}} counters on it, put it onto the battlefield": "FromExile(TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(SinglePlayer(You)), CardIsExiled(ThisExiledCard), ActionList([RemoveACounterOfTypeFromExiledCard({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisExiledCard), If(ExiledCardPassesFilter(ThisExiledCard, HasNoCountersOfType({{CounterType[1]}})), [PutExiledCardOntoBattlefield(ThisExiledCard, [EntersNormally])])])))",
    "When the last {{CounterType}} counter is removed from this card, if it's exiled, you may cast it without paying its mana cost. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn": "FromExile(TriggerI(WhenTheLastCounterOfTypeIsRemovedFromAnExiledCard({{CounterType[0]}}, SingleExiledCard(ThisExiledCard)), CardIsExiled(ThisExiledCard), ActionList([MayAction(CastSpellFromExileWithoutPayingAndFlagSpellsCastWithEffect(AnySpell, TheExiledCard, IsCardtype(Creature), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]))])))",
    "When the last {{CounterType}} counter is removed from this card, if it's exiled, you may cast it. It costs {{CostReduce}} less to cast this way": "FromExile(TriggerI(WhenTheLastCounterOfTypeIsRemovedFromAnExiledCard({{CounterType[0]}}, SingleExiledCard(ThisExiledCard)), CardIsExiled(ThisExiledCard), ActionList([MayAction(CastExiledCardForReducedCost(ThisExiledCard, {{CostReduce[0]}}))])))",
    "Whenever a land you control enters, if {{~Exiled}} is exiled, you may put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it. If you don't, return {{~Exiled}} to the battlefield with X {{CounterType}} counters on it and draw X cards, where X is the number of {{CounterType}} counters on it": "FromExile(TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), CardIsExiled(ThisExiledCard), ActionList([MayCost(PutACounterOnExiledCard({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisExiledCard)), Unless(CostWasPaid, [CreateValueX(NumCountersOfTypeOnExiledCard({{CounterType[2]}}, ThisExiledCard)), ReturnThisExiledCardToBattlefield([EntersWithNumberCounters(ValueX, {{CounterType[1]}})]), GainLife(ValueX)])])))",
    "You may cast this card from exile as long as {{Condition[OtherSpellThisTurn]}}": "FromExileIf({{Condition[OtherSpellThisTurn][0]}}, PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastExiledCard(ThisExiledCard)]))",
    "You may cast this card from exile as long as {{Condition}}": "FromExileIf({{Condition[0]}}, PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastExiledCard(ThisExiledCard)]))"
  },
