    "{{FullName}}\n{{Typeline[Creature]}}\n{{ManaCost}}\nYou may have {{~Permanent}} enter as a copy of another {{Permanent}}, except it has {{~Permanent}}'s other abilities.\n{{Line[Creature]}}\n{{Line[Creature]}}\n{{CardPT}}": "Card(Name: {{FullName[0]}}, Typeline: {{Typeline[Creature][0]}}, ManaCost: {{ManaCost[0]}}, Rules: [AsPermanentEnters(ThisPermanent, [MayActions([EnterAsACopyOfAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}, CopyEffects([AddAbility([{{Line[Creature][0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Line[Creature][1]}}])]))])]), {{Line[Creature][0]}}, {{Line[Creature][1]}}], CardPT: {{CardPT[0]}})",
