  "{{MultilinePermanent(~Permanent)}}": {
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may collect evidence {{Digits}}.\n{{Keyword}}\nWhen {{~Permanent}} enters, if evidence was collected, {{TriggerActions}}": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(CollectEvidence({{Digits[0]}}))), {{Keyword[0]}}, TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), EvidenceWasCollectedThisWay, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may collect evidence {{Digits}}. {{Reminder}}\n{{Keyword}}\nWhen this creature enters, if evidence was collected, {{TriggerActions}}": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(CollectEvidence({{Digits[0]}}))), {{Keyword[0]}}, TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), EvidenceWasCollectedThisWay, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may collect evidence {{Digits}}. {{Reminder}}\n{{Keyword}}\nWhen this creature enters, tap target {{Permanent}}. If evidence was collected, put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(CollectEvidence({{Digits[0]}}))), {{Keyword[0]}}, TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([TapPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), If(EvidenceWasCollectedThisWay, [PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)])])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may waterbend {{ManaCost}}. {{Reminder}}\nWhen {{~Permanent}} enters, draw a card, then discard a card unless her additional cost was paid": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(Waterbend({{ManaCost[0]}}))), TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), ActionList([DrawACard, Unless(EnteringPermanentPassesFilter(AdditionalCostWasPaid), [DiscardACard])]))",
    "As long as the top card of your library is {{a}} {{Zombie}} or instant card, you may look at it any time and you may cast it.\nYou may cast {{Zombie}} spells as though they had flash": "If(TopCardOfPlayersLibraryPassesFilter(You, Or([IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), IsCardtype(Instant)])), [PlayerEffect(You, [MayLookAtTopCardOfLibraryAnyTime, MayCastTopCardOfLibrary])]), PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastSpellsAsThoughTheyHadFlash(IsCreatureType({{Zombie[1]}}))])",
    "As this artifact enters, choose a creature type. This artifact enters with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it for each creature you control of the chosen type.\nCreatures you control of the chosen type get {{PTMod}} for each {{CounterType}} counter on this artifact": "AsPermanentEnters(ThisPermanent, [ChooseACreatureType, EntersWithNumberCounters(TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])), {{CounterType[0]}})]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, NumCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[1]}}, ThisPermanent))])",
    "As this artifact enters, choose an opponent and a card name other than a basic land card name.\nThe chosen player reveals each card they draw.\nWhen the chosen player draws a card with the chosen name, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatPlayer)}}": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [ChooseAPlayer(Opponent), ChooseACardName(Not(And([IsSupertype(Basic), IsCardtype(Land)])))]), PlayerEffect(TheChosenPlayer, [RevealsEachCardDrawn]), TriggerA(WhenAPlayerDrawsARevealedCard(SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer), IsNamed(TheChosenName)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
    "As this creature transforms into {{~Permanent}}, choose an opponent.\n{{FlavorWord}} - When the chosen player loses the game, you win the game.": "AsPermanentTransforms({{~Permanent}}, [ChooseAPlayer(Opponent)]), TriggerA(WhenAPlayerLosesTheGame(TheChosenPlayers), ActionList([WinTheGame]))",
    "As {{ThisPermanent}} enters, choose a creature type.\nSpells you cast of the chosen type cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast.\nWhen {{ThisPermanent}} enters and at the beginning of your upkeep, look at the top card of your library. If it's a card of the chosen type, you may reveal it and put it into your hand. If you don't put the card into your hand, you may put it into your graveyard": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [ChooseACreatureType]), PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType), {{CostReduce[0]}})]), TriggerA(Or([WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(SinglePlayer(You))]), ActionList([LookAtTopOfLibrary, MayCost(RevealTopCardOfLibraryAndPutIntoHand(IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType))), If(CostWasntPaid, [MayAction(PutTopOfLibraryInGraveyard)])]))",
    "Gift a card {{Reminder}}\n{{Keyword}}\nWhen this creature enters, if the gift was promised, {{TriggerActions}}": "Permanent_Gift([PlayerAction(TheGiftedPlayer, DrawACard)]), {{Keyword[0]}}, TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), TheGiftWasPromised, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Gift an Octopus {{Reminder}}\nAt the beginning of each end step, {{TriggerActions}}": "Permanent_Gift([PlayerAction(TheGiftedPlayer, CreateTokens([OctopusToken]))]), TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersEndStep(AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Web-slinging {{ManaCost}} {{Reminder}}\n{{Keyword}}\n{{FlavorWord}} - If {{~Permanent}} was cast using web-slinging, he enters with X {{CounterType}} counters on him, where X is the mana value of the returned creature": "WebSlinging(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), {{Keyword[0]}}, If(PermanentPassesFilter(ThisPermanent, WasCastUsingWebSlinging), [AsPermanentEnters(ThisPermanent, [EntersWithNumberCounters(ManaValueOfTheWebslungCreature, {{CounterType[0]}})])])",
    "When this enchantment enters, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}, {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}, and {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}. Then secretly choose {{Zombie}}, {{Zombie}}, or {{Zombie}}.\nSacrifice this enchantment, Reveal the creature type you chose: If target {{Creature}} is the chosen type, put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on it and it gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn":
      "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), ActionList([CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, []), TokenWithPT({{PT[1]}}, {{CreatureToken[1]}}, []), TokenWithPT({{PT[2]}}, {{CreatureToken[2]}}, [])]), SecretlyChooseACreatureTypeFromList([{{Zombie[0]}}, {{Zombie[1]}}, {{Zombie[2]}}])])), Activated(And([SacrificePermanent({{~Permanent}}), RevealTheSecretlyChosenCreatureType]), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}})], ActionList([If(PermanentPassesFilter(Ref_TargetPermanent, IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)), [PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent), CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)])])))",
    "When {{ThisPermanent}} enters, choose a land card name.\nActivated abilities of sources with the chosen name can't be activated unless they're mana abilities.\nLands with the chosen name have \"{{QuotedAbility}}\".": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), ActionList([ChooseACardName(IsCardtype(Land))])), ActivatedAbilityEffect(And([AbilityOfASource(IsNamed(TheChosenName)), NonManaAbility]), CantBeActivated), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Land), IsNamed(TheChosenName)]), [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])",
    "When {{~Permanent}} enters, exile up to one other target creature.\nWhenever another nontoken creature dies, you may exile it.\n{{LifeCost}}: Choose a creature card exiled with {{~Permanent}}.\n{{~Permanent}} has all activated and triggered abilities of the last chosen card": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), Targeted([UptoOneTargetPermanent(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature)]))], ActionList([Exile([Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)])]))), TriggerA(WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature)])), ActionList([MayAction(Exile([GraveyardCard(Trigger_ThatGraveyardCard)]))])), Activated({{LifeCost[0]}}, ActionList([ChooseAnExiledCard(And([IsCardtype(Creature), TheExiledCards]))])), PermanentLayerEffect(ThisPermanent, [AddAbilityFromExiledHasable(TheChosenExiledCard, [ActivatedAbility, TriggeredAbility])])",
    "{{FlavorWord}} - When {{~Permanent}} enters, choose a creature an opponent controls. Until end of turn, creatures other than {{~Permanent}} and the chosen creature get {{PTMod}}.\nWhen the chosen creature leaves the battlefield, transform {{~Permanent}}.": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), ActionList([ChooseAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)])), CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(And([IsCardtype(Creature), Other({{~Permanent}}), Other(ThePermanentChosenThisWay)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)])), TriggerA(WhenAPermanentLeavesTheBattlefield(TheChosenPermanents), ActionList([TransformPermanent(ThisPermanent)]))"
  },
  "{{MultilinePermanent[Artifact][Equipment](~Permanent)}}": {
    "Gift a tapped Fish {{Reminder}}\nWhen this Equipment enters, if the gift was promised, attach this Equipment to target {{Permanent}}.\n{{Line[Artifact][Equipment]}}\n{{Keyword[Equip]}}": "Permanent_Gift([PlayerAction(TheGiftedPlayer, DrawACard)]), TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), TheGiftWasPromised, Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([AttachPermanentToPermanent({{~Permanent}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), {{Line[Artifact][Equipment][0]}}, {{Keyword[Equip][0]}}"
  },
  "{{MultilinePermanent[EnchantedPermanent](~Permanent)}}": {
    "Gift a card {{Reminder}}\n{{Keyword[EnchantPermanent]}}\nWhen this Aura enters, tap {{EnchantedPermanent}}. If the gift wasn't promised, put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on it.\nYou control {{EnchantedPermanent}}.": "Permanent_Gift([PlayerAction(TheGiftedPlayer, DrawACard)]), {{Keyword[EnchantPermanent][0]}}, TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), ActionList([TapPermanent(HostPermanent), If(TheGiftWasntPromised, [PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, HostPermanent)])])), PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [SetController(You)])"
  },
  "{{MultilinePermanent[EquippedCreature](~Permanent)}}": {
    "As this Equipment becomes attached to a creature, choose a creature card name and a creature type.\n{{EquippedCreature}} has {{Hasable}}, it can't be blocked, and its name and creature type are the last chosen name and creature type": "AsPermanentBecomesAttachedToAPermanent(ThisPermanent, IsCardtype(Creature), [ChooseACardName(IsCardtype(Creature)), ChooseACreatureType]), PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), SetNameToTheChosenName, SetCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), PermanentRuleEffect(HostPermanent, [CantBeBlocked])"
  },
  "{{MultilinePlane(~Plane)}}": {
    "Whenever you planeswalk to {{~Plane}} and at the beginning of the first upkeep of the game, each player chooses green anchor or red waterfall.\nEach player who last chose green anchor may play an additional land during each of their turns.\nCreatures controlled by players who last chose red waterfall get {{PTMod}} and have {{Hasable}}.\nWhenever chaos ensues, each player who last chose green anchor chooses red waterfall, and vice versa": "TriggerA(Or([WhenAPlayerPlaneswalksToAPlane(SinglePlayer(You), SinglePlane({{~Plane}})), AtTheBeginningOfTheFirstUpkeepOfTheGame]), ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, ChooseWord([\"Green Anchor\", \"Red Waterfall\"]))])), EachPlayerEffect(ChoseWord(\"Green Anchor\"), [MayPlayAnAdditionalLand]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(ChoseWord(\"Red Waterfall\"))]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]), TriggerA(WhenChaosEnsues, ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SwapWordChoice(\"Green Anchor\", \"Red Waterfall\"))]))"
  },
  "{{MultilineSpellX}}": {
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may choose a creature type and behold {{Number}} creatures of that type.\nSearch your library for a creature card with mana value X or less, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. If this spell's additional cost was paid and the revealed card is the chosen type, put that card onto the battlefield instead of putting it into your hand":
      "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(And([ChooseACreatureType, BeholdNumber({{Number[0]}}, And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]))]), ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo(ValueX))])), RevealFoundCards, If(ACardOfTypeWasFoundThisWay(IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)), [PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersNormally])]), PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])])), NoAdditionalCost(ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo(ValueX))])), RevealFoundCards, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])]))]))"
  },
  "{{MultilineSpell}}": {
    "Teamwork {{RawDigits}} {{Reminder}}\nReveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield. If this spell was cast using teamwork, put any number of {{SpecificCards}} from among them onto the battlefield instead. Put the rest into your graveyard.":
      "SpellActions_Teamwork({{RawDigits[0]}}, CastUsingTeamwork(ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutAnyNumberOfCardsOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCards[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])), NotCastUsingTeamwork(ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersTapped]), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])))",
    "Teamwork {{RawDigits}} {{Reminder}}\nChoose one. If this spell was cast using teamwork, choose both instead.\n* {{FlavorWord}} - {{SpellActions}}.\n* {{FlavorWord}} - {{SpellActions}}.":
      "SpellActions_Teamwork({{RawDigits[0]}}, CastUsingTeamwork(Modal_ChooseBoth([{{SpellActions[0]}}, {{SpellActions[1]}}])), NotCastUsingTeamwork(Modal_ChooseOne([{{SpellActions[0]}}, {{SpellActions[1]}}])))",
    "Teamwork {{RawDigits}} {{Reminder}}\nChoose one. If this spell was cast using teamwork, choose both instead.\n* {{SpellActions}}.\n* {{SpellActions}}.":
      "SpellActions_Teamwork({{RawDigits[0]}}, CastUsingTeamwork(Modal_ChooseBoth([{{SpellActions[0]}}, {{SpellActions[1]}}])), NotCastUsingTeamwork(Modal_ChooseOne([{{SpellActions[0]}}, {{SpellActions[1]}}])))",
    "All {{Permanents}} get {{PTMod}} until end of turn.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil({{Permanents[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), WasntAwakened(ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil({{Permanents[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, choose a creature you control or a warped creature card you own in exile.\n{{~Spell}} deals damage equal to the power of the chosen creature or card to target creature.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(ChooseAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), Targeted([TargetPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, PowerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))]))), AdditionalCost(ChooseAnExiledCard(And([IsWarped, IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), Targeted([TargetPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, PowerOfExiledCard(Ref_TargetExiledCard), Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, choose a creature you control or reveal a creature card from your hand.\n{{~Spell}} deals damage equal to the power of the creature you chose or the card you revealed to target creature.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(ChooseAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), Targeted([TargetPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, PowerOfPermanent(ThePermanentChosenThisWay), Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))]))), AdditionalCost(RevealACardOfTypeFromHand(IsCardtype(Creature)), Targeted([TargetPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, PowerOfTheRevealedCard, Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, collect evidence X, where X is the total mana value of the permanents this spell targets.\nDestroy up to one target {{Permanent}}, up to one target {{Permanent}}, up to one target {{Permanent}}, and up to one target {{Permanent}}.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCostForAllTargets(CollectEvidence(TheTotalManaValueOfThePermanentsThisSpellTargets))), SpellActions(Targeted([UptoOneTargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), UptoOneTargetPermanent({{Permanent[1]}}), UptoOneTargetPermanent({{Permanent[2]}}), UptoOneTargetPermanent({{Permanent[3]}})], ActionList([DestroyEachPermanent(Or([SinglePermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1), SinglePermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2), SinglePermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent3), SinglePermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent4)]))])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\nDraw {{Number}} cards. If the discarded card wasn't a land card, {{~Spell}} deals {{Digits}} damage to each opponent.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(DiscardACard)), SpellActions(ActionList([DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), If(ACardWasDiscardedThisWay(IsNonCardtype(Land)), [SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, {{Digits[0]}}, EachPlayer(Opponent))])]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life.\nDestroy all artifacts and creatures with mana value X or less.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCostX(PayLife(ValueX))), SpellActions(ActionList([DestroyEachPermanent(And([Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Creature)]), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo(ValueX))]))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life.\nReturn each artifact and creature card with mana value X from your graveyard to the battlefield.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCostX(PayLife(ValueX))), SpellActions(ActionList([PutEachGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(And([Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Creature)]), ManaValueIs(EqualTo(ValueX))]), [EntersNormally])]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature or sacrifice a modified creature. {{Reminder}}\nDestroy target {{Permanent}}. If the modified creature was sacrificed, draw a card.": "SpellActions_AdditionalCostOptions([AdditionalCost(SacrificeAPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature)), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), AdditionalCost(SacrificeAPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature)), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), DrawACard])))])",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nChoose one or both -\n* Return target {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard to the battlefield if its power is less than or equal to the sacrificed creature's power.\n* Destroy target {{Permanent}}.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(SacrificeAPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature)))), SpellActions(Modal_ChooseOneOrBoth([Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([If(GraveyardCardPassesFilter(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, PowerIs(LessThanOrEqualTo(PowerOfTheSacrificedCreature))), [PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [EntersNormally])])])), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)]))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}.\nDestroy target {{Permanent}}. If the sacrificed permanent was a Vehicle, draw a card.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}))), SpellActions(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[1]}})], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), If(APermanentWasSacrificedThisWay(IsArtifactType(Vehicle)), [DrawACard])])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}.\nSearch your library for {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle. If it has mana value less than {{GameNumber[ThatSacrificedPermanent]}}, scry {{Digits}}.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}))), SpellActions(ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersNormally]), Shuffle]), If(PermanentPassesFilter(ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay, ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{GameNumber[ThatSacrificedPermanent][0]}}))), [Scry({{Digits[0]}})])]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, waterbend {{ManaCostSymbolX}}. {{Reminder}}\nExile X target creature cards from graveyards. For each creature card exiled this way, create a token that's a copy of it. At the beginning of your next end step, sacrifice those tokens.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(WaterbendX([{{ManaCostSymbolX[0]}}]))), SpellActions(Targeted([NumberTargetGraveyardCards(ValueX, IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([Exile([GraveyardCards(Ref_TargetGraveyardCards)]), CreateTokens([TokenCopyOfEachExiledCard(And([IsCardtype(Creature), TheCardsExiledThisWay]), NoTokenCopyEffects)]), CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheBeginningOfPlayersNextEndStep(You), ActionList([SacrificeEachPermanent(TheTokensCreatedThisWay)]))])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, waterbend {{ManaCostSymbolX}}. {{Reminder}}\nExile X target {{Permanents}}. Return those cards to the battlefield under their owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(WaterbendX([{{ManaCostSymbolX[0]}}]))), SpellActions(Targeted([NumberTargetPermanents(ValueX, {{Permanents[0]}})], ActionList([Exile([Permanents(Ref_TargetPermanents)]), CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheBeginningOfTheNextEndStep, ActionList([PutEachExiledCardOntoTheBattlefield(TheCardsExiledThisWay, [EntersUnderOwnersControl])]))])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, waterbend {{ManaCostSymbolX}}. {{Reminder}}\nTap up to X target {{Permanents}}, then distribute {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters among any number of {{Permanents}}.": "CastEffect(AdditionalCastingCost(WaterbendX([{{ManaCostSymbolX[0]}}]))), SpellActions(Targeted([UptoNumberTargetPermanents(ValueX, {{Permanents[0]}})], ActionList([TapEachPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanents), DistributeNumberCountersOfTypeAmongAnyNumberOfPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, {{Permanents[1]}})])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may behold a Dragon creature.\nDestroy target nonland permanent. If a Dragon creature was beheld, it perpetually gets {{PTMod}}.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(BeholdA(And([IsCreatureType(Dragon), IsCardtype(Creature)])), Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsNonCardtype(Land), IsPermanent]))], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), CreatePerpetualPermanentEffect(ThePermanentBeheldThisWay, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])]))), NoAdditionalCost(Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsNonCardtype(Land), IsPermanent]))], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may behold a Dragon.\nTarget player discards a card with the greatest mana value among cards in their hand. If a Dragon was beheld, exile that player's graveyard.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(BeholdA(IsCreatureType(Dragon)), Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, DiscardACardOfType(ManaValueIs(EqualTo(TheGreatestManaValueAmongCardsInPlayersHand(AnyCard, Ref_TargetPlayer))))), ExilePlayersGraveyard(Ref_TargetPlayer)]))), NoAdditionalCost(Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, DiscardACardOfType(ManaValueIs(EqualTo(TheGreatestManaValueAmongCardsInPlayersHand(AnyCard, Ref_TargetPlayer)))))])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may behold a Dragon. {{Reminder}}\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {{ManaCost}}. If a Dragon was beheld, counter that spell unless its controller pays {{ManaCost}} instead.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(BeholdA(IsCreatureType(Dragon)), Targeted([TargetSpell(AnySpell)], ActionList([PlayerMayCost(ControllerOfSpell(Ref_TargetSpell), PayMana({{ManaCost[1]}})), Unless(CostWasPaid, [CounterSpell(Ref_TargetSpell)])]))), NoAdditionalCost(Targeted([TargetSpell(AnySpell)], ActionList([PlayerMayCost(ControllerOfSpell(Ref_TargetSpell), PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), Unless(CostWasPaid, [CounterSpell(Ref_TargetSpell)])])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may behold a Dragon. {{Reminder}}\nTarget {{Creature}} deals damage equal to its power to target {{CreatureOrPlaneswalker}}. If a Dragon was beheld, surveil {{Digits}}.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(BeholdA(IsCreatureType(Dragon)), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}}), TargetPermanent({{CreatureOrPlaneswalker[0]}})], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage(Ref_TargetPermanent1, PowerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1), Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2)), Surveil({{Digits[0]}})]))), NoAdditionalCost(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}}), TargetPermanent({{CreatureOrPlaneswalker[0]}})], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage(Ref_TargetPermanent1, PowerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1), Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2))])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may behold a Dragon. {{Reminder}}\n{{~Spell}} deals {{Digits}} damage to target {{Creature}}. If a Dragon was beheld, you gain {{Digits}} life.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(BeholdA(IsCreatureType(Dragon)), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}})], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, {{Digits[0]}}, Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1)), GainLife({{Digits[0]}})]))), NoAdditionalCost(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}})], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, {{Digits[0]}}, Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1))])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may blight {{Digits}}. {{Reminder}}\nDestroy target {{Permanent}}. If this spell's additional cost was paid, you gain {{Digits}} life.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(Blight({{Digits[0]}}), Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), GainLife({{Digits[1]}})]))), NoAdditionalCost(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may blight {{Digits}}. {{Reminder}}\nExile the top {{Number}} cards of your library. If this spell's additional cost was paid, exile the top {{Number}} cards instead. Until the end of your next turn, you may play those cards.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(Blight({{Digits[0]}}), ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[1]}}), CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCards(TheCardsExiledThisWay)], UntilTheEndOfPlayersNextTurn(You))])), NoAdditionalCost(ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}), CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCards(TheCardsExiledThisWay)], UntilTheEndOfPlayersNextTurn(You))]))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may blight {{Digits}}. {{Reminder}}\n{{~Spell}} deals {{Digits}} damage to target creature. It deals {{Digits}} damage to that creature instead if this spell's additional cost was paid.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(Blight({{Digits[0]}}), Targeted([TargetPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, {{Digits[2]}}, Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))]))), NoAdditionalCost(Targeted([TargetPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, {{Digits[1]}}, Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may collect evidence {{Digits}}.\nDestroy all creatures. If evidence was collected, exile a card from an opponent's graveyard. Then search its owner's graveyard, hand, and library for any number of cards with that name and exile them. That player shuffles, then draws a card for each card exiled from their hand this way.": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(CollectEvidence({{Digits[0]}}))), SpellActions(ActionList([DestroyEachPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature)), If(EvidenceWasCollectedThisWay, [Exile([AGraveyardCard(InAPlayersGraveyard(Opponent))]), SearchPlayersLibraryAndGraveyardAndHand(OwnerOfExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay), [FindAnyNumberOfCardsOfType(SharesANameWithExiled(TheCardExiledThisWay)), ExileFoundCards, Shuffle]), PlayerAction(OwnerOfExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay), DrawNumberCards(NumHandCardsExiledThisWay))])]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may collect evidence {{Digits}}. {{Reminder}}\nEach opponent sacrifices a creature of their choice. If evidence was collected, instead each opponent sacrifices a creature with the greatest power among creatures they control.": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(CollectEvidence({{Digits[0]}}))), SpellActions(ActionList([IfElse(EvidenceWasCollectedThisWay, [EachPlayerAction(Opponent, SacrificeAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), PowerIs(EqualTo(TheGreatestPowerAmongPermanents(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(EachablePlayer))]))))])))], [EachPlayerAction(Opponent, SacrificeAPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature)))])]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may collect evidence {{Digits}}. {{Reminder}}\nSearch your library for {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. If evidence was collected, instead search your library for {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. Reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(CollectEvidence({{Digits[0]}}))), SpellActions(ActionList([IfElse(EvidenceWasCollectedThisWay, [SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType({{SpecificCard[1]}}), RevealFoundCards, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])], [SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType({{SpecificCard[0]}}), RevealFoundCards, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])])]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may collect evidence {{Digits}}. {{Reminder}}\nUntil end of turn, target {{ArtifactOrCreature}} becomes an artifact creature with base power and toughness {{PT}}. If evidence was collected, it has base power and toughness {{PT}} until end of turn instead.": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(CollectEvidence({{Digits[0]}}))), SpellActions(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{ArtifactOrCreature[0]}})], ActionList([IfElse(EvidenceWasCollectedThisWay, [CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent, [SetCardtypes([Artifact, Creature]), SetPT({{PT[1]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)], [CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent, [SetCardtypes([Artifact, Creature]), SetPT({{PT[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)])])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may pay {{ManaCost}} and/or {{ManaCost}} any number of times.\nDestroy target artifact. For each additional {{ManaCost}} you paid, destroy another target artifact. For each additional {{ManaCost}} you paid, destroy another target artifact, and you gain {{Digits}} life.": "CastEffect(OptionalAdditionalCastingCost(And([PayManaAnyNumberOfTimes({{ManaCost[0]}}), PayManaAnyNumberOfTimes({{ManaCost[1]}})]))), SpellActions(Targeted([TargetPermanent(IsCardtype(Artifact)), NumberTargetPermanents(EachAdditionalManaCostPaid({{ManaCost[2]}}), And([Other(Ref_TargetPermanent1), IsCardtype(Artifact)])), NumberTargetPermanents(EachAdditionalManaCostPaid({{ManaCost[2]}}), And([Other(Ref_TargetPermanent1), ExceptFor(Ref_TargetPermanents1), IsCardtype(Artifact)]))], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), DestroyEachPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanents1), DestroyEachPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanents2)])))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may waterbend {{ManaCost}}.\nYou control target opponent during their next combat phase. If this spell's additional cost was paid, you control that player during their next turn instead. {{Reminder}}\nExile {{~Spell}}.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(Waterbend({{ManaCost[0]}}), Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([GainControlOfPlayerDuringTheirNextTurn(Ref_TargetPlayer), ExileSpell(ThisSpell)]))), NoAdditionalCost(Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([GainControlOfPlayerDuringTheirNextCombatStep(Ref_TargetPlayer), ExileSpell(ThisSpell)])))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may waterbend {{ManaCost}}. {{Reminder}}\nAll {{Permanents}} get {{PTMod}} until end of turn. If this spell's additional cost was paid, whenever a creature dies this turn, you gain {{Digits}} life.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(Waterbend({{ManaCost[0]}}), ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil({{Permanents[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn), CreateTriggerUntil(WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies(IsCardtype(Creature)), ActionList([GainLife({{Digits[0]}})]), UntilEndOfTurn)])), NoAdditionalCost(ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil({{Permanents[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)]))]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may waterbend {{ManaCost}}. {{Reminder}}\nDraw {{Number}} cards. If this spell's additional cost was paid, instead shuffle your graveyard into your library, draw {{Number}} cards, and you have no maximum hand size for the rest of the game.\nExile {{~Spell}}.": "SpellActions(AdditionalCost_Modal([AdditionalCost(Waterbend({{ManaCost[0]}}), ActionList([ShuffleGraveyardIntoLibrary, DrawNumberCards({{Number[1]}}), CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [HasNoMaximumHandSize], UntilEndOfGame), ExileSpell(ThisSpell)])), NoAdditionalCost(ActionList([DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), ExileSpell(ThisSpell)]))]))",
    "Counter target {{Spell}}.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetSpell({{Spell[0]}}), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CounterSpell(Ref_TargetSpell), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), WasntAwakened(Targeted([TargetSpell({{Spell[0]}})], ActionList([CounterSpell(Ref_TargetSpell)]))))",
    "Destroy all {{Permanents}}.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([DestroyEachPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), WasntAwakened(ActionList([DestroyEachPermanent({{Permanents[0]}})])))",
    "Destroy target {{Permanent}}.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))), WasntAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)]))))",
    "Draw {{Number}} cards.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))), WasntAwakened(ActionList([DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}})])))",
    "Exile the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Until end of turn, you may cast spells from among them.\nIf this spell was cast from your hand, add {{Number}} mana of any one color.": "SpellActions(ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}), CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayCastSpellsFromAmongExiled(AnySpell, TheCardsExiledThisWay)], UntilEndOfTurn), If(CastSpellPassesFilter(WasCastFromTheirHand), [AddManaRepeated(AnyManaColor, {{Number[0]}})])]))",
    "Mayhem {{ManaCost}} {{Reminder}}\nAll {{Permanents}} get {{PTMod}} until end of turn. If this spell's mayhem cost was paid, {{Permanents}} get {{PTMod}} until end of turn instead.": "Mayhem(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), SpellActions(ActionList([IfElse(MayhemCostWasPaid, [CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil({{Permanents[1]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[1]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)], [CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil({{Permanents[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)])]))",
    "Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn by {{Creatures}} target opponent controls.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreatePreventDamageUntil(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByACreature(And([{{Creatures[0]}}, ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(Ref_TargetPlayer))])), [PreventThatDamage], UntilEndOfTurn), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), WasntAwakened(Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([CreatePreventDamageUntil(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByACreature(And([{{Creatures[0]}}, ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(Ref_TargetPlayer))])), [PreventThatDamage], UntilEndOfTurn)]))))",
    "Put target {{Permanent}} on top of its owner's library.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([PutPermanentOnTopOfOwnersLibrary(Ref_TargetPermanent1), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))), WasntAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([PutPermanentOnTopOfOwnersLibrary(Ref_TargetPermanent)]))))",
    "Put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on target {{Permanent}}.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent1), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))), WasntAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))))",
    "Return target {{Permanent}} to its owner's hand.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([PutPermanentIntoItsOwnersHand(Ref_TargetPermanent1), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))), WasntAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([PutPermanentIntoItsOwnersHand(Ref_TargetPermanent)]))))",
    "Take an extra turn after this one. Exile {{~Spell}}.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([TakeAnExtraTurn, ExileSpell(ThisSpell), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), WasntAwakened(ActionList([TakeAnExtraTurn, ExileSpell(ThisSpell)])))",
    "Tap target {{Permanent}}. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([TapPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1), PermanentDoesntUntapDuringControllersNextUntap(Ref_TargetPermanent1), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))), WasntAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([TapPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), PermanentDoesntUntapDuringControllersNextUntap(Ref_TargetPermanent)]))))",
    "Target opponent discards {{Number}} cards.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, DiscardNumberCards({{Number[0]}})), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), WasntAwakened(Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, DiscardNumberCards({{Number[0]}}))]))))",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Creature}} attacks this turn, it gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreateTriggerUntil(WhenACreatureAttacks({{Creature[0]}}), ActionList([CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Trigger_ThatCreature, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)]), UntilEndOfTurn), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)]))), WasntAwakened(ActionList([CreateTriggerUntil(WhenACreatureAttacks({{Creature[0]}}), ActionList([CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Trigger_ThatCreature, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)]), UntilEndOfTurn)])))",
    "You get {{Energy}}, then you may pay one or more {{EnergyCounters}}. If you do, each creature you control with power equal to the amount of {{EnergyCounters}} paid this way gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn.\nDestroy all {{Permanents}}.": "SpellActions(ActionList([GetEnergy(Integer({{Energy[0]}})), MayCost(PayOneOrMoreEnergy), If(CostWasPaid, [CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), PowerIs(EqualTo(TheAmountOfEnergyPaidThisWay))]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)]), DestroyEachPermanent({{Permanents[0]}})]))",
    "{{~Spell}} deals {{Digits}} damage to each {{Creature}}.\nAwaken {{Digits}}-{{ManaCost}}": "SpellActions_Awaken(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), WasAwakened(Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, {{Digits[0]}}, EachPermanent({{Creature[0]}})), AwakenPermanent({{Digits[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))), WasntAwakened(ActionList([SpellDealsDamage(ThisSpell, {{Digits[0]}}, EachPermanent({{Creature[0]}}))])))"
  },
