    "Each player secretly votes for up to one creature, then those votes are revealed. If no creature got votes, each player draws a card. Otherwise, destroy each creature with the most votes or tied for most votes": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SecretlyVoteForUptoOnePermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))), RevealVotesForPermanent, IfElse(NoVotesWereCastThisWay, [EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, DrawACard)], [DestroyEachPermanent(HasTheMostVotesOrTiedForTheMostVotes)])])",
