    "Earthbend X, where X is {{GameNumber}}. That land becomes {{a}} {{Swamp}} in addition to its other types": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([Earthbend(Ref_TargetPermanent, {{GameNumber[0]}}), CreatePermanentLayerEffect(Ref_TargetPermanent, [AddLandType({{Swamp[0]}})])]))",
