    "Exile target {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard. Create a token that's a copy of it, except it isn't legendary and is {{a}} {{Zombie}} in addition to its other types": "Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([Exile([GraveyardCard(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard)]), CreateTokens([TokenCopyOfGraveyardCard(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, TokenCopyEffects([RemoveSupertypes([Legendary]), AddCreatureTypes([{{Zombie[0]}}])]))])]))",
