    "For each opponent, gain control of up to one target {{Creature}} that player controls until end of turn. Untap those creatures. They gain {{Hasable}} until end of turn. The Ring tempts you": "Targeted([UptoOneTargetPermanentEachPlayerControls({{Creature[0]}}, Opponent)], ActionList([GainControlOfEachPermanentUntil(Ref_TargetPermanents, UntilEndOfTurn), CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(ThePermanentsGainedControlOfThisWay, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn), TemptWithRing]))",
