    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a permanent or player this turn, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} to that permanent or player instead": "ActionList([CreateReplaceWouldDealDamageUntil(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))], UntilEndOfTurn)])",
