    "Other creatures you control get {{PTMod}} until end of turn. Put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on each of them": "ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn), PutACounterOfTypeOnEachPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, ThePermanentsAffectedThisWay)])",
    "Pay any amount of {E}. If you paid one or more {E} this way, shuffle your library, then exile that many cards from the top. You may play one of those cards without paying its mana cost": "ActionList([PayAnyAmountOfEnergy, If(EnergyWasPaidThisWay, [Shuffle, ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(TheAmountOfEnergyPaidThisWay), MayAction(PlayACardFromExileWithoutPaying(TheCardsExiledThisWay))])])",
