    "As {{ThisPermanent}} enters, roll X d6. It enters with a number of {{CounterType}} counters on it equal to the total of those results": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [RollNumberD6({{X}}), EntersWithNumberCounters(TheTotalOfTheDiceResults, {{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "As {{~Permanent}} enters, exile up to X creature cards from your graveyard. It enters with {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on it for each creature card exiled this way": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [ExileUptoNumberGraveyardCards({{X}}, And([IsCardtype(Creature), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))])), EntersWithNumberCountersForEach({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, NumberOfCardsOfTypeExiledThisWay(IsCardtype(Creature)))])",
    "You may have {{ThisPermanent}} enter as a copy of any creature on the battlefield, except it enters with X additional {{CounterType}} counters on it": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [MayActions([EnterAsACopyOfAPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature), NoCopyEffects), EntersWithNumberCounters({{X}}, {{CounterType[0]}})])])",
    "{{ThisPermanent}} enters with X {{CounterType}} counters on it": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [EntersWithNumberCounters({{X}}, {{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "{{ThisPermanent}} enters with X {{CounterType}} counters on it. If X is {{Digits}} or more, it enters with an additional X {{CounterType}} counters on it": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [EntersWithNumberCounters({{X}}, {{CounterType[0]}}), IfPassesFilter(XIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}})), [EntersWithNumberCounters({{X}}, {{CounterType[0]}})])])",
    "{{ThisPermanent}} enters with a number of {{CounterType}} counters on it equal to {{Number}} minus X. If X is {{Digits}} or less, it enters tapped": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [EntersWithNumberCounters(Minus({{Number[0]}}, {{X}}), {{CounterType[0]}}), IfPassesFilter(XIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}})), [EntersTapped])])",
