    "If this creature was kicked, it enters with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it for each {{Eachable}}": "AsPermanentEnters({{~Permanent}}, [IfPassesFilter(WasKicked, [EntersWithNumberCounters({{Eachable[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}})])])",
