    "When {{~Permanent}} enters, put X {{CounterType}} counters on him. Then draw half X cards, rounded down": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), ActionList([PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(ValueX, {{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent), DrawNumberCards(HalfRoundedDown(ValueX))]))",
