    "Choose X target {{Creatures}}. For each of those creatures, its controller may pay {1} or {2}. If that player doesn't, destroy that creature at end of combat. If that player pays only {1}, prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by that creature this combat": "Targeted([NumberTargetPermanents({{X}}, {{Creatures[0]}})], ActionList([PlayerChoosesCostActionForEachPermanent(ControllerOfPermanent(EachablePermanent), Ref_TargetPermanents, [ActionOption(PayMana([ManaCostGeneric(1)]), [CreatePreventDamageUntil(Or([CombatDamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent(EachablePermanent)), CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByCreature(EachablePermanent)]), [PreventThatDamage], UntilEndOfCombat)]), ActionOption(PayMana([ManaCostGeneric(2)]), [DoNothing]), DoNothingOption([CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheNextEndOfCombat, ActionList([DestroyPermanent(EachablePermanent)]))])])]))",
    "Choose a color. X target {{Permanents}} gain protection from the chosen color until end of turn": "Targeted([NumberTargetPermanents({{X}}, {{Permanents[0]}})], ActionList([ChooseAColor(AnyColor), CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanents, [AddAbility([Protection(FromColor(TheChosenColor))])], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
    "Choose an opponent. You and that player each create {{a}} {{PTX}} {{CreatureToken}}.\nChoose an opponent. You and that player each create X {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}}": "ActionList([ChooseAPlayer(Opponent), EachPlayerAction(Or([SinglePlayer(You), SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer)]), CreateTokens([TokenWithPT(PTX({{PTX[0]}}, {{X}}), {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])), ChooseAPlayer(Opponent), EachPlayerAction(Or([SinglePlayer(You), SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer)]), CreateTokens([NumberTokens({{X}}, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, []))]))])",
