    "Exile any number of {{Permanents}}, then return them to the battlefield under their owner's control. Then repeat this process X more times": "ActionList([RepeatableActionsNumTimes(Plus(Integer(1), {{X}}), [ExileAnyNumberOfPermanents({{Permanents[0]}}), PutEachExiledCardOntoTheBattlefield(TheCardsExiledThisWay, [EntersUnderOwnersControl]), RepeatThisProcess])])",
