    "If X is {{Digits}}, scry {{Digits}}, then draw a card.\nIf X is {{Digits}}, you may choose a player. They return a creature they control to its owner's hand.\nIf X is {{Digits}}, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}.\nIf X is {{Digits}} or more, do all of the above": "ActionList([If(SpellXIs(EqualTo({{Digits[0]}})), [Scry({{Digits[1]}}), DrawACard]), If(SpellXIs(EqualTo({{Digits[2]}})), [MayCost(ChooseAPlayer(AnyPlayer)), If(CostWasPaid, [PlayerAction(TheChosenPlayer, PutAPermanentIntoItsOwnersHand(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))])))])]), If(SpellXIs(EqualTo({{Digits[3]}})), [CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])]), If(SpellXIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[4]}})), [Scry({{Digits[1]}}), DrawACard, MayCost(ChooseAPlayer(AnyPlayer)), If(CostWasPaid, [PlayerAction(TheChosenPlayer, PutAPermanentIntoItsOwnersHand(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))])))]), CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])])])",
    "If X is 1, seek {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} and put it onto the battlefield tapped.\nIf X is 2, each opponent sacrifices {{a}} {{Permanent}} of their choice.\nIf X is 3, conjure a random creature card with mana value X onto the battlefield.\nIf X is 4 or more, you gain {{Digits}} life. Then do all of the above": "ActionList([If(SpellXIs(EqualTo(Integer(1))), [SeekACard({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutCardFromHandOnBattlefield(TheCardSeekedThisWay, [EntersTapped])]), If(SpellXIs(EqualTo(Integer(2))), [EachPlayerAction(Opponent, SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}))]), If(SpellXIs(EqualTo(Integer(3))), [ConjureARandomCardOntoBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(EqualTo({{X}}))]), [EntersNormally])]), If(SpellXIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(Integer(4))), [GainLife({{Digits[0]}}), SeekACard({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutCardFromHandOnBattlefield(TheCardSeekedThisWay, [EntersTapped]), EachPlayerAction(Opponent, SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), ConjureARandomCardOntoBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(EqualTo({{X}}))]), [EntersNormally])])])",
    "If the {{ManaCost}} cost was paid, you draw {{Number}} cards, then an opponent creates {{Number}} Treasure tokens and they scry {{Digits}}. If that cost wasn't paid, you draw X cards": "ActionList([IfElse(CastSpellPassesFilter(AlternateCostWasPaid({{ManaCost[0]}})), [DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), APlayerActions(Opponent, [CreateTokens([NumberTokens({{Number[0]}}, TreasureToken)]), Scry({{Digits[0]}})])], [DrawNumberCards({{X}})])])",
