    "Put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on target creature. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on that creature instead": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([IfElse(CastSpellPassesFilter(WasCastFromAPlayersGraveyard(AnyPlayer)), [PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[1]}}, {{CounterType[1]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)], [PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent)])]))",
    "Put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on target creature you control, then it fights target creature you don't control. {{Reminder}}\n{{AbilityWord}} - If at least {{Number}} {{Black}} mana was spent to cast this spell, the creature you control gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Other(You))]))], ActionList([PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent1), HaveCreaturesFight(Ref_TargetPermanent1, Ref_TargetPermanent2), If(CastSpellPassesFilter(ManaAmountOfTypeWasSpentToCastIt(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Number[0]}}), {{Black[0]}})), [CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent1, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)])]))",
    "Return target {{CreatureCard}} from your graveyard to the battlefield. If {{ManaProduceSymbol}} was spent to cast this spell, that creature enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it": "Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{CreatureCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([IfElse(CastSpellPassesFilter(ManaWasSpentToCastIt([{{ManaProduceSymbol[0]}}])), [PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])], [PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [EntersNormally])])]))",
