    "Return up to one target {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard to the battlefield if {{ManaProduceSymbol}} was spent to cast this spell. {{Creatures}} target player controls get {{PTMod}} and gain {{Hasable}} until end of turn if {{ManaProduceSymbol}} was spent to cast this spell": "Targeted([UptoOneTargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))])), TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([If(CastSpellPassesFilter(ManaWasSpentToCastIt([{{ManaProduceSymbol[0]}}])), [PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [EntersNormally])]), If(CastSpellPassesFilter(ManaWasSpentToCastIt([{{ManaProduceSymbol[1]}}])), [CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(And([{{Creatures[0]}}, ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(Ref_TargetPlayer))]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)])]))",
    "Search your library for a card and put that card into your hand. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, instead search your library for {{Number}} cards and put those cards into your hand. Then shuffle": "ActionList([IfElse(CastSpellPassesFilter(WasCastFromAPlayersGraveyard(AnyPlayer)), [SearchLibrary([FindNumberGenericCards({{Number[0]}}), PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])], [SearchLibrary([FindAGenericCard, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])])])",
