    "Choose target creature you control and target Equipment. Gain control of that Equipment until end of turn. Attach it to the chosen creature. When you lose control of that Equipment this turn, if it's attached to a creature you control, unattach it": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), TargetPermanent(IsArtifactType(Equipment))], ActionList([GainControlOfPermanentUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent2, UntilEndOfTurn), AttachPermanentToPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2, Ref_TargetPermanent1), CreateTriggerUntilI(WhenAPlayerLosesControlOfAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), SinglePermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2)), PermanentPassesFilter(Ref_TargetPermanent2, AttachedToAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), ActionList([UnattachPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2)]), UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
    "Choose target creature you control and target creature an opponent controls.\n{{AbilityWord}} - If {{Condition}}, put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on the creature you control.\nThe creature you control deals damage equal to its power to the creature an opponent controls": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([If({{Condition[0]}}, [PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent1)]), PermanentDealsDamage(Ref_TargetPermanent1, PowerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1), Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2))]))",
