    "Choose target creature you control and target creature you don't control. If the creature you control entered this turn, put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it. Then those creatures fight each other": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Other(You))]))], ActionList([If(PermanentPassesFilter(Ref_TargetPermanent1, EnteredTheBattlefieldThisTurn), [PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, Ref_TargetPermanent1)]), HaveCreaturesFight(Ref_TargetPermanent1, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))",
