    "Choose target creature you control and target creature you don't control. The creature you control gets {{PTMod}} until end of turn if {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}. Then those creatures fight each other": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Other(You))]))], ActionList([If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=Ref_TargetPermanent1)[0]}}, [CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent1, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)]), HaveCreaturesFight(Ref_TargetPermanent1, Ref_TargetPermanent2)]))",
    "Choose target creature you control. Each other creature becomes a copy of that creature until end of turn, except it isn't legendary": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(And([Other(Ref_TargetPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature)]), [IsACopyOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent, CopyEffects([RemoveSupertypes([Legendary])]))], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
