    "Choose target permanent an opponent controls. Search that player's library for a card with the same name and put it onto the battlefield under your control. Then that player shuffles": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsPermanent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)]))], ActionList([SearchPlayersLibrary(ControllerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), [FindACardOfType(SharesANameWithPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersUnderPlayersControl(You)]), Shuffle])]))",
    "Choose target player and another target player. The first player controls the second player during the second player's next turn, and the second player controls the first player during the first player's next turn": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer), TargetPlayer(Other(Ref_TargetPlayer1))], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer1, GainControlOfPlayerDuringTheirNextTurn(Ref_TargetPlayer2)), PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer2, GainControlOfPlayerDuringTheirNextTurn(Ref_TargetPlayer1))]))",
