    "Choose target spell or ability with one or more targets. Roll a d20 and add {{GameNumber}}.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | You may choose new targets for that spell or ability.\n{{RawDigits}}+ | You may choose new targets for that spell or ability. Then copy it. You may choose new targets for the copy": "Targeted([TargetSpellOrAbility(HasOneOrMoreTargets)], ActionList([RollAD20, ValueActions(Plus(TheDiceResult, {{GameNumber[0]}}), [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [MayAction(ChooseNewTargetsForSpellOrAbility(Ref_TargetSpellOrAbility))]), ValueAction(ValueOrBigger({{RawDigits[2]}}), [MayAction(ChooseNewTargetsForSpellOrAbility(Ref_TargetSpellOrAbility)), CopySpellOrAbilityAndMayChooseNewTargets(Ref_TargetSpellOrAbility)])])]))",
    "Choose target spell or permanent that's {{Black}} or {{Black}}. Its owner puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their library": "Targeted_Modal([Targeted([TargetSpell(Or([IsColor({{Black[0]}}), IsColor({{Black[1]}})]))], ActionList([PlayerAction(OwnerOfSpell(Ref_TargetSpell), ReturnSpellToTopOrBottomOfLibrary(Ref_TargetSpell))])), Targeted([TargetPermanent(Or([IsColor({{Black[0]}}), IsColor({{Black[1]}})]))], ActionList([PlayerAction(OwnerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), ReturnPermanentToTopOrBottomOfLibrary(Ref_TargetPermanent))]))])",
    "Choose target {{Artifact}}. Each other {{Artifact}} becomes a copy of that artifact until end of turn": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Artifact[0]}})], ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(And([Other(Ref_TargetPermanent), {{Artifact[1]}}]), [IsACopyOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent, NoCopyEffects)], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
