    "Choose target {{Creature}}. If a spell or ability that targets that creature would cause a source to deal damage to that creature this turn, prevent that damage": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}})], ActionList([CreatePreventDamageUntil(ASpellOrAbilityWouldCauseASourceToDealDamageToRecipient(TargetsPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), AnyDamageSource, Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)), [PreventThatDamage], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
