    "Each player draws {{Number}} cards, then discards {{Number}} cards, then loses {{Digits}} life": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), DiscardNumberCards({{Number[1]}}), LoseLife({{Digits[0]}})])])",
    "Each player exiles all {{SpecificCards}} from their graveyard, then sacrifices all {{Permanents}} they control, then puts all cards they exiled this way onto the battlefield": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, ExileEachCardFromPlayersGraveyard({{SpecificCards[0]}}, ActionPlayer)), EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SacrificeEachPermanent({{Permanents[0]}})), EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, PutEachExiledCardOntoTheBattlefield(WasExiledByPlayerThisWay(ActionPlayer), [EntersNormally]))])",
    "Each player exiles {{Number}} cards from their hand": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, ExileNumberCardsFromHand({{Number[0]}}))])",
    "Each player hides at least one item, then all players reveal them simultaneously. Each player loses life equal to the number of items they revealed. The player who revealed the fewest items then loses half their life, rounded up. If two or more players are tied for fewest, each loses half their life, rounded up": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SecretlyChooseANumberGreaterThanNumber(1)), RevealSecretlyChosenNumbers, EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, LoseLife(PlayersChosenNumber(ActionPlayer))), EachPlayerAction(ChoseLowestNumber, LoseLife(HalfRoundedUp(LifeTotalOfPlayer(ActionPlayer))))])",
    "Each player looks at the top {{Number}} cards of their library and may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} and/or {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them. Each player puts the cards they revealed this way into their hand and the rest on the bottom of their library in a random order. Each player gains {{Digits}} life": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealMultipleCardsOfTypeAndPutIntoHand([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, {{SpecificCard[1]}}]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), GainLife({{Digits[0]}})])])",
    "Each player loses a third of their life, then discards a third of the cards in their hand, then sacrifices a third of the creatures they control of their choice, then sacrifices a third of the lands they control of their choice. Round up each time": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [LoseLife(ThirdRoundedUp(LifeTotalOfPlayer(ActionPlayer))), DiscardNumberCards(ThirdRoundedUp(TheNumberOfCardsInPlayersHand(ActionPlayer))), SacrificeNumberPermanents(ThirdRoundedUp(TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))]))), IsCardtype(Creature)), SacrificeNumberPermanents(ThirdRoundedUp(TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))]))), IsCardtype(Land))])])",
    "Each player loses half their life, then discards half the cards in their hand, then sacrifices half the creatures they control of their choice. Round up each time": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [LoseLife(HalfRoundedUp(LifeTotalOfPlayer(ActionPlayer))), DiscardNumberCards(HalfRoundedUp(TheNumberOfCardsInPlayersHand(ActionPlayer))), SacrificeNumberPermanents(HalfRoundedUp(TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))]))), IsCardtype(Creature))])])",
    "Each player loses half their life, then discards half the cards in their hand, then sacrifices half the permanents they control of their choice. Round down each time": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [LoseLife(HalfRoundedDown(LifeTotalOfPlayer(EachablePlayer))), DiscardNumberCards(HalfRoundedDown(TheNumberOfCardsInPlayersHand(EachablePlayer))), SacrificeNumberPermanents(HalfRoundedDown(TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([IsPermanent, ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(EachablePlayer))]))), IsPermanent)])])",
