    "Each player may exile any number of cards from their graveyard. Then each player loses {{Digits}} life for each {{Eachable(ThatPlayer)}}.\nDraw a card": "ActionList([EachPlayerMayAction(AnyPlayer, ExileAnyNumberOfCardsFromPlayersGraveyard(AnyCard, ActionPlayer)), EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, LoseLifeForEach({{Digits[0]}}, {{Eachable(ThatPlayer=ActionPlayer)[0]}})), DrawACard])",
