    "Each player may reveal any number of {{SpecificCards}} from their hand. Then each player creates {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} for each card they revealed this way": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [RevealAnyNumberOfCardsOfTypeFromHand({{SpecificCards[0]}}), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(TheNumberOfCardsInHandRevealedByPlayerThisWay(ActionPlayer), TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, []))])])])",
    "Each player mills {{Number}} cards": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, MillNumberCards({{Number[0]}}))])",
    "Each player mills {{Number}} cards. For each player, choose {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} in that player's graveyard. Put those cards onto the battlefield under your control. Then each {{Creature}} becomes {{a}} {{Zombie}} in addition to its other types": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, MillNumberCards({{Number[0]}})), ChooseACardInEachPlayersGraveyard({{SpecificCard[0]}}, AnyPlayer), PutEachGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(TheChosenGraveyardCards, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(You)]), CreateEachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})])])",
    "Each player mills {{Number}} cards. Then you put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, MillNumberCards({{Number[0]}})), PutACardFromAGraveyardOnBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, AnyPlayer, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(You)])])",
    "Each player mills {{Number}} cards. Then you put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. It's an artifact in addition to its other types.\n{{AbilityWord}} - Starting with you, each player votes for planeswalk or chaos. If planeswalk gets more votes, planeswalk. If chaos gets more votes or the vote is tied, chaos ensues": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, MillNumberCards({{Number[0]}})), PutACardFromAGraveyardOnBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, AnyPlayer, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(You), EntersWithLayerEffect([AddCardtype(Artifact)])]), EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [VoteForAWord([\"Planeswalk\", \"Chaos\"])]), If(MostVotesForWordIs(\"Planeswalk\"), [Planeswalk]), If(MostVotesOrTiedForMostVotesForWordIs(\"Chaos\"), [ChaosEnsues])])",
    "Each player mills {{Number}} cards. Then you return up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from your graveyard to your hand": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, MillNumberCards({{Number[0]}})), PutUptoNumberCardsFromGraveyardToHand({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}})])",
    "Each player other than target player creates {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}}": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(Other(Ref_TargetPlayer), CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}])]))])",
    "Each player puts {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on a creature they control and sacrifices the rest. Each of those creatures can't attack you or planeswalkers you control for as long as it has {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [PutACounterOfTypeOnAPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))])), SacrificeEachPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ExceptFor(HadCountersPutOnItThisWay)]))]), CreateEachPermanentRuleEffectUntil(HadCountersPutOnItThisWay, [CantAttackPlayerOrPlaneswalkerControlledBy(You)], UntilItDoesntHaveACounterOfType({{CounterType[1]}}))])",
