    "Each player returns to the battlefield all {{SpecificCards}} in their graveyard that were put there from the battlefield this turn": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, ReturnEachCardFromPlayersGraveyardToBattlefieldThatWasPutThereFromBattlefieldThisTurn({{SpecificCards[0]}}, ActionPlayer, [EntersNormally]))])",
