    "Each player reveals a number of cards from the top of their library equal to {{GameNumber(ThatPlayer)}}, puts all {{SpecificCards}} they revealed this way onto the battlefield, and puts the rest into their graveyard": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{GameNumber(ThatPlayer=EachablePlayer)[0]}}, [PutEachCardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCards[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard]))])",
    "Each player reveals the top card of their library. For each {{SpecificCard}} revealed this way, you create a {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}}. Then each player draws a card": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, RevealTopCardOfLibrary), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(NumLibraryCardsRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}]))]), EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, DrawACard)])",
