    "Each player sacrifices X {{Permanents}} of their choice and you gain X life, where X is this spell's intensity.\nAll {{SpecificCards}} you own intensify by {{Digits}}": "ActionList([CreateValueX(IntensityOfSpell(ThisSpell)), EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SacrificeNumberPermanents(ValueX, {{Permanents[0]}})), GainLife(ValueX), PerpetuallyIncreaseIntensityOfCardsOwnedByPlayer({{SpecificCards[0]}}, You, {{Digits[0]}})])",
