    "Each player sacrifices a creature of their choice. If you sacrificed a creature this way, you may return another permanent card from your graveyard to the battlefield": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SacrificeAPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))), If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, SacrificedAPermanentThisWay(IsCardtype(Creature))), [MayAction(PutACardFromPlayersGraveyardOnBattlefield(And([Not(WasPutIntoGraveyardByPlayerThisWay(You)), IsPermanent]), You, [EntersNormally]))])])",
    "Each player sacrifices a nontoken creature of their choice. Roll a d20 and add the toughness of the creature you sacrificed this way.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Return a creature card put into a graveyard this way to the battlefield under your control.\n{{RawDigits}}+ | Return up to {{Number}} creature cards put into graveyards this way to the battlefield under your control": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SacrificeAPermanent(And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature)]))), RollAD20, ValueActions(Plus(TheDiceResult, TheTotalPowerOfThePermanentsSacrificedThisWay), [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [ReturnACardFromAnyPlayersGraveyardToBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), WasPutIntoGraveyardThisWay]), AnyPlayer, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(You)])]), ValueAction(ValueOrBigger({{RawDigits[2]}}), [ReturnUptoNumberCardsFromAmongPlayersGraveyardsToBattlefield({{Number[0]}}, And([IsCardtype(Creature), WasPutIntoGraveyardThisWay]), AnyPlayer, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(You)])])])])",
    "Each player sacrifices all artifacts, enchantments, and nonbasic lands they control. For each land sacrificed this way, its controller may search their library for {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then each player who searched their library this way shuffles": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SacrificeEachPermanent(Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Enchantment), And([IsNonSupertype(Basic), IsCardtype(Land)])]))), EachPlayerMayAction(SacrificedAPermanentThisWay(IsCardtype(Land)), SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType(TheNumberOfPermanentsOfTypeSacrificedThisWay(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))])), {{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle]))])",
    "Each player sacrifices all {{Permanents}} they control that are one or more colors": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SacrificeEachPermanent(IsColored))])",
    "Each player sacrifices the creature they control with the greatest mana value unless they pay that creature's mana cost. If two or more creatures a player controls are tied for greatest, that player chooses one": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, ChooseAPermanent(APermanentWithTheHighestManaValue(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))])))), EachPlayerMayCost(ChoseAPermanentThisWay, PayManaCostOfPermanent(ThePermanentChosenByPlayerThisWay(ActionPlayer))), EachPlayerAction(And([ChoseAPermanentThisWay, DidntPayCost]), SacrificePermanent(ThePermanentChosenByPlayerThisWay(ActionPlayer)))])",
