    "Each player sacrifices {{a}} {{Permanent}} of their choice. If you sacrificed a permanent this way, you may return another {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard to your hand": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, SacrificedAPermanentThisWay(AnyPermanent)), [PutACardFromGraveyardIntoHandExceptForGraveyardCard({{SpecificCard[0]}}, ThePermanentSacrificedThisWay)])])",
