    "Each player secretly chooses a creature they control and a creature they don't control. Then those choices are revealed. Destroy each creature chosen this way": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SecretlyChooseAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByPlayer(EachPlayerAction_ThatPlayer)]))), EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SecretlyChooseAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Other(EachPlayerAction_ThatPlayer))]))), RevealSecretlyChosenPermanents, DestroyEachPermanent(TheSecretlyChosenPermanents)])",
    "Each player secretly votes for {{a}} {{Creature}}, then those votes are revealed. For each creature with one or more votes, put that many {{CounterType}} counters on it, then tap it": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SecretlyVoteForAPermanent({{Creature[0]}})), RevealVotesForPermanent, ForEachPermanentPutANumberOfCountersOfTypeOnIt(ReceivedAVote, TheNumberOfVotesReceivedByPermanent(EachablePermanent), {{CounterType[0]}}), TapEachPermanent(ReceivedAVote)])",
    "Each player separates all nontoken lands they control into two piles. For each player, one of their piles is chosen by one of their opponents of their choice. Destroy all lands in the chosen piles. Tap all lands in the other piles": "ActionList([EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, SeparatePermanentsIntoTwoPilesAndAPlayerChoosesAPile(And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))]), OpponentOf(ActionPlayer))), DestroyEachPermanent(InTheChosenPile), TapEachPermanent(NotInTheChosenPile)])",
    "Each player shuffles all creatures they own into their library. Each player who shuffled a nontoken creature into their library this way reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, then puts that card onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of their library in a random order": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [ShuffleEachPermanentIntoLibrary(And([IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))]))]), EachPlayerActions(ShuffledAPermanentIntoTheirLibraryThisWay(And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature)])), [RevealCardsFromTheTopOfLibraryUntilACardOfTypeIsRevealed({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [PutTheCardFoundThisWayOntoTheBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])])",
    "Each player shuffles all permanents they own into their library, then reveals that many cards from the top of their library. Each player puts all {{SpecificCards}} revealed this way onto the battlefield, then does the same for {{SpecificCards}}, then puts all cards revealed this way that weren't put onto the battlefield on the bottom of their library": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [ShuffleEachPermanentIntoLibrary(OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(ActionPlayer))), RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(NumPermanentsShuffledIntoLibraryThisWayByPlayer(ActionPlayer), [PutEachCardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCards[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutEachCardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCards[1]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])])",
    "Each player shuffles the cards from their hand into their library, then draws that many cards": "ActionList([EachPlayerActions(AnyPlayer, [ShuffleHandIntoLibrary, DrawNumberCards(NumCardsShuffledIntoLibraryThisWay)])])",
