    "Exile target {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard. {{Creatures}} get {{PTModX}} until end of turn, where X is that card's mana value. Whenever {{a}} {{Creature}} deals combat damage to a player this turn, copy the exiled card. You may cast the copy without paying its mana cost": "Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([ExileGraveyardCard(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard), CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, ManaValueOfGraveyardCard(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard))], UntilEndOfTurn), CreateTriggerUntil(WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer({{Creature[0]}}, AnyPlayer), ActionList([CopyExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay), MayAction(CastCopiedCardWithoutPaying)]), UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
