    "Exile target {{Spell}}, then roll a d20 and add that spell's mana value.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | You may cast the exiled card for as long as it remains exiled, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast that spell.\n{{RawDigits}}+ | You may cast the exiled card without paying its mana cost for as long as it remains exiled": "Targeted([TargetSpell({{Spell[0]}})], ActionList([ExileSpell(Ref_TargetSpell), RollAD20, ValueActions(Plus(TheDiceResult, ManaValueOfSpell(Ref_TargetSpell)), [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayCastExiledCardAndMaySpendManaAsThoughAnyColorToCast(TheCardExiledThisWay)], UntilCardIsNoLongerExiled(TheCardExiledThisWay))]), ValueAction(ValueOrBigger({{RawDigits[2]}}), [CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayCastExiledCardWithoutPaying(TheCardExiledThisWay)], UntilCardIsNoLongerExiled(TheCardExiledThisWay))])])]))",
