    "Exile the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, you may put it onto the battlefield. If you do, repeat this process": "ActionList([RepeatableActions([ExileTopCardOfLibrary, If(ACardWasExiledThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [MayCost(PutExiledCardOntoBattlefield(TheCardExiledThisWay, [EntersNormally])), If(CostWasPaid, [RepeatThisProcess])])])])",
