    "Exile the top {{Number}} cards of your library in a face-down pile, then exile the top {{Number}} cards of your library in a face-up pile. An opponent chooses one of those piles. Put that pile into your graveyard. Look at the cards in the other pile. You may cast a spell from among them without paying its mana cost. Put the rest into your hand": "ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibraryInFaceDownPile({{Number[0]}}), ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibraryInFaceUpPile({{Number[1]}}), APlayerAction(Opponent, ChooseAnExiledPile), PutExiledCardsIntoOwnersGraveyards(InTheExiledPileChosenThisWay), LookAtFaceDownExiledCards(InTheExiledPileNotChosenThisWay), MayAction(CastASpellFromExileWithoutPaying(AnySpell, InTheExiledPileNotChosenThisWay)), PutExiledCardsIntoOwnersHand(InTheExiledPileNotChosenThisWay)])",
