    "Exile the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put a land card from among them onto the battlefield. Until end of turn, for each nonland card type, you may cast a spell of that type from among the exiled cards without paying its mana cost": "ActionList([ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}), MayAction(ReturnAnExiledCardToBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Land), WasExiledThisWay]), [EntersNormally])), CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayCastASpellOfEachNonlandCardtypeFromAmongExiledCardsWithoutPaying(WasExiledThisWay)], UntilEndOfTurn)])",
