    "Gain control of all {{Creatures}} until end of turn. Untap those creatures. They gain {{Hasable}} until end of turn": "ActionList([GainControlOfEachPermanent({{Creatures[0]}}), UntapEachPermanent(ThePermanentsGainedControlOfThisWay), CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(ThePermanentsGainedControlOfThisWay, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)])",
