    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of target opponent's library. Put one of those cards into that player's graveyard and the rest on top of their library in any order": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfPlayersLibrary(Ref_TargetPlayer, {{Number[0]}}, [PutAGenericCardIntoGraveyard, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTopOfLibraryInAnyOrder])]))",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of target player's library, then put them back in any order. You may have that player shuffle": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfPlayersLibrary(Ref_TargetPlayer, {{Number[0]}}, [PutTheRemainingCardsOnTopOfLibraryInAnyOrder]), MayHavePlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, Shuffle)]))",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of target player's library, then put them back in any order. You may have that player shuffle.\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfPlayersLibrary(Ref_TargetPlayer, {{Number[0]}}, [PutTheRemainingCardsOnTopOfLibraryInAnyOrder]), MayHavePlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, Shuffle), CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheBeginningOfTheNextTurnsUpkeep, ActionList([DrawACard]))]))",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of target player's library. Exile any number of those cards, then put the rest back in any order": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfPlayersLibrary(Ref_TargetPlayer, {{Number[0]}}, [ExileAnyNumberOfGenericCards, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTopOfLibraryInAnyOrder])]))",
