    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library and separate them into a face-down pile and a face-up pile. An opponent chooses one of the piles. Put that pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [SeparateIntoFaceUpFileAndFaceDownPile, APlayerChoosesAPileTopPutIntoHand(Opponent), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library, cloak {{Number}} of them, and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [CloakNumberGenericCards({{Number[1]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library, exile up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from among them, then shuffle. Target opponent may choose one of the exiled cards and put it onto the battlefield under their control. Put the rest onto the battlefield under your control": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayExileUptoNumberCardsOfType({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsBackIntoLibraryAndShuffle]), PlayerMayAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, ReturnAnExiledCardToBattlefield(TheCardsExiledThisWay, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(ActionPlayer)])), PutEachExiledCardOntoTheBattlefield(TheCardsExiledThisWay, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(You)])]))",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library, then put them back in any order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutTheRemainingCardsOnTopOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
