    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. As many times as you choose, you may pay {{Digits}} life, put those cards on the bottom of your library in any order, then look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Then shuffle and put the last cards you looked at this way on top in any order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [RepeatableActions([MayCost(PayLife({{Digits[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder, LookAtTheNextNumberCardsOnTopOfLibrary({{Number[1]}}), RepeatThisProcess])]), ShuffleAndPutTheRemainingCardsOnTopOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Choose one of them and put all cards with the same name as the chosen card from among them into your hand. You lose {{Digits}} life for each card put into your hand this way. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutAGenericCardAndAllCardsWithTheSameNameIntoHand, LoseLifeForEach({{Digits[0]}}, TheNumberOfCardsPutIntoHandThisWay), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. You may cast the exiled card without paying its mana cost if it's {{a}} {{PotentialSpell}}. If you don't, put that card into your hand": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [ExileAGenericCardFaceDown, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), MayCost(CastSpellFromExileWithoutPaying({{PotentialSpell[0]}}, TheCardExiledThisWay)), Unless(CostWasPaid, [PutExiledCardIntoOwnersHand(TheCardExiledThisWay)])])",
