    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. If {{Condition}}, put {{Number}} of those cards into your hand. Otherwise, put one of them into your hand. Then put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order": "ActionList([IfElse({{Condition[0]}}, [LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutNumberGenericCardsIntoHand({{Number[1]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])], [LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutAGenericCardIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Manifest one of those cards, then put the other on the top or bottom of your library": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [ManifestAGenericCard, PutRemainingCardsOnTheTopOrBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
