    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put {{Number}} of them into your hand and the other into your graveyard": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutNumberGenericCardsIntoHand({{Number[1]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
