    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may exile {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them. If you do, it becomes plotted. Put the rest into your hand": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayExileACardOfType({{SpecificCard[0]}}), CreateExiledCardEffect(TheCardExiledThisWay, [IsPlotted]), PutRemainingCardsInHand])])",
