    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutUptoNumberCardsOntoTheBattlefield({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield tapped. If you don't, put a card from among them into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayCost(PutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersTapped])), Unless(CostWasPaid, [PutAGenericCardIntoHand]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield, then conjure a duplicate of that card onto the battlefield. The duplicate perpetually has base power and toughness {{PT}}. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), ConjureADuplicateOfCardOntoTheBattlefield(TheCardPutOntoTheBattlefieldThisWay, [EntersNormally]), CreatePerpetualPermanentEffect(TheCardConjuredOntoTheBattlefieldThisWay, [SetPT({{PT[0]}})]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield. If that card has mana value {{Digits}} or less, it enters with {{Number}} additional {{CounterType}} counters on it. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [If(EnteringPermanentPassesFilter(ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))), [EntersWithNumberCounters({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}})])]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. When a creature is put onto the battlefield this way, it deals damage equal to {{GameNumber(ThatCreature)}} to target {{Creature}}": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), If(APermanentWasPutOntoTheBattlefieldThisWay(IsCardtype(Creature)), [ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}})], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage(ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay, {{GameNumber(ThatCreature=ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay)[0]}}, Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))])))])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal any number of {{SpecificCards}} from among them and put the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealAnyNumberOfCardOfTypeAndPutOnTopOfLibrary({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal any number of {{SpecificCards}} from among them and put the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealAnyNumberOfCardOfTypeAndPutOnTopOfLibrary({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal any number of {{SpecificCards}} from among them and put them into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealAnyNumberOfCardOfTypeAndPutOnTopOfLibrary({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal up to two creature and/or land cards from among them, then put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. Put all land cards revealed this way onto the battlefield tapped and put all creature cards revealed this way into your hand": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealUptoNumberCardsOfTypeAndSetAside(Integer(2), Or([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCardtype(Land)])), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder, PutSetAsideCardsOfTypeOntoBattlefield(IsCardtype(Land), [EntersTapped]), PutRemainingSetAsideCardsIntoHand])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from among them and put the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealUptoNumberCardsOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from among them and put them into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealUptoNumberCardsOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
