    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. If {{Condition}}, you may instead reveal {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from among them and put them into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [IfElse({{Condition[0]}}, [MayRevealUptoNumberCardsOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}})], [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}})]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. Create {{Number}} {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}}": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), CreateTokens([NumberTokens({{Number[1]}}, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, []))])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. Create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. If you didn't put a card into your hand this way, draw a card": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), Unless(ACardWasPutIntoHandThisWay(AnyCard), [DrawACard])])",
