    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order. You gain {{Digits}} life": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder]), GainLife({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. Then put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
    "Look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them. If that card has mana value {{Digits}} or less, you may put it onto the battlefield and it gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn. If you didn't put the revealed card onto the battlefield this way, put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayActions([RevealACardOfType({{SpecificCard[0]}}), If(ACardWasRevealedThisWay(ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))), [MayActions([PutFoundCardOntoBattlefield([EntersNormally]), CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)])]), PutFoundCardIntoHand]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Manifest dread": "ActionList([ManifestDread])",
