    "Manifest dread. {{Reminder}}\nYou may return {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard to your hand": "ActionList([ManifestDread, MayAction(PutACardFromGraveyardIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}))])",
