    "Manifest the top card of your library, then put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on it": "ActionList([ManifestTheTopCardOfPlayersLibrary(You), PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay)])",
