    "Mill {{Number}} cards, then return a land card or {{Zombie}} card from your graveyard to your hand. If you can't, draw a card": "ActionList([MillNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), MustCost(PutACardFromGraveyardIntoHand(Or([IsCardtype(Land), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})]))), Unless(CostWasPaid, [DrawACard])])",
