    "Mill {{Number}} cards. Then put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield": "ActionList([MillNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), PutACardOfTypeMilledThisWayOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally])])",
    "Mill {{Number}} cards. Then starting with the next opponent in turn order, each opponent chooses a creature card in your graveyard that hasn't been chosen. Return each card chosen this way to the battlefield under your control": "ActionList([MillNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), EachPlayerStartingWithAction(Opponent, NextOpponentInTurnOrder, [ChooseAGraveyardCardThatHasntBeenChosen(And([IsCardtype(Creature), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))]), PutEachGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(TheGraveyardCardsChosenThisWay, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(You)])])",
