    "Reveal the cards in your library. An opponent chooses from among them {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, and {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. You put the chosen cards into your hand. Then shuffle": "ActionList([RevealLibrary([APlayerChoosesMultipleCardsOfType(Opponent, [{{SpecificCard[0]}}, {{SpecificCard[1]}}, {{SpecificCard[2]}}]), PutTheChosenCardsIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsBackIntoLibraryAndShuffle])])",
    "Reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is {{GameNumber}}. You may put any number of {{SpecificCards}} from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{GameNumber[0]}}, [MayPutAnyNumberOfCardsOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCards[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Reveal the top card of target opponent's library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, you gain {{Digits}} life. Then that player shuffles.\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([RevealTheTopCardOfPlayersLibrary(Ref_TargetPlayer), If(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [GainLife({{Digits[0]}})]), PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, Shuffle), CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheBeginningOfTheNextTurnsUpkeep, ActionList([DrawACard]))]))",
    "Reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You lose life equal to its mana value. You may repeat this process any number of times": "ActionList([RepeatableActions([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, PutTopOfLibraryInHand, LoseLife(ManaValueOfTheCardRevealedThisWay), MayAction(RepeatThisProcess)])])",
    "Reveal the top five cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand. Then choose an opponent. They put one on the bottom of your library. Then you put one into your hand. Then they put one on the bottom of your library. Put the other into your hand": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(Integer(5), [PutAGenericCardIntoHand, ChooseAPlayer(Opponent), PlayerAction(ThePlayerChosenThisWay, PutAGenericCardOnBottomOfLibrary), PutAGenericCardIntoHand, PlayerAction(ThePlayerChosenThisWay, PutAGenericCardOnBottomOfLibrary), PutRemainingCardsInHand])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library and put one of them into your hand. You gain life equal to that card's mana value. Put all other cards revealed this way into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutAGenericCardIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard]), GainLife(ManaValueOfCardPutInHandThisWay)])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library and separate them into two piles. An opponent chooses one of those piles. Put a card from the chosen pile into your hand, then put all other cards revealed this way on the bottom of your library in any order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [SeperateThoseCardsIntoTwoPiles, APlayerChoosesAPile(Opponent), PutAGenericCardFromTheChosenPileIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library and separate them into two piles. An opponent chooses one of those piles. Put that pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [SeperateThoseCardsIntoTwoPiles, APlayerChoosesAPile(Opponent), PutTheChosenPileIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library and separate them into two piles. An opponent chooses one of those piles. Put that pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard. Create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}}, then put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it for each card put into your graveyard this way": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [SeperateThoseCardsIntoTwoPiles, APlayerChoosesAPile(Opponent), PutTheChosenPileIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard]), CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}])]), PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(NumberOfCardsPutIntoGraveyardThisWay, {{CounterType[0]}}, TheTokenCreatedThisWay)])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. An opponent chooses one of them. Put that card into your graveyard and the rest into your hand": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [APlayerChoosesAGenericCard(Opponent), PutTheChosenCardIntoGraveyard, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoHand])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. An opponent chooses {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them. Put that card onto the battlefield and the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [APlayerChoosesACardOfType(Opponent, {{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheChosenCardOntoTheBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. An opponent exiles {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them, then you put the rest into your hand. That opponent may cast the exiled card without paying its mana cost": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [APlayerExilesACardOfType(Opponent, {{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoHand]), PlayerMayAction(ThePlayerThatChoseAction, CastSpellFromExileWithoutPaying(AnySpell, TheCardExiledThisWay))])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [APlayerSeparatesThoseCardsIntoTwoPiles(Opponent), PutAPileIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Choose from among them a card with {{CheckHasable}}, a card with {{CheckHasable}}, and so on for {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, and {{CheckHasable}}. Put one of the chosen cards onto the battlefield, the other chosen cards into your hand, and the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [ChooseMultipleCardsOfType([HasAbility({{CheckHasable[0]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[1]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[2]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[3]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[4]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[5]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[6]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[7]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[8]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[9]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[10]}}), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[11]}})]), PutAChosenCardOntoTheBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutTheChosenCardsIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. For each of those cards, put that card into your hand unless any opponent pays {{Digits}} life. Then exile the rest": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [ForEachCardPutIntoHandUnlessAnyPlayerAction(Opponent, PayLife({{Digits[0]}})), ExileTheRemainingCards])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. For each {{Black}} mana symbol in the mana costs of the revealed cards, target opponent mills a card. Then put the cards you revealed this way on the bottom of your library in any order": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PlayerMillsNumberCards(Ref_TargetPlayer, TheTotalNumberOfColorManaSymbolsInManaCostsOfTheLibraryCardsRevealedThisWay({{Black[0]}})), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])]))",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put all {{SpecificCards}} revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutEachCardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put all {{SpecificCards}} revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutEachCardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from among them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutUptoNumberCardsOfTypeIntoHand({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from among them into your hand and the rest of the revealed cards into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutUptoNumberCardsOfTypeIntoHand({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutACardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Starting with the next opponent in turn order, each opponent chooses a different {{SpecificCard}} from among them. Put the chosen cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [EachPlayerStartingWithChoosesADifferentCardToPutIntoHand(Opponent, NextOpponentInTurnOrder, {{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Target opponent may choose to put those cards into your hand. If they don't, put those cards into your graveyard and draw {{Number}} cards": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [APlayerChoosesFinalDestination(SinglePlayer(Ref_TargetPlayer), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard)]), Unless(RevealedCardsWerePutInHand, [DrawNumberCards({{Number[1]}})])]))",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put any number of {{SpecificCards}} from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutAnyNumberOfCardsOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put up to one {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield tapped and up to one {{SpecificCard}} from among them into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersTapped]), MayPutACardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCard[1]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} and/or {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutMultipleCardsOfTypeIntoHand([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, {{SpecificCard[1]}}]), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.\n{{AbilityWord}} - If {{Condition}}, put up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from among the revealed cards into your hand instead of one": "ActionList([IfElse({{Condition[0]}}, [RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutUptoNumberCardsOfTypeIntoHand({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])], [RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard. Create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with \"{{TokenQuotedAbility}}\"": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard]), CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{TokenQuotedAbility[0]}}])])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield. It gains \"{{QuotedAbility}}\". Then put the rest of the cards revealed this way on the bottom of your library in any order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), CreatePermanentLayerEffect(ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay, [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder])])",
    "Reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest into your graveyard.\n{{AbilityWord}} - If {{Condition}}, you may put {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} onto the battlefield instead of one": "ActionList([IfElse({{Condition[0]}}, [RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutUptoNumberCardsOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])], [RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])])",
    "Roll a d20 and add {{GameNumber}}.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Return all {{SpecificCards}} in your graveyard that were put there from the battlefield this turn to your hand.\n{{RawDigits}}+ | Return those cards from your graveyard to the battlefield": "ActionList([RollAD20, ValueActions(Plus(TheDiceResult, {{GameNumber[0]}}), [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [ReturnEachCardFromPlayersGraveyardToHandThatWasPutThereFromBattlefieldThisTurn({{SpecificCards[0]}}, You)]), ValueAction(ValueOrBigger({{RawDigits[2]}}), [ReturnEachCardFromPlayersGraveyardToBattlefieldThatWasPutThereFromBattlefieldThisTurn({{SpecificCards[0]}}, You, [EntersNormally])])])])",
    "Roll a d20.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Choose an opponent. That player sacrifices {{a}} {{Permanent}} of their choice.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Each opponent sacrifices {{a}} {{Permanent}} of their choice.\n{{RawDigits}} | Each opponent sacrifices a creature with the greatest power among creatures that player controls": "ActionList([RollAD20, ValueActions(TheDiceResult, [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [ChooseAPlayer(Opponent), PlayerAction(TheChosenPlayer, SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}))]), ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[2]}}, {{RawDigits[3]}}), [EachPlayerAction(Opponent, SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}))]), ValueAction(ExactValue({{RawDigits[4]}}), [EachPlayerAction(Opponent, SacrificeAPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), PowerIs(EqualTo(TheGreatestPowerAmongPermanents(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByPlayer(ActionPlayer)]))))])))])])])",
    "Roll a d20.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Create {{Number}} {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}}.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Create {{Number}} {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}}.\n{{RawDigits}} | Create {{Number}} {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}}": "ActionList([RollAD20, ValueActions(TheDiceResult, [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [CreateTokens([NumberTokens({{Number[0]}}, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, []))])]), ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[2]}}, {{RawDigits[3]}}), [CreateTokens([NumberTokens({{Number[1]}}, TokenWithPT({{PT[1]}}, {{CreatureTokens[1]}}, []))])]), ValueAction(ExactValue({{RawDigits[4]}}), [CreateTokens([NumberTokens({{Number[2]}}, TokenWithPT({{PT[2]}}, {{CreatureTokens[2]}}, []))])])])])",
    "Roll a d20.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Draw {{Number}} cards.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Scry {{Digits}}, then draw {{Number}} cards.\n{{RawDigits}} | Scry {{Digits}}, then draw {{Number}} cards": "ActionList([RollAD20, ValueActions(TheDiceResult, [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}})]), ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[2]}}, {{RawDigits[3]}}), [Scry({{Digits[0]}}), DrawNumberCards({{Number[1]}})]), ValueAction(ExactValue({{RawDigits[4]}}), [Scry({{Digits[1]}}), DrawNumberCards({{Number[2]}})])])])",
    "Roll a d20.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Tap all {{Creatures}}.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Tap all {{Creatures}}. Those creatures don't untap during their controllers' next untap steps.\n{{RawDigits}} | Tap all {{Creatures}}. Those creatures don't untap during their controllers' next untap steps. Until your next turn, {{Creatures}} enter tapped": "ActionList([RollAD20, ValueActions(TheDiceResult, [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [TapEachPermanent({{Creatures[0]}})]), ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[2]}}, {{RawDigits[3]}}), [TapEachPermanent({{Creatures[1]}}), EachPermanentDoesntUntapDuringControllersNextUntap({{Creatures[1]}})]), ValueAction(ExactValue({{RawDigits[4]}}), [TapEachPermanent({{Creatures[2]}}), EachPermanentDoesntUntapDuringControllersNextUntap({{Creatures[2]}}), CreateReplaceWouldEnterUntil(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield({{Creatures[3]}}), [EntersTapped], UntilPlayersNextTurn(You))])])])",
    "Roll to visit your Attractions": "ActionList([RollToVisitAttractions])",
    "Roll two d10 and choose one result. Return {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard to the battlefield with a number of {{CounterType}} counters on it equal to that result. Then each opponent loses X life and you gain X life, where X is the other result": "ActionList([RollTwoD10AndChooseAnOrder, ReturnACardFromGraveyardToBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersWithNumberCounters(TheFirstDiceResult, {{CounterType[0]}})]), EachPlayerAction(Opponent, LoseLife(TheSecondDiceResult)), GainLife(TheSecondDiceResult)])",
    "Roll two d20 and ignore the lower roll.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | Choose any number of creatures. They block this turn if able.\n{{RawDigits}}-{{RawDigits}} | You choose which creatures block this turn and how those creatures block": "ActionList([RollNumberD20AndIgnoreAllButHighest(Integer(2)), ValueActions(TheDiceResult, [ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[0]}}, {{RawDigits[1]}}), [ChooseAnyNumberOfPermanents(IsCardtype(Creature)), CreateEachPermanentRuleEffectUntil(ThePermanentsChosenThisWay, [MustBlock], UntilEndOfTurn)]), ValueAction(BetweenValues({{RawDigits[2]}}, {{RawDigits[3]}}), [CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [ChoosesHowCreaturesBlock(IsCardtype(Creature))], UntilEndOfTurn)])])])",
    "Roll two d4 and choose one result. Create a number of {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}} equal to that result. Then search your library for a number of {{SpecificCards}} equal to the other result, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([RollTwoD4AndChooseAnOrder, CreateTokens([NumberTokens(TheFirstDiceResult, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, []))]), SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType(TheSecondDiceResult, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])",
    "Roll two d6 and choose one result. Destroy each creature with power greater than or equal to that result. Then create a number of {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}} with {{Hasable}} equal to the other result": "ActionList([RollTwoD6AndChooseAnOrder, DestroyEachPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), PowerIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(TheFirstDiceResult))])), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(TheSecondDiceResult, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}]))])])",
    "Roll two d8 and choose one result. Draw cards equal to that result. Then you may cast an instant or sorcery spell with mana value less than or equal to the other result from your hand without paying its mana cost": "ActionList([RollTwoD8AndChooseAnOrder, DrawNumberCards(TheFirstDiceResult), MayAction(CastASpellFromHandWithoutPaying(And([Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo(TheSecondDiceResult))])))])",
    "Roll {{Number}} six-sided dice. For each different result, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}": "ActionList([RollNumberD6({{Number[0]}}), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(TheNumberOfDifferentDiceResults, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, []))])])",
    "Sacrifice a creature. When you do, all creatures get {{PTModX}} until end of turn, where X is the sacrificed creature's toughness": "ActionList([MustCost(SacrificeAPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature))), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(IsCardtype(Creature), [AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, ToughnessOfTheSacrificedCreature)], UntilEndOfTurn)]))])])",
    "Sacrifice all {{Permanents}}, then create that many {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}}": "ActionList([SacrificeEachPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, []))])])",
    "Sacrifice an artifact. If you do, search your library for an artifact card. If that card's mana value is less than or equal to the sacrificed artifact's mana value, put it onto the battlefield. If it's greater, you may pay {{ManaCostX}}, where X is the difference. If you do, put it onto the battlefield. If you don't, put it into its owner's graveyard. Then shuffle": "ActionList([MustCost(SacrificeAPermanent(IsCardtype(Artifact))), If(CostWasPaid, [SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType(IsCardtype(Artifact)), IfElse(ACardOfTypeWasFoundThisWay(ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo(ManaValueOfTheSacrificedPermanent))), [PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersNormally])], [MayCost(PayManaX({{ManaCostX[0]}}, Minus(ManaValueOfTheFoundCard, ManaValueOfTheSacrificedPermanent))), IfElse(CostWasPaid, [PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersNormally])], [PutFoundCardsIntoHand])]), Shuffle])])])",
    "Sacrifice any number of creatures. You gain {{Digits}} life for each creature sacrificed this way": "ActionList([SacrificeAnyNumberOfPermanents(IsCardtype(Creature)), GainLifeForEach({{Digits[0]}}, TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay)])",
    "Sacrifice any number of lands. Reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of lands sacrificed this way. Choose any number of artifact and/or land cards revealed this way. Put all nonland cards chosen this way onto the battlefield, then put all land cards chosen this way onto the battlefield tapped, then put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([SacrificeAnyNumberOfPermanents(IsCardtype(Land)), RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay, [ChooseAnyNumberOfCards(Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Land)])), PutEachCardOfTypeChosenThisWayOntoTheBattlefield(IsNonCardtype(Land), [EntersNormally]), PutEachCardOfTypeChosenThisWayOntoTheBattlefield(IsCardtype(Land), [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Sacrifice any number of {{Permanents}}, then add that much {{ManaProduceSymbol}}": "ActionList([SacrificeAnyNumberOfPermanents({{Permanents[0]}}), AddManaRepeated({{ManaProduceSymbol[0]}}, TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay)])",
    "Sacrifice any number of {{Permanents}}, then draw that many cards": "ActionList([SacrificeAnyNumberOfPermanents({{Permanents[0]}}), DrawNumberCards(TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay)])",
    "Sacrifice any number of {{Permanents}}. Draw a card for each permanent sacrificed this way": "ActionList([SacrificeAnyNumberOfPermanents({{Permanents[0]}}), DrawNumberCards(TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay)])",
    "Sacrifice any number of {{Permanents}}. Return that many {{SpecificCards}} from your graveyard to the battlefield": "ActionList([SacrificeAnyNumberOfPermanents({{Permanents[0]}}), PutNumberCardsFromAmongPlayersGraveyardsOntoTheBattlefield(TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay, {{SpecificCards[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You), [EntersNormally])])",
    "Sacrifice any number of {{Permanents}}. Search your library for up to that many {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([SacrificeAnyNumberOfPermanents({{Permanents[0]}}), SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType(TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])",
    "Sacrifice any number of {{Permanents}}. You gain {{Digits}} life for each permanent sacrificed this way": "ActionList([SacrificeAnyNumberOfPermanents({{Permanents[0]}}), GainLifeForEach({{Digits[0]}}, TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedThisWay)])",
    "Sacrifice {{Number}} {{Permanents}}. Search your library for {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([SacrificeNumberPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{Permanents[0]}}), SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])",
    "Sacrifice {{a}} {{Creature}}. Return up to X cards from your graveyard to your hand, where X is the number of colors that creature was. Exile this card": "ActionList([SacrificeAPermanent({{Creature[0]}}), PutUptoNumberCardsFromGraveyardToHand(TheNumberOfColorsOfTheSacrificedPermanent, AnyCard), ExileSpell(ThisSpell)])",
    "Sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}, then draw {{Number}} cards": "ActionList([SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}})])",
    "Sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}.\nDraw a card": "ActionList([SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), DrawACard])",
    "Sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}}": "ActionList([MustCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}])])])])",
    "Sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, draw a card, then you may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} and/or {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from your hand onto the battlefield": "ActionList([MustCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [DrawACard, MayAction(PutACardFromHandOnBattlefield(Or([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, {{SpecificCard[1]}}]), [EntersNormally]))])])",
    "Sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, target opponent loses {{Digits}} life unless that player sacrifices {{a}} {{Permanent}} of their choice or discards a card. You may repeat this process any number of times": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([RepeatableActions([SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), If(APermanentWasSacrificedThisWay(AnyPermanent), [PlayerMayCost(Ref_TargetPlayer, Or([SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[1]}}), DiscardACard])), Unless(CostWasPaid, [PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, LoseLife({{Digits[0]}}))]), MayAction(RepeatThisProcess)])])]))",
    "Sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. Search your library for up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])",
    "Sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. Search your library for up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. If {{Condition}}, instead search your library for up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), IfElse({{Condition[0]}}, [SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[1]}}, {{SpecificCards[1]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])], [SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])])",
    "Scry X, where X is {{GameNumber[ThisSpell]}}, then draw {{Number}} cards": "ActionList([Scry({{GameNumber[ThisSpell][0]}}), DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}})])",
    "Scry X, where X is {{GameNumber}}, then draw {{Number}} cards": "ActionList([Scry({{GameNumber[0]}}), DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}})])",
