    "Search your library for a card, put it into your hand, then shuffle. If {{Condition}}, you may cast {{a}} {{PotentialSpell}} from your hand without paying its mana cost": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindAGenericCard, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle]), If({{Condition[0]}}, [MayAction(CastASpellFromHandWithoutPaying({{PotentialSpell[0]}}))])])",
