    "Search your library for any number of {{SpecificCards}}, reveal those cards, then shuffle and put them on top": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindAnyNumberOfCardsOfType({{SpecificCards[0]}}), RevealFoundCards, SetAsideFoundCards, Shuffle, PutSetAsideCardsOnTopOfLibrary])])",
