    "Search your library for up to X {{SpecificCards}}, where X is {{GameNumber}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])",
