    "Search your library for up to X {{SpecificCards}}, where X is {{GameNumber}}, put those cards onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle]), CreatePreventDamageUntil(CombatDamageWouldBeDealt, [PreventThatDamage], UntilEndOfTurn)])",
    "Search your library for up to X {{SpecificCards}}, where X is {{GameNumber}}. Put those cards onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])",
    "Search your library for up to three {{SpecificCards}} and reveal them. Put two of them onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand, then shuffle": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType(Integer(2), {{SpecificCards[0]}}), RevealFoundCards, PutAFoundCardIntoHand, PutFoundCardsIntoGraveyard, Shuffle])])",
