    "Search your library for up to two {{SpecificCards}}, reveal those cards, and put one onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand. Shuffle, then scry {{Digits}}": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType(Integer(2), {{SpecificCards[0]}}), RevealFoundCards, PutAFoundCardOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle]), Scry({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "Search your library for up to two {{SpecificCards}}, reveal those cards, put one onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand, then shuffle": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType(Integer(2), {{SpecificCards[0]}}), RevealFoundCards, PutAFoundCardOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])])",
    "Search your library for up to {{Number}} cards with different names and reveal them. Target opponent chooses {{Number}} of those cards. Put the chosen cards into your graveyard and the rest into your hand. Then shuffle": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberGroupCards({{Number[0]}}, AnyCardInLibrary, DifferentNames), RevealFoundCards, APlayerChoosesNumberFoundCards(SinglePlayer(Ref_TargetPlayer), {{Number[1]}}), PutChosenFoundCardsIntoGraveyard, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])]))",
    "Search your library for up to {{Number}} cards with the same name as target {{Permanent}}, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, SharesANameWithPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)), RevealFoundCards, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])]))",
    "Search your library for up to {{Number}} land cards that each have a basic land type, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is {{GameNumber}}. Put up to one of them on top of your library and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, And([IsCardtype(Land), HasBasicLandType])), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle]), CreateValueX({{GameNumber[0]}}), LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(ValueX, [PutAGenericCardOnTopOfLibrary, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "Search your library for up to {{Number}} {{CreatureCards}} with different powers and reveal them. An opponent chooses {{Number}} of those cards. Shuffle the chosen cards into your library and put the rest into your hand": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberGroupCards({{Number[0]}}, {{CreatureCards[0]}}, DifferentPowers), RevealFoundCards, APlayerChoosesNumberFoundCards(Opponent, {{Number[1]}}), SetAsideNonchosenFoundCards, Shuffle, PutSetAsideCardsIntoHand])])",
