    "Search your library for up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them into your graveyard, then shuffle": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsIntoGraveyard, Shuffle])])",
    "Search your library for up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])",
    "Search your library for up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\n{{AbilityWord}} - Starting with you, each player votes for planeswalk or chaos. If planeswalk gets more votes, planeswalk. If chaos gets more votes or the vote is tied, chaos ensues": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle]), EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [VoteForAWord([\"Planeswalk\", \"Chaos\"])]), If(MostVotesForWordIs(\"Planeswalk\"), [Planeswalk]), If(MostVotesOrTiedForMostVotesForWordIs(\"Chaos\"), [ChaosEnsues])])",
