    "Search your library for up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. You gain {{Digits}} life": "ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle]), GainLife({{Digits[0]}})])",
