    "You get {{Energy}}, then you may pay any amount of {{EnergyCounters}}.\nEach player may exile their hand and draw a number of cards equal to the amount of {{EnergyCounters}} paid this way. If {{Number}} or more {{EnergyCounters}} was paid this way, you may play cards you own exiled this way until the end of your next turn": "ActionList([GetEnergy(Integer({{Energy[0]}})), PayAnyAmountOfEnergy, EachPlayerMayActions(AnyPlayer, [ExileHand, DrawNumberCards(TheAmountOfEnergyPaidThisWay)]), If(AnAmountOfEnergyWasPaidThisWay(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Number[0]}})), [CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCards(And([OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), WasExiledThisWay]))], UntilPlayersNextTurn(You))])])",
