    "You get {{Tickets}}, then you may put a sticker on {{a}} {{Permanent}}. Target {{Creature}} deals damage equal to its power to target {{Creature}}": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Creature[0]}}), TargetPermanent({{Creature[1]}})], ActionList([GetNumberTickets({{Tickets[0]}}), MayAction(PutAStickerOnAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), PermanentDealsDamage(Ref_TargetPermanent1, PowerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1), Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent2))]))",
    "You lose {{Digits}} life and draw {{Number}} cards, then clash with an opponent. If you win, repeat this process": "ActionList([RepeatableActions([GainLife({{Digits[0]}}), DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), Clash(Opponent, [RepeatThisProcess], [DoNothing])])])",
