    "You may sacrifice {{Number}} {{Permanents}}. If you do, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}. Otherwise, create {{Number}} Food tokens": "ActionList([MayCost(SacrificeNumberPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{Permanents[0]}})), IfElse(CostWasPaid, [CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])], [CreateTokens([NumberTokens({{Number[1]}}, FoodToken)])])])",
