    "You may tap or untap target {{Creature}}. Then that creature's controller may pay {{ManaCost}}. If the player does, they may copy this spell and may choose a new target for that copy": "ActionList([MayAction(TapOrUntapPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)), PlayerMayCost(ControllerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [PlayerMayAction(ControllerOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), CopySpellAndMayChooseNewTargets(ThisSpell))])])",
