  "{{StaticEffect(~Card)}}": {
    "As long as this card is the top card of your library, you may look at it any time and you may cast it": "FromTopOfLibrary_Digital([PlayerEffect(You, [MayLookAtTopCardOfLibraryAnyTime, MayCastSpellsFromTopOfLibrary(AnySpell)])])",
    "As long as {{~Card}} is at the top of your library, you may look at it any time and you may cast it": "FromTopOfLibrary_Digital([PlayerEffect(You, [MayLookAtTopCardOfLibraryAnyTime, MayCastSpellsFromTopOfLibrary(AnySpell)])])",
    "As long as {{~Card}} isn't on the battlefield, it's {{a}} {{PT}} {{Zombie}} creature in addition to its other types": "SelfEffect_NonBattlefield([SetPT({{PT[0]}}), AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), AddCardtype(Creature)])",
    "Counters remain on {{~Card}} as it moves to any zone other than a player's hand or library": "SelfEffect([CountersRemainOnCardAsItMovesBetweenZonesExceptforHandAndLibrary])",
    "If this card would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead": "AsPutIntoAGraveyardFromAnywhere({{~Card}}, [ExileItInstead])",
    "If {{~Card}} would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead": "AsPutIntoAGraveyardFromAnywhere({{~Card}}, [ExileItInstead])",
    "If {{~Card}} would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, reveal {{~Card}} and shuffle it into its owner's library instead": "AsPutIntoAGraveyardFromAnywhere({{~Card}}, [RevealItAndShuffleItIntoLibraryInstead])",
    "{{~Card}} is all colors": "CDA_Color(AllColors)",
    "{{~Card}} is all colors. This ability doesn't affect its color identity": "CDA_ColorButNotColorIdentity(AllColors)",
    "{{~Card}} is also {{a}} {{Zombie}}, {{Zombie}}, {{Zombie}}, and {{Zombie}}": "CDA_Types(AddCreatureTypes([{{Zombie[0]}}, {{Zombie[1]}}, {{Zombie[2]}}, {{Zombie[3]}}]))",
    "{{~Card}} is colorless": "CDA_Color(Colorless)",
    "{{~Card}} is every creature type (even if this card isn't on the battlefield)": "CDA_Types(HasAllCreatureTypes)",
    "{{~Card}} is every nonbasic land type": "CDA_Types(HasAllNonbasicLandTypes)",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to half {{GameNumber}}, rounded up": "CDA_Power(HalfRoundedUp({{GameNumber[0]}})), CDA_Toughness(HalfRoundedUp({{GameNumber[0]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards exiled with it": "CDA_Power(NumCardsInExile(TheExiledCards)), CDA_Toughness(NumCardsInExile(TheExiledCards))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of colors among the exiled cards used to craft it": "CDA_Power(TheNumberOfColorsAmongTheCardsUsedToCraftPermanent(ThisPermanent)), CDA_Toughness(TheNumberOfColorsAmongTheCardsUsedToCraftPermanent(ThisPermanent))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of other {{SpecificCards}} in your graveyard": "CDA_Power(TheNumberOfOtherCardsInPlayersGraveyard(ThisGraveyardCard, {{SpecificCards[0]}}, You)), CDA_Toughness(TheNumberOfOtherCardsInPlayersGraveyard(ThisGraveyardCard, {{SpecificCards[0]}}, You))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of {{CounterType}} counters on it": "CDA_Power(NumCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent)), CDA_Toughness(NumCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of {{Swamps}} sacrificed as it entered": "CDA_Power(TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedAsPermenantEnteredBattlefield(IsLandType({{Swamps[0]}}), ThisPermanent)), CDA_Toughness(TheNumberOfPermanentsSacrificedAsPermenantEnteredBattlefield(IsLandType({{Swamps[0]}}), ThisPermanent))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the total mana value of other creatures you control": "CDA_Power(TotalManaValueOfPermanents(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), CDA_Toughness(TotalManaValueOfPermanents(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the total power of the exiled cards used to craft it": "CDA_Power(TotalPowerOfExiledCards(UsedToCraftPermanent(ThisPermanent))), CDA_Toughness(TotalPowerOfExiledCards(UsedToCraftPermanent(ThisPermanent)))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to twice the number of {{CounterType}} counters on it": "CDA_Power(Twice(NumCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent))), CDA_Toughness(Twice(NumCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent)))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to twice {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power(Twice({{GameNumber[0]}})), CDA_Toughness(Twice({{GameNumber[0]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{Digits}} minus {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power(Minus({{Digits[0]}}, {{GameNumber[0]}})), CDA_Toughness(Minus({{Digits[0]}}, {{GameNumber[0]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{Digits}} plus twice the number of {{CounterType}} counters on it": "CDA_Power(Plus({{Digits[0]}}, Twice(NumCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent)))), CDA_Toughness(Plus({{Digits[0]}}, Twice(NumCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent))))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{Digits}} plus {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power(Plus({{Digits[0]}}, {{GameNumber[0]}})), CDA_Toughness(Plus({{Digits[0]}}, {{GameNumber[0]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power({{GameNumber[0]}}), CDA_Toughness({{GameNumber[0]}})",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{GameNumber}} minus {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power(Minus({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{GameNumber[1]}})), CDA_Toughness(Minus({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{GameNumber[1]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{GameNumber}} plus {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power(Plus({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{GameNumber[1]}})), CDA_Toughness(Plus({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{GameNumber[1]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power is equal to the greatest number noted for it this turn": "CDA_Power(HighestNotedValueForPermanent(ThisPermanent))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power is equal to the number of other {{Zombies}} on the battlefield": "CDA_Power(TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCreatureType({{Zombies[0]}})])))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power is equal to the total power of the exiled cards used to craft it": "CDA_Power(TotalPowerOfExiledCards(UsedToCraftPermanent(ThisPermanent)))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power is equal to {{Digits}} plus {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power(Plus({{Digits[0]}}, {{GameNumber[0]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power is equal to {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power({{GameNumber[0]}})",
    "{{~Card}}'s power is equal to {{GameNumber}} and its toughness is equal to that number plus {{Digits}}": "CDA_Power({{GameNumber[0]}}), CDA_Toughness(Plus({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{Digits[0]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s power is equal to {{GameNumber}} plus {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Power(Plus({{GameNumber[0]}}, {{GameNumber[1]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s toughness is equal to {{Digits}} plus {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Toughness(Plus({{Digits[0]}}, {{GameNumber[0]}}))",
    "{{~Card}}'s toughness is equal to {{GameNumber}}": "CDA_Toughness({{GameNumber[0]}})"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect(~Exiled)}}": {
    "You may cast this card from exile": "FromExile(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastExiledCard({{~Exiled}})]))"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect(~GraveyardCard)}}": {
    "As long as this card is in your graveyard and you control {{a}} {{Swamp}}, {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}}": "FromGraveyardIf(PlayerPassesFilter(You, ControlsA(IsLandType({{Swamp[0]}}))), EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]))",
    "As long as this card is in your graveyard, each {{Permanent}} enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it": "FromGraveyard(ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield({{Permanent[0]}}), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})]))",
    "As long as this card is in your graveyard, if you would learn, you may instead return this card to the battlefield": "FromGraveyard(ReplaceWouldLearn(APlayerWouldLearn(SinglePlayer(You)), [ChooseAnAction([[PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield({{~GraveyardCard}}, [EntersNormally])], [Learn]])]))",
    "As long as this card is in your graveyard, {{Permanents}} have \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "FromGraveyard(EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])]))",
    "As long as {{Condition}} and this card is in your graveyard, it has flashback {{ManaCost}}": "FromGraveyardIf({{Condition[0]}}, Flashback(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})))",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, you may cast this card from your graveyard by paying {{ManaCost}} rather than paying its mana cost. If you cast this card this way and it would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead": "FromGraveyardIf({{Condition[0]}}, PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardIntoExileForAlternateCastingCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))]))",
    "If this card is in a graveyard, effects from spells named {{NamedCard}} count it as a card named {{NamedCard}}": "FromGraveyard(CountsAsACardWithNameForSpellsNamed({{NamedCard[1]}}, {{NamedCard[0]}}))",
    "Max speed - You may cast this card from your graveyard": "FromGraveyard(MaxSpeed(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCard({{~GraveyardCard}})])))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCard({{~GraveyardCard}})]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard as long as {{Condition}}": "FromGraveyardIf({{Condition[0]}}, PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCard({{~GraveyardCard}})]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard as long as {{Condition}}. If you cast it this way and it would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead": "FromGraveyardIf({{Condition[0]}}, PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardIntoExile({{~GraveyardCard}})]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, DiscardACard)]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding {{Number}} cards in addition to paying its other costs": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, DiscardNumberCards({{Number[0]}}))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by exiling another creature card from your graveyard in addition to paying its other costs": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, Exile([AGraveyardCard(And([Other(ThisGraveyardCard), IsCardtype(Creature), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))]))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by exiling {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from your graveyard in addition to paying its other costs": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, ExileNumberGraveyardCards({{Number[0]}}, And([{{SpecificCards[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))])))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying {{Digits}} life and discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, And([PayLife({{Digits[0]}}), DiscardACard]))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying {{Digits}} life and sacrificing {{a}} {{Permanent}} in addition to paying its other costs": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, And([PayLife({{Digits[0]}}), SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})]))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying {{ManaCost}} and exiling {{Number}} other cards from your graveyard rather than paying its mana cost": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardForAlternateCastingCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), ExileNumberGraveyardCards({{Number[0]}}, And([Other({{~GraveyardCard}}), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))]))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying {{ManaCost}} and sacrificing {{Number}} {{Permanents}} rather than paying its mana cost": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardForAlternateCastingCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), SacrificeNumberPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{Permanents[0]}})]))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying {{ManaCost}} rather than paying its mana cost": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardForAlternateCastingCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying {{ManaCost}} rather than paying its mana cost. If you do, it enters with {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on it": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardForAlternateCastingCostWithEnterActions({{~GraveyardCard}}, PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), [EntersWithNumberCounters({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}})])]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard by removing {{Number}} counters from among {{Permanents}} in addition to paying its other costs": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, RemoveNumberCountersFromAmongPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{Permanents[0]}}))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard if you pay {{ManaCost}} more to cast it for each other creature card in your graveyard": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, PayManaForEach({{ManaCost[0]}}, TheNumberOfGraveyardCards(And([Other({{~GraveyardCard}}), IsCardtype(Creature), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))))]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard if {{Condition}}": "FromGraveyardIf({{Condition[0]}}, PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCard({{~GraveyardCard}})]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard if {{Condition}}. If you do, this creature enters with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it": "FromGraveyardIf({{Condition[0]}}, PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardWithEnterActions({{~GraveyardCard}}, [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard using its bestow ability": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardUsingBestowAbility({{~GraveyardCard}})]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard using its blitz ability": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardUsingBlitzAbility({{~GraveyardCard}})]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard using its mutate ability": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardUsingMutateAbility({{~GraveyardCard}})]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard using its warp ability": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardUsingWarpAbility({{~GraveyardCard}})]))",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard, but not from anywhere else": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCard({{~GraveyardCard}})])), CastEffect(CantBeCastFromAnywhereOtherThanGraveyard)",
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard. If you do, it enters with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCardWithEnterActions({{~GraveyardCard}}, [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])]))",
    "You may cast {{~GraveyardCard}} from your graveyard by exiling {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}} from your graveyard in addition to paying its other costs": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastCardFromGraveyardByPayingAddedCost({{~GraveyardCard}}, ExileNumberGraveyardCards({{Number[0]}}, And([{{SpecificCards[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))])))]))"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect(~GraveyardCardOrExiledCard)}}": {
    "You may cast this card from your graveyard or from exile": "FromGraveyard(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastGraveyardCard(ThisGraveyardCard)])), FromExile(PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastExiledCard(ThisExiledCard)]))"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect(~HandCard)}}": {
    "If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard this card, put it onto the battlefield instead of putting it into your graveyard": "ReplaceWouldDiscard(ASpellOrAbilityWouldCausePlayerToDiscardCard(ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent), You, {{~HandCard}}), [PutItOntoTheBattlefieldInstead([EntersNormally])])",
    "If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard this card, put it onto the battlefield with {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on it instead of putting it into your graveyard": "ReplaceWouldDiscard(ASpellOrAbilityWouldCausePlayerToDiscardCard(ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent), You, {{~HandCard}}), [PutItOntoTheBattlefieldInstead([EntersWithNumberCounters({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}})])])",
    "You may discard this card any time you could cast an instant": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayDiscardCardAnyTimeTheyCouldCastAnInstant({{~HandCard}})])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect(~LibraryCard)}}": {
    "While you're searching your library, you may cast this card from your library": "SelfEffect([MayCastFromLibraryWhileSearchingLibrary])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect(~Permanent)}}": {
    "Instant and sorcery spells you cast with mana value {{Digits}} or greater cost {{CostReduceX}} less to cast, where X is {{GameNumber(~Permanent)}}":
      "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCostX(And([Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))]), {{CostReduceX[0]}}, {{GameNumber(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})])",
    "Activated abilities of Equipment you control that target this creature cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [ReduceActivatedCost(And([AbilityOfAPermanent(And([IsArtifactType(Equipment), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), TargetsPermanent({{~Permanent}})]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Activated abilities of {{Permanents}} cost {{CostReduceX}} less to activate, where X is {{GameNumber(~Permanent)}}. This effect can't reduce the mana in that cost to less than one mana": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [ReduceManaCostOfActivatedAbilitiesNotLessThanOneX(AbilityOfAPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), {{CostReduceX[0]}}, {{GameNumber(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})])",
    "After you roll a die, you may remove {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter from this creature. If you do, increase or decrease the result by 1": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPayToIncrementOrDecrementADiceRoll(RemoveACounterOfTypeFromPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}}))])",
    "All damage that would be dealt to you and other permanents you control is dealt to this creature instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToARecipient(APlayerOrAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), And([Other({{~Permanent}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), [DealToCreatureOrPlaneswalkerInstead({{~Permanent}})])",
    "All damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to this creature instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [DealToCreatureOrPlaneswalkerInstead({{~Permanent}})])",
    "All {{Creatures}} able to block this creature do so": "PermanentRuleEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AllCreaturesMustBlockIt({{Creatures[0]}})])",
    "All {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}} for each {{Eachable(~Permanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, {{Eachable(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})])",
    "As long as a card exiled with this creature has {{CheckHasable}}, this creature has {{CheckHasable}}. The same is true for {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, and {{CheckHasable}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbilityFromAnExiledHasable(WasExiledWithPermanent({{~Permanent}}), [{{CheckHasable[0]}}, {{CheckHasable[2]}}, {{CheckHasable[3]}}, {{CheckHasable[4]}}, {{CheckHasable[5]}}, {{CheckHasable[6]}}, {{CheckHasable[7]}}, {{CheckHasable[8]}}])])",
    "As long as a card exiled with this creature is a creature card, this creature has the power, toughness, and creature types of the last creature card exiled with it. It's still {{a}} {{Zombie}}": "If(ExiledCardPassesFilter(TheLastExiledCard, IsCardtype(Creature)), [PermanentLayerEffect(ThisPermanent, [SetPower(PowerOfExiledCard(TheLastExiledCard)), SetToughness(ToughnessOfExiledCard(TheLastExiledCard)), AddCreatureTypeVariable(CreatureTypesOfExiled(TheLastExiledCard))])])",
    "As long as an exiled {{SpecificCard}} with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it has {{CheckHasable}}, {{~Permanent}} has {{CheckHasable}}. The same is true for {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, and {{CheckHasable}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbilityFromAnExiledHasable(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})]), [{{CheckHasable[1]}}, {{CheckHasable[2]}}, {{CheckHasable[3]}}, {{CheckHasable[4]}}, {{CheckHasable[5]}}, {{CheckHasable[6]}}, {{CheckHasable[7]}}, {{CheckHasable[8]}}, {{CheckHasable[9]}}, {{CheckHasable[10]}}, {{CheckHasable[11]}}, {{CheckHasable[12]}}, {{CheckHasable[13]}}])])",
    "As long as an opponent controls a creature with {{CheckHasable}} not named {{NamedCard}}, this creature has {{Hasable}}. The same is true for {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, and {{CheckHasable}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbilityFromEachPermanentHasable(And([ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent), IsCardtype(Creature), IsNotNamed(NamedCard({{NamedCard[0]}}))]), [{{CheckHasable[0]}}, {{CheckHasable[1]}}, {{CheckHasable[2]}}, {{CheckHasable[3]}}])])",
    "As long as the top card of your graveyard is a creature card, this creature has the full text of that card and has the text \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "If(GraveyardCardPassesFilter(TopCardOfPlayersGraveyard(You), IsCardtype(Creature)), [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [HasTextOfGraveyardCardAndTheText(TopCardOfPlayersGraveyard(You), [{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as the top card of your library is an artifact or creature card, this creature has all activated abilities of that card": "If(TopCardOfPlayersLibraryPassesFilter(You, Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Creature)])), [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbilityFromTopOfLibraryHasable([ActivatedAbility])])])",
    "As long as the top card of your library is {{a}} {{Zombie}} card, this creature has all activated abilities of that card": "If(TopCardOfPlayersLibraryPassesFilter(You, IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})), [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbilityFromTopOfLibraryHasable([ActivatedAbility])])])",
    "As long as this creature is attacking, creatures can't block unless their controller pays {{ManaCost}} for each of those creatures": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsAttacking), [EachPermanentRuleEffect(IsCardtype(Creature), [CantBlockUnlessCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "As long as this creature is attacking, defending player can't cast {{PotentialSpells}}": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsAttacking), [PlayerEffect(PlayerOrControllerOfPlaneswalkerCreatureIsAttacking({{~Permanent}}), [CantCastSpells({{PotentialSpells[0]}})])])",
    "As long as this creature is attacking, for each creature you control, you may have that creature assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsAttacking), [EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [MayAssignCombatDamageAsThoughNotBlocked])])",
    "As long as this creature is attacking, it gets {{PTModX}}, where X is the number of lands defending player controls": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsAttacking), [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(DefendingPlayer))])))])])",
    "As long as this creature is attacking, it gets {{PTMod}}": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsAttacking), [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as this creature is attacking, prevent all damage {{Permanents}} would deal to this creature and to creatures banded with this creature": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsAttacking), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanentToARecipient({{Permanents[0]}}, APermanent(Or([SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), And([IsCardtype(Creature), BandedWith({{~Permanent}})])]))), [PreventThatDamage])])",
    "As long as this creature is paired with another creature, both creatures have {{Hasable}}": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsPaired), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(Or([SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), SinglePermanent(TheCreaturePairedWithPermanent({{~Permanent}}))]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as this creature is paired with another creature, each of those creatures gets {{PTMod}}": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsPaired), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(Or([SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), SinglePermanent(TheCreaturePairedWithPermanent({{~Permanent}}))]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as this creature is paired with another creature, each of those creatures has \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsPaired), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(Or([SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), SinglePermanent(TheCreaturePairedWithPermanent({{~Permanent}}))]), [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as you control one or more creatures with a name you noted for cards named {{NamedCard}}, this creature and those creatures get {{PTMod}} and have {{Hasable}}": "If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, ControlsA(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsNamed(TheNamePlayerNotedForCardDuringDraft(You, {{NamedCard[0]}}))]))), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(Or([SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsNamed(TheNamePlayerNotedForCardDuringDraft(You, {{NamedCard[0]}}))])]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, prevent all damage that would be dealt to this creature by spells that target it": "If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToRecipient(TargetsPermanent({{~Permanent}}), Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, this creature gets {{PTMod}}": "If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, this creature gets {{PTMod}} and has {{Hasable}}": "If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, this creature has \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, this creature has {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}}": "If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, {{~Permanent}} can't attack or block": "If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentRuleEffect({{~Permanent}}, [CantAttack, CantBlock])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, {{~Permanent}} gets {{PTMod}}": "If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, {{~Permanent}} has hexproof": "If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([Hexproof])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, all combat damage that would be dealt to you by {{Creatures}} is dealt to this creature instead": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDealDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByACreatureToRecipient({{Creatures[0]}}, Player(You)), [DealToCreatureOrPlaneswalkerInstead({{~Permanent}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, all damage that would be dealt to you by {{Permanents}} is dealt to this creature instead": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanentToRecipient({{Permanents[0]}}, Player(You)), [DealToCreatureOrPlaneswalkerInstead({{~Permanent}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, all {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}}": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, creatures can't attack you or planeswalkers you control unless their controller pays {{ManaCost}} for each of those creatures": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [EachPermanentRuleEffect(IsCardtype(Creature), [CantAttackPlayerOrPlaneswalkerControlledByUnlessCost(You, PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, each player chooses artifact, creature, or land during their untap step. That player can untap only permanents of the chosen type this step": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [CanOnlyUntapCardsOfTypeOfTheirChoiceDuringTheirUntapStep([Artifact, Creature, Land])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, each spell that would cost less than three mana to cast costs three mana to cast": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [SetMinimumSpellCost(AnySpell, Integer(3))])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, each {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}}": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, he's {{a}} {{PT}} {{Zombie}} {{Zombie}} creature with {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}}": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPT({{PT[0]}}), SetCreatureTypes([{{Zombie[0]}}, {{Zombie[1]}}]), SetCardtype(Creature), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, if you would draw a card, you may instead search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDraw(APlayerWouldDrawACard(SinglePlayer(You)), [ChooseAnAction([[SearchLibrary([FindAGenericCard, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])], [DrawACard]])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, it can attack as though it didn't have defender": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentRuleEffect({{~Permanent}}, [CanAttackAsThoughItDidntHaveDefender])])",
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, it can block an additional creature each combat": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PermanentRuleEffect({{~Permanent}}, [CanBlockAnAdditionalCreature])])",
