    "The first time you would create one or more tokens each turn, you may instead create that many tokens that are copies of enchanted permanent": "ReplaceAPlayerWouldCreateTokens(APlayerWouldCreateTokensForTheFirstTimeEachTurn(SinglePlayer(You), AnyPermanent), [ChooseAnAction([[CreateTokensInstead([NumberTokens(WouldCreateTokens_NumberTokens, TokenCopyOfPermanent(HostPermanent, NoTokenCopyEffects))])], [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens])]])])",
