    "Enchanted creature gets {{PTMod}} as long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}. Otherwise, it can't attack or block": "IfElse({{Condition(ThatPermanent=HostPermanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])], [PermanentRuleEffect(HostPermanent, [CantAttack, CantBlock])])",
    "Enchanted creature gets {{PTMod}} as long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}. Otherwise, it gets {{PTMod}}": "IfElse({{Condition(ThatPermanent=HostPermanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])], [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[1]}})])])",
    "Enchanted creature gets {{PTMod}} as long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}. Otherwise, it has base power and toughness {{PT}} and can't block {{Zombies}}": "IfElse({{Condition(ThatPermanent=HostPermanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])], [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [SetPT({{PT[0]}})]), PermanentRuleEffect(HostPermanent, [CantBlockAttackers(IsCreatureType({{Zombies[0]}}))])])",
