    "Enchanted creature gets {{PTMod}} for each {{Eachable}} and is {{a}} {{Zombie}} in addition to its other types": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, {{Eachable[0]}}), AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})])",
