    "Enchanted creature has base power and toughness {{PT}}, has {{Hasable}}, loses all other abilities, and is {{a}} {{Black}} {{Zombie}} in addition to its other colors and types": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [SetPT({{PT[0]}}), AddAbilityAndLoseAllOtherAbilities([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddColor(SimpleColorList([{{Black[0]}}])), AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})])",
    "Enchanted creature has {{Hasable}} and \"At the beginning of your upkeep, destroy this creature. Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. Put that card onto the battlefield and attach {{~Guest}} to it, then put all other cards revealed this way on the bottom of your library in a random order\"": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(SinglePlayer(You)), ActionList([DestroyPermanent(ThisPermanent), RevealCardsFromTheTopOfLibraryUntilACardOfTypeIsRevealed({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [PutTheCardFoundThisWayOntoTheBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), AttachPermanentToPermanent(ThePermanentThatGrantedThisAbility, ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay)]))])])",
    "Enchanted creature has {{Hasable}} and is goaded": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]), PermanentRuleEffect(HostPermanent, [IsGoadedByPlayer(You)])",
