    "Enchanted creature has {{Hasable}}, {{Hasable}}, and {{Hasable}}, and it gets {{PTModX}}, where X is {{GameNumber}}": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[2]}}]), AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, {{GameNumber[0]}})])",
