    "Enchanted creature is {{a}} {{Zombie}} artifact creature with base power and toughness {{PT}} and has {{Hasable}}, and it loses all other abilities, card types, and creature types": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [SetCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), SetCardtypes([Artifact, Creature]), SetPT({{PT[0]}}), AddAbilityAndLoseAllOtherAbilities([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
