    "Enchanted creature is {{a}} {{Zombie}} with base power and toughness {{PT}}. It can't attack and loses all abilities": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [SetCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), SetPT({{PT[0]}}), LosesAllAbilities]), PermanentRuleEffect(HostPermanent, [CantAttack])",
    "Enchanted creature is {{a}} {{Zombie}} with base power and toughness {{PT}}. It has {{Hasable}} and loses all other abilities": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [SetCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), SetPT({{PT[0]}}), AddAbilityAndLoseAllOtherAbilities([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
