    "Enchanted creature loses all abilities and is {{a}} {{Black}} and {{Black}} {{Zombie}} creature with base power and toughness {{PT}} named {{NamedCard}}": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [LosesAllAbilities, SetColor(SimpleColorList([{{Black[0]}}, {{Black[1]}}])), SetCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), SetCardtype(Creature), SetPT({{PT[0]}}), SetName({{NamedCard[0]}})])",
