    "Equipped creature gets {{PTMod}}, has {{Hasable}}, can't attack you or planeswalkers you control, and can't be sacrificed": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]), PermanentRuleEffect(HostPermanent, [CantAttackPlayerOrPlaneswalkerControlledBy(You), CantBeSacrificed])",
