    "Equipped creature gets {{PTMod}}. As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, it gets an additional {{PTMod}}. As long as {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, it has {{Hasable}}": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})]), If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=ApplyPermanentEffect_It)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[1]}})])]), If({{Condition(ThatPermanent=ApplyPermanentEffect_It)[1]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "Equipped creature gets {{PTMod}}. If {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, it gets {{PTMod}} instead": "IfElse({{Condition(ThatPermanent=HostPermanent)[0]}}, [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[1]}})])], [PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
