    "If another creature would deal combat damage to {{EquippedCreature}}, it deals double that damage to {{EquippedCreature}} instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByACreatureToRecipient(And([Other(HostPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature)]), Permanent(HostPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to {{EquippedCreature}}": "PreventDamage(Or([CombatDamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent(HostPermanent)), CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByCreature(HostPermanent)]), [PreventThatDamage])",
    "Prevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to {{EquippedCreature}}": "PreventDamage(NoncombatDamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent(HostPermanent)), [PreventThatDamage])",
    "{{Creatures}} that share a color with {{EquippedCreature}} get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([{{Creatures[0]}}, SharesAColorWithPermanent(HostPermanent)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "{{Creatures}} that share a creature type with {{EquippedCreature}} get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([{{Creatures[0]}}, SharesACreatureTypeWithPermanent(HostPermanent)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "{{StaticEffect[WouldDealDamage][EquippedCreature]}}": "{{StaticEffect[WouldDealDamage][EquippedCreature][0]}}"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[EquippedPermanent]}}": {
    "{{EquippedPermanent}} isn't a planeswalker and is a creature in addition to its other types": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [RemoveCardtype(Planeswalker), AddCardtype(Creature)])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[FortifiedLand]}}": {
    "{{FortifiedLand}} has {{Hasable}}": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[PlayerWouldCreateTokens]}}": {
    "If you would create one or more tokens, instead create those tokens plus an additional Food token": "ReplaceAPlayerWouldCreateTokens(APlayerWouldCreateTokens(SinglePlayer(You), AnyPermanent), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, FoodToken])])",
    "If you would create one or more Treasure tokens, instead create those tokens plus an additional Treasure token": "ReplaceAPlayerWouldCreateTokens(APlayerWouldCreateTokens(SinglePlayer(You), IsArtifactType(Treasure)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, TreasureToken])])",
    "If you would create one or more artifact tokens, instead create those tokens plus an additional Map token": "ReplaceAPlayerWouldCreateTokens(APlayerWouldCreateTokens(SinglePlayer(You), IsCardtype(Artifact)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, MapToken])])",
    "If you would create one or more tokens, you may instead create that many {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}} with {{Hasable}} or that many {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}} with {{Hasable}}": "ReplaceAPlayerWouldCreateTokens(APlayerWouldCreateTokens(SinglePlayer(You), AnyPermanent), [ChooseAnAction([[CreateTokensInstead([NumberTokens(WouldCreateTokens_NumberTokens, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}]))])], [CreateTokensInstead([NumberTokens(WouldCreateTokens_NumberTokens, TokenWithPT({{PT[1]}}, {{CreatureTokens[1]}}, [{{Hasable[1]}}]))])], [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens])]])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenAbilities]}}": {
    "{{Permanents}} have each of the chosen abilities": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbilityVariable(TheChosenAbilities)])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenCardtype]}}": {
    "Players can't cast spells of the chosen type": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [CantCastSpells(IsCardtypeVariable(TheChosenCardtype))])",
    "Spells of the chosen type cost {{ManaCost}} more to cast": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [IncreaseSpellCost(IsCardtypeVariable(TheChosenCardtype), PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])",
    "Spells you cast of the chosen type cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(IsCardtypeVariable(TheChosenCardtype), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "You and creatures you control have protection from the chosen card type": "PlayerEffect(You, [Protection(FromTypes(IsCardtypeVariable(TheChosenCardtype)))]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddAbility([Protection(FromTypes(IsCardtypeVariable(TheChosenCardtype)))])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenColor,TheChosenPlayer]}}": {
    "{{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}} as long as {{Condition[TheChosenColor,TheChosenPlayer]}}": "If({{Condition[TheChosenColor,TheChosenPlayer][0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenColor](~Permanent)}}": {
    "This creature has protection from the chosen color": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([Protection(FromColor(TheChosenColor))])])",
    "This creature is the chosen color": "PermanentLayerEffect(ThisPermanent, [SetColor(TheChosenColor)])",
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{GameNumber[TheChosenColor]}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPowerAndToughnessBoth({{GameNumber[TheChosenColor][0]}})])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenColor]}}": {
    "All cards that aren't on the battlefield, spells, and permanents are the chosen color in addition to their other colors": "CardEffect(AnyCard, [AddColor(TheChosenColor)]), StackSpellsEffect(AnySpell, [AddColor(TheChosenColor)]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(AnyPermanent, [AddColor(TheChosenColor)])",
    "All instances of color words in the text of spells and permanents are changed to the chosen color word": "EachPermanentAndSpellEffect(AnyPermanentOrSpell, ReplaceAllColorWordsWithNewColorWord(TheChosenColor))",
    "All {{Permanents}} are the chosen color": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [SetColor(TheChosenColor)])",
    "All {{Permanents}} have protection from the chosen color": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([Protection(FromColor(TheChosenColor))])])",
    "Creatures of the chosen color get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsColor(TheChosenColor)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Creatures of the chosen color without {{CheckHasable}} can't attack you": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsColor(TheChosenColor), DoesntHaveAbility({{CheckHasable[0]}})]), [CantAttackPlayer(You)])",
    "Creatures you control of the chosen color get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsColor(TheChosenColor)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "If an instant or sorcery spell of the chosen color would deal damage to you, it deals that damage to its controller instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToRecipient(And([Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), IsColor(TheChosenColor)]), Player(You)), [DealToPlayerInstead(WouldDealDamage_ControllerOfDamageSource)])",
    "Your opponents can't cast spells of the chosen color": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantCastSpells(IsColor(TheChosenColor))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenColors]}}": {
    "Each spell you cast costs {{CostReduce}} less to cast for each of the chosen colors it is": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCostForEach(AnySpell, {{CostReduce[0]}}, TheNumberOfChosenColorsItIs)])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenCreatureType](~Permanent)}}": {
    "Creatures you control of the chosen type get {{PTMod}} for each {{Eachable(~Permanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, {{Eachable(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})])",
    "Each creature you control of the chosen type other than this Vehicle gets {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType), Other(ThisPermanent)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "This creature is the chosen type in addition to its other types": "CDA_Types(AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType))",
    "{{~Permanent}} is the chosen type in addition to its other types": "CDA_Types(AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType))"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenCreatureType]}}": {
    "All creatures of the chosen type get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Creature spells of the chosen type cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [DecreaseSpellCost(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Creature spells you cast of the chosen type cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Creatures of the chosen type don't untap during their controllers' untap steps": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [DoesntUntapDuringControllersUntap])",
    "Creatures of the chosen type get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Creatures of the chosen type have {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Creatures of the chosen type your opponents control get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Creatures you control are the chosen type in addition to their other types. The same is true for creature spells you control and creature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), StackSpellsEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), CardEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])",
    "Creatures you control are the chosen type. The same is true for creature spells you control and creature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [SetCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), StackSpellsEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [SetCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), CardEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [SetCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])",
    "Creatures you control of the chosen type get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Creatures you control of the chosen type get {{PTMod}} and have {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])])",
    "Creatures you control of the chosen type get {{PTMod}}. As long as {{Condition}}, they also have {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})]), If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "Creatures you control, creature spells you control, and creature cards you own in any zone other than the battlefield or the stack have the chosen type in addition to their other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), StackSpellsEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), CardEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])",
    "Double all damage that sources you control of the chosen type would deal": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASource(And([ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "Each creature card in your graveyard has the chosen creature type in addition to its other types": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect(IsCardtype(Creature), You, [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])",
    "Each creature you control is the chosen type in addition to its other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])",
    "Each other creature you control of the chosen type enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "If a triggered ability of another creature you control of the chosen type triggers, it triggers an additional time": "AbilitiesTriggerAnAdditionalTime(AbilityOfAPermanent(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])))",
    "Other creatures you control of the chosen type get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Spells of the chosen type you cast cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast. This effect reduces only the amount of colored mana you pay": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCostOnlyColored(IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Vehicle creatures you control are the chosen creature type in addition to their other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsArtifactType(Vehicle), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])",
    "You may cast creature spells of the chosen type from the top of your library": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastSpellsFromTopOfLibrary(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]))])",
    "{{Zombies}} you control and nontoken creatures you control are the chosen type in addition to their other creature types. The same is true for creature spells you control and creature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(Or([And([IsCreatureType({{Zombies[0]}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), StackSpellsEffect(IsCardtype(Creature), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)]), CardEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])",
    "{{Zombie}} creatures you control have protection from creatures of the chosen type": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddAbility([Protection(FromTypes(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCreatureTypeVariable(TheChosenCreatureType)])))])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenDirection]}}": {
    "Each player may attack only the nearest opponent in the chosen direction and planeswalkers controlled by that opponent": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [MayAttackOnlyPlayerOrPlaneswalkersControlledBy(NearestPlayerInChosenDirection(Opponent))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenLandType](~Permanent)}}": {
    "{{ThisPermanent}} is the chosen type": "PermanentLayerEffect(ThisPermanent, [SetLandTypeVariable(TheChosenLandType)])",
    "{{ThisPermanent}} is the chosen type in addition to its other types": "PermanentLayerEffect(ThisPermanent, [AddLandTypeVariable(TheChosenLandType)])",
    "{{~Permanent}} is the chosen type in addition to its other types": "PermanentLayerEffect(ThisPermanent, [AddLandTypeVariable(TheChosenLandType)])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenLandType]}}": {
    "Each land of the chosen type has {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Land), IsLandTypeVariable(TheChosenLandType)]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Lands you control are the chosen type in addition to their other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddLandTypeVariable(TheChosenLandType)])",
    "{{EnchantedLand}} is the chosen type": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [SetLandTypeVariable(TheChosenLandType)])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenName]}}": {
    "Activated abilities of sources with the chosen name can't be activated": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(AbilityOfASource(IsNamed(TheChosenName)), CantBeActivated)",
    "Activated abilities of sources with the chosen name can't be activated unless they're mana abilities": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(And([AbilityOfASource(IsNamed(TheChosenName)), NonManaAbility]), CantBeActivated)",
    "Activated abilities of sources with the chosen name cost {{ManaCost}} more to activate": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(AbilityOfASource(IsNamed(TheChosenName)), IncreaseManaCost({{ManaCost[0]}}))",
    "Activated abilities of sources with the chosen name cost {{ManaCost}} more to activate unless they're mana abilities": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(And([AbilityOfASource(IsNamed(TheChosenName)), NonManaAbility]), IncreaseManaCost({{ManaCost[0]}}))",
    "Creatures you control with the chosen name have \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsNamed(TheChosenName)]), [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])",
    "Creatures you control with the chosen name have {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsNamed(TheChosenName)]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Each creature you control with the chosen name enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsNamed(TheChosenName)])), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "Lands your opponents control with the chosen name lose all land types and abilities, and they gain \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent), IsNamed(TheChosenName)]), [RemoveAllLandTypes, LosesAllAbilities, AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])",
    "Prevent all damage that would be dealt to you and permanents you control by sources with the chosen name": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient(IsNamed(TheChosenName), APlayerOrAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)))), [PreventThatDamage])",
    "Spells with the chosen name can't be cast": "StackSpellsEffect(IsNamed(TheChosenName), [CantBeCast])",
    "Spells with the chosen name cost {{ManaCost}} more to cast": "StackSpellsEffect(And([IsNamed(TheChosenName), CastByPlayer(You)]), [IncreaseManaCost({{ManaCost[0]}})])",
    "Spells with the chosen name you cast cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "StackSpellsEffect(And([IsNamed(TheChosenName), CastByPlayer(You)]), [DecreaseManaCost({{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Spells your opponents cast with the chosen name cost {{ManaCost}} more to cast": "StackSpellsEffect(And([CastByAPlayer(Opponent), IsNamed(TheChosenName)]), [IncreaseManaCost({{ManaCost[0]}})])",
    "You have protection from the chosen card name": "PlayerEffect(You, [Protection(FromCardName(TheChosenCardName))])",
    "You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast spells with the chosen name": "PlayerEffect(You, [MaySpendManaAsThoughItWasAnyColorToCastSpells(IsNamed(TheChosenName))])",
    "Your opponents can't cast spells with the chosen name": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantCastSpells(IsNamed(TheChosenName))])",
    "Your opponents can't cast spells with the chosen name (as long as this creature is on the battlefield)": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantCastSpells(IsNamed(TheChosenName))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenNames]}}": {
    "Spells with the chosen names can't be cast and lands with the chosen names can't be played": "StackSpellsEffect(IsNamed(OneOfTheChosenNames), [CantBeCast]), CardEffect(And([IsCardtype(Land), IsNamed(OneOfTheChosenNames)]), [CantBePlayed])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenNumber](~Permanent)}}": {
    "{{~Permanent}} has protection from each mana value other than the chosen number": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([Protection(FromManaValue(EqualTo(TheChosenNumber)))])])",
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power is equal to the last chosen number and its toughness is equal to {{Digits}} minus that number": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPower(TheChosenNumber), SetToughness(Minus({{Digits[0]}}, TheChosenNumber))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenNumber]}}": {
    "Noncreature spells with mana value equal to the chosen number can't be cast": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [CantCastSpells(And([IsNonCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(EqualTo(TheChosenNumber))]))])",
    "You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast creature spells with mana value equal to the chosen number": "PlayerEffect(You, [MaySpendManaAsThoughItWasAnyColorToCastSpells(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(EqualTo(TheChosenNumber))]))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenPermanent](~Permanent)}}": {
    "This creature has all activated abilities of the chosen permanent except for loyalty abilities. You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to activate those abilities": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddActivatedAbilitiesAndMaySpendManaAsThoughItWasAnyColorToActivate(And([AbilityOfPermanent(TheChosenPermanent), NonLoyaltyAbility]))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenPermanent]}}": {
    "Activated abilities of the chosen permanent can't be activated": "PermanentRuleEffect(TheChosenPermanent, [AbilitiesCantBeActivated])",
    "The chosen creature gets {{PTMod}} and has {{Hasable}}": "PermanentLayerEffect(TheChosenPermanent, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenPlaneswalkerType]}}": {
    "As long as {{Condition}}, if damage dealt to a planeswalker you control of the chosen type would result in all loyalty counters on it being removed, instead all but one of those counters are removed": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDealDamage(LethalLoyaltyDamageWouldBeDealtToAPlaneswalker(And([IsCardtype(Planeswalker), IsPlaneswalkerTypeVariable(TheChosenPlaneswalkerType)])), [CancelThatDamage, RemoveNumberCountersOfTypeFromPermanent(Minus(NumCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(LoyaltyCounter, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent), Integer(1)), LoyaltyCounter, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])])",
    "Planeswalkers you control of the chosen type have {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Planeswalker), IsPlaneswalkerTypeVariable(TheChosenPlaneswalkerType)]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenPlayer](~Permanent)}}": {
    "This creature gets {{PTMod}} for each {{Eachable[TheChosenPlayer]}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, {{Eachable[TheChosenPlayer][0]}})])",
    "This creature has protection from the chosen player": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([Protection(FromPlayers(SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer)))])])",
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{Digits}} plus {{GameNumber[TheChosenPlayer]}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPowerAndToughnessBoth(Plus({{Digits[0]}}, {{GameNumber[TheChosenPlayer][0]}}))])",
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power and toughness are each equal to {{GameNumber[TheChosenPlayer]}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPowerAndToughnessBoth({{GameNumber[TheChosenPlayer][0]}})])",
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power is equal to {{Digits}} plus {{GameNumber[TheChosenPlayer]}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPower(Plus({{Digits[0]}}, {{GameNumber[TheChosenPlayer][0]}}))])",
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power is equal to {{GameNumber[TheChosenPlayer]}}": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPower({{GameNumber[TheChosenPlayer][0]}})])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenPlayer]}}": {
    "Creatures attacking the last chosen player get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsAttackingPlayer(TheChosenPlayer)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Creatures attacking the last chosen player have {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsAttackingPlayer(TheChosenPlayer)]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Creatures the chosen player controls can't attack you or planeswalkers you control": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer))]), [CantAttackPlayerOrPlaneswalkerControlledBy(You)])",
    "If a source would deal damage to the chosen player or a permanent they control, it deals double that damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient(AnyDamageSource, APlayerOrAPermanent(SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer), And([IsPermanent, ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer))]))), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "Permanents the chosen player controls don't untap during their untap step": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer)), [DoesntUntapDuringControllersUntap])",
    "The chosen player's maximum hand size is {{Number}}": "PlayerEffect(TheChosenPlayer, [SetMaximumHandSize({{Number[0]}})])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenQuality](~Permanent)}}": {
    "This creature has protection from each mana value of the chosen quality": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([Protection(FromManaValue(TheChosenQuality))])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenQuality]}}": {
    "Each creature with mana value of the chosen quality has {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(TheChosenQuality)]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Each creature without mana value of the chosen quality enters tapped": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(NotTheChosenQuality)])), [EntersTapped])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenTwoLandTypes]}}": {
    "Basic lands of the first chosen type are the second chosen type": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsSupertype(Basic), IsCardtype(Land), IsLandTypeVariable(TheFirstChosenLandType)]), [SetLandTypeVariable(TheSecondChosenLandType)])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheChosenTwoPlayers]}}": {
    "If a source controlled by one of the chosen players would deal damage to the other chosen player or a permanent that player controls, that source deals double that damage to that player or permanent instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient(ControlledByAPlayer(OneOfTheChosenPlayers), APlayerOrAPermanent(And([OneOfTheChosenPlayers, Other(WouldDealDamage_ControllerOfDamageSource)]), ControlledByAPlayer(And([OneOfTheChosenPlayers, Other(WouldDealDamage_ControllerOfDamageSource)])))), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheExiledCard](~Permanent)}}": {
    "This artifact has all activated abilities of the exiled card": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbilityFromExiledHasable(TheExiledCard, [ActivatedAbility])])",
    "This creature gets {{PTModXY}}, where X is the exiled creature card's power and Y is its toughness": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AdjustPTXY({{PTModXY[0]}}, PowerOfTheExiledCreature, ToughnessOfTheExiledCreature)])",
    "{{~Permanent}} has all activated and triggered abilities of the exiled card and gets {{PTModX}}, where X is the exiled card's mana value": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbilityFromExiledHasable(TheExiledCard, [ActivatedAbility, TriggeredAbility]), AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, ManaValueOfExiled(TheExiledCard))])",
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the exiled card's mana value": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPowerAndToughnessBoth(ManaValueOfExiled(TheExiledCard))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheExiledCard]}}": {
    "Players can't cast spells with the same name as the exiled card": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [CantCastSpells(SharesANameWithExiled(TheExiledCard))])",
    "Spells you cast that share a card type with the exiled card cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(SharesACardtypeWithExiledCard(TheExiledCard), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Your opponents can't cast spells with the same name as the exiled card": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantCastSpells(SharesANameWithExiled(TheExiledCard))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheExiledCards](~Permanent)}}": {
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power is equal to the total power of the exiled cards and its toughness is equal to their total toughness": "CDA_Power(TotalPowerOfExiledCards(TheExiledCards)), CDA_Toughness(TotalToughnessOfExiledCards(TheExiledCards))"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheLifePaid](~Permanent)}}": {
    "{{~Permanent}}'s power and toughness are each equal to the life paid as it entered": "PermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [SetPowerAndToughnessBoth(TheLifePaid)])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[TheObjectChosenToCopy][Equipment]}}": {
    "{{EquippedCreature}} is a copy of the last chosen card": "PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [IsACopyOf_TheObjectChosenToCopy(NoStaticCopyEffects)])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[WouldCreateTokensUnderPlayersControl]}}": {
    "If an effect would create one or more tokens under your control, it creates twice that many of those tokens instead": "ReplaceAnEffectWouldCreateAnyNumberOfTokens(AnEffectWouldCreateAnyNumberOfTokensUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, ThoseTokens])])",
    "If one or more artifact tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus an additional {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}} are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(IsCardtype(Artifact), SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "If one or more creature tokens would be created under your control, that many {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}} with {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}} are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([NumberTokens(WouldCreateTokens_NumberTokens, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}, {{Hasable[1]}}]))])])",
    "If one or more creature tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(IsCardtype(Creature), SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])])",
    "If one or more creature tokens would be created under your control, three times that many of those tokens are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, ThoseTokens, ThoseTokens])])",
    "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus a Clue token are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, ClueToken])])",
    "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus a Mutagen token are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, MutagenToken])])",
    "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus an additional Food token are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, FoodToken])])",
    "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus that many {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}} are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, NumberTokens(WouldCreateTokens_NumberTokens, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, []))])])",
    "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])])",
    "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, twice that many of those tokens are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreatedUnderAPlayersControl(AnyPermanent, SinglePlayer(You)), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, ThoseTokens])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[WouldCreateTokens]}}": {
    "If an effect would create one or more tokens, it creates twice that many of those tokens instead": "ReplaceAnEffectWouldCreateAnyNumberOfTokens(AnEffectWouldCreateAnyNumberOfTokens(AnyPermanent), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, ThoseTokens])])",
    "If one or more tokens would be created, twice that many of those tokens are created instead": "ReplaceAnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyNumberOfTokensWouldBeCreated(AnyPermanent), [CreateTokensInstead([ThoseTokens, ThoseTokens])])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[WouldDealDamage](ThatPermanent)}}": {
    "If damage would be dealt to another creature you control, prevent that damage. Put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on that creature for each 1 damage prevented this way": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToARecipient(APermanent(And([Other({{ThatPermanent}}), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), [PreventThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to another {{Permanent}}, prevent all but {{Digits}} of that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APermanent(And([Other({{ThatPermanent}}), {{Permanent[0]}}]))), [PreventAllButSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{Spell}} would deal damage to you or another permanent you control, prevent that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToARecipient({{Spell[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), And([Other({{ThatPermanent}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), [PreventThatDamage])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[WouldDealDamage](~Permanent)}}": {
    // Prevention Effects
    "As long as {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, if {{a}} {{Creature}} would deal combat damage to you, prevent {{Digits}} of that damage": "If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [PreventDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByACreatureToRecipient({{Creature[0]}}, Player(You)), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])])",
    "If combat damage would be dealt to this creature, prevent that damage and exile that many cards from the top of your library": "PreventDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage)])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature while it has {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it, prevent that damage and remove that many {{CounterType}} counters from it. When one or more counters are removed from this creature this way, it deals that much damage to any target": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveNumberCountersOfTypeFromPermanent(TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent), If(NumberOfCountersRemovedThisWayIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(Integer(1))), [ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([AnyTarget], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage(WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent, TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay, Ref_AnyTarget)])))])])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature while it has {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it, prevent that damage and remove that many {{CounterType}} counters from this creature": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveNumberCountersOfTypeFromPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature while it has {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it, prevent that damage and remove {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter from it": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveACounterOfTypeFromPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature while it has {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it, prevent that damage and remove {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter from this creature": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveACounterOfTypeFromPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature while it has {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it, prevent that damage, remove that many {{CounterType}} counters from it, then give each player a rad counter for each {{CounterType}} counter removed this way": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveNumberCountersOfTypeFromPermanent(TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent), EachPlayerAction(AnyPlayer, GetNumberRadCounters(NumberOfCountersRemovedThisWay))])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature, prevent that damage and remove that many {{CounterType}} counters from it": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveNumberCountersOfTypeFromPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature, prevent that damage. Put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on this creature for each 1 damage prevented this way": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature, prevent that damage. Remove {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter from this creature": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveACounterOfTypeFromPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature, prevent that damage. When damage is prevented this way, this creature deals that much damage to any other target": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, If(DamageWasPreventedThisWay, [ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([AnyOtherTarget({{~Permanent}})], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage({{~Permanent}}, TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay, Ref_AnyTarget)])))])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to {{~Permanent}} while it has {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it, prevent that damage and remove that many {{CounterType}} counters from it": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveNumberCountersOfTypeFromPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to {{~Permanent}} while it's equipped, prevent that damage. When damage is prevented this way, sacrifice an Equipment attached to {{~Permanent}}": "If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsEquipped), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, If(DamageWasPreventedThisWay, [ReflexiveTrigger(ActionList([SacrificeAPermanent(And([IsArtifactType(Equipment), AttachedToPermanent({{~Permanent}})]))]))])])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to {{~Permanent}} while you're the monarch, prevent that damage and put that many {{CounterType}} counters on it": "If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, IsTheMonarch), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to {{~Permanent}}, prevent that damage and an opponent of your choice gains control of it": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, ChooseAPlayer(Opponent), PlayerAction(TheChosenPlayer, GainControlOfPermanent({{~Permanent}}))])",
    "If damage would be dealt to {{~Permanent}}, prevent that damage and put that many {{CounterType}} counters on him": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If damage would be dealt to {{~Permanent}}, prevent that damage, remove that many {{CounterType}} counters from {{~Permanent}}, and create that many {{PT}} {{CreatureTokens}}": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveNumberCountersOfTypeFromPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}}), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureTokens[0]}}, []))])])",
    "If noncombat damage would be dealt to this creature, prevent that damage. Put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on this creature for each 1 damage prevented this way": "PreventDamage(NoncombatDamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])",
    "If this creature would be dealt damage, prevent that damage and remove {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter from it": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, RemoveACounterOfTypeFromPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If this creature would deal combat damage to {{a}} {{Creature}}, prevent that damage and that creature's owner shuffles it into their library": "PreventDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByCreatureToARecipient({{~Permanent}}, APermanent({{Creature[0]}})), [PreventThatDamage, ShufflePermanentIntoLibrary(WouldDealDamage_DamageRecipientPermanent)])",
    "If {{a}} {{Creature}} would deal combat damage to this creature, prevent that damage and put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on this creature": "PreventDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByACreatureToRecipient({{Creature[0]}}, Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{Creature}} would deal combat damage to you and/or one or more {{Creatures}}, prevent X of that damage, where X is {{GameNumber(~Permanent)}}": "PreventDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByACreatureToASetOfRecipients({{Creature[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), {{Creatures[0]}})), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{GameNumber(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to this creature, prevent that damage. The source's controller draws cards equal to the damage prevented this way": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage, PlayerAction(WouldDealDamage_ControllerOfDamageSource, DrawNumberCards(TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to you, prevent that damage and put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on this enchantment": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, Player(You)), [PreventThatDamage, PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal {{Digits}} or less damage to this creature, prevent that damage": "PreventDamage(AnAmountOfDamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient(LessThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}), {{DamageSource[0]}}, Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [PreventThatDamage])",

    // Replacement Effects
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to this creature, it deals double that damage to this creature instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If damage would be dealt to this creature, put that many {{CounterType}} counters on it instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [CancelThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If damage would be dealt to you, put that many {{CounterType}} counters on this enchantment instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [CancelThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])",
    "If damage would be dealt to {{~Permanent}}, sacrifice that many permanents instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [CancelThatDamage, SacrificeNumberPermanents(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, AnyPermanent)])",
    "If damage would be dealt to {{~Permanent}}, instead that damage is dealt, but all other damage already dealt to him is healed": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Permanent({{~Permanent}})), [DealDamageButHealPreviousDamage])",
    "If this creature would deal combat damage to a player, it deals double that damage to that player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByCreatureToARecipient({{~Permanent}}, APlayer(AnyPlayer)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal an amount of noncombat damage less than {{~Permanent}}'s power to an opponent, that source deals damage equal to {{~Permanent}}'s power instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(AnAmountOfNonCombatDamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient(LessThan(PowerOfPermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayer(Opponent)), [DealDamageInstead(PowerOfPermanent({{~Permanent}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, it deals that much damage plus an amount of damage equal to {{GameNumber(~Permanent)}} instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent))), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{GameNumber(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}))])",
    "If {{~Permanent}} would deal combat damage to a player, instead put that many {{CounterType}} counters on {{~Permanent}} and that player mills that many cards": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByCreatureToARecipient({{~Permanent}}, APlayer(AnyPlayer)), [CancelThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}}), PlayerAction(WouldDealDamage_DamageRecipientPlayer, MillNumberCards(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[WouldDealDamage][EquippedCreature]}}": {
    "If {{EquippedCreature}} would deal combat damage, it deals double that damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByCreature(HostPermanent), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",

    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to {{EquippedCreature}}, prevent X of that damage, where X is {{GameNumber}}": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, Permanent(HostPermanent)), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{GameNumber[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to {{EquippedCreature}}, prevent {{Digits}} of that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, Permanent(HostPermanent)), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[WouldDealDamage][ThisSource]}}": {
    "If another source you control would deal noncombat damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(NoncombatDamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient(And([Other(ThisDamageSource), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If another {{Black}} source you control would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient(And([Other(ThisDamageSource), IsColor({{Black[0]}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[WouldDealDamage]}}": {
    "As long as {{Condition}}, if {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, if {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal noncombat damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} instead": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDealDamage(NoncombatDamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent))), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])])",
    "Double all damage that {{Permanents}} would deal": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If damage would be dealt to a player, that player exiles that many cards from the top of their library instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToARecipient(APlayer(AnyPlayer)), [CancelThatDamage, PlayerAction(WouldDealDamage_DamageRecipientPlayer, ExileTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If damage would be dealt to you, exile that many cards from your graveyard instead. If you can't, you lose the game": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [CancelThatDamage, MustCost(ExileNumberGraveyardCards(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You)))), Unless(CostWasPaid, [LoseTheGame])])",
    "If damage would be dealt to you, prevent that damage and mill twice that many cards": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [PreventThatDamage, MillNumberCards(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If damage would be dealt to you, prevent that damage. Exile a card from your graveyard for each 1 damage prevented this way": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [PreventThatDamage, ExileNumberGraveyardCards(TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You)))])",
    "If noncombat damage would be dealt to you, prevent that damage. You gain life equal to the damage prevented this way": "PreventDamage(NoncombatDamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [PreventThatDamage, GainLife(TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay)])",
    "If {{a}} {{Creature}} would deal combat damage to a player, instead that player mills that many cards": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(CombatDamageWouldBeDealtByACreatureToARecipient({{Creature[0]}}, APlayer(AnyPlayer)), [CancelThatDamage, PlayerAction(WouldDealDamage_DamageRecipientPlayer, MillNumberCards(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a creature you control, it deals that much damage minus {{Digits}} to that creature instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), [DealDamageInstead(Minus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a creature, battle, or opponent, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, Or([IsCardtype(Creature), IsCardtype(Battle)]))), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals half that damage, rounded down, to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(HalfRoundedDown(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals triple that damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Thrice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals triple that damage to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Thrice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a planeswalker you control, prevent {{Digits}} of that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APermanent(And([IsCardtype(Planeswalker), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a player, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} to that player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayer(AnyPlayer)), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to a player, you may prevent X of that damage, where X is {{GameNumber}}": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayer(AnyPlayer)), [MayActions([PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{GameNumber[0]}})])])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, it deals double that damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent))), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent))), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, that source deals double that damage to that player or permanent instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent))), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to an opponent, it deals double that damage to that player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayer(Opponent)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to an opponent, prevent that damage and each opponent mills that many cards": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayer(Opponent)), [PreventThatDamage, EachPlayerAction(Opponent, MillNumberCards(TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to you or a creature you control, prevent {{Digits}} of that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to you or a permanent you control, prevent half that damage, rounded up": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)))), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage(HalfRoundedUp(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to you or a permanent you control, prevent {{Digits}} of that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)))), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to you, it deals double that damage to you instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, Player(You)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to you, prevent {{Digits}} of that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, Player(You)), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to {{a}} {{Zombie}} creature you control, prevent {{Digits}} of that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APermanent(And([IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal noncombat damage to a creature an opponent controls, put that many {{CounterType}} counters on that creature instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(NoncombatDamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)]))), [CancelThatDamage, PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldDealDamage_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal noncombat damage to a permanent or player while {{Condition}}, it deals double that damage instead": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal noncombat damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, it deals double that damage to that player or permanent instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, And([IsPermanent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)]))), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal noncombat damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, And([IsPermanent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)]))), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal noncombat damage to an opponent, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayer(Opponent)), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal {{Digits}} or more damage to a permanent or player, that source deals {{Digits}} damage to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(AnAmountOfDamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}), {{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead({{Digits[1]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal {{Digits}} or more damage to you, it deals {{Digits}} damage to you instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(AnAmountOfDamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToRecipient(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}), {{DamageSource[0]}}, Player(You)), [DealDamageInstead({{Digits[1]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{Permanent}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanentToARecipient({{Permanent[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{Permanent}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanentToARecipient({{Permanent[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{Permanent}} would deal damage to you, prevent {{Digits}} of that damage": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanentToRecipient({{Permanent[0]}}, Player(You)), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{Permanent}} would deal damage, it deals double that damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{Permanent}} would deal damage, it deals twice that much damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "If {{a}} {{Spell}} or {{a}} {{Permanent}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(Or([DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToARecipient({{Spell[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), DamageWouldBeDealtByAPermanentToARecipient({{Permanent[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent))]), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{Spell}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage minus {{Digits}} to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToARecipient({{Spell[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Minus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{Spell}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} to that permanent or player instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToARecipient({{Spell[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{Spell}} would deal damage to a permanent or player, prevent {{Digits}} damage that spell would deal to that permanent or player": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToARecipient({{Spell[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent)), [PreventSomeOfThatDamage({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If {{a}} {{Spell}} would deal damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToARecipient({{Spell[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent))), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If {{a}} {{Spell}} would deal damage to an opponent, prevent that damage. Create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}} for each 1 damage prevented this way": "PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpellToARecipient({{Spell[0]}}, APlayer(Opponent)), [PreventThatDamage, CreateTokens([NumberTokens(TheAmountOfDamagePreventedThisWay, TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}]))])])",
    "If {{a}} {{Spell}} would deal damage, it deals double that damage instead": "ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASpell({{Spell[0]}}), [DealDamageInstead(Twice(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage))])",
    "Max speed - If {{a}} {{DamageSource}} would deal damage to an opponent or a permanent an opponent controls, it deals that much damage plus {{Digits}} instead": "MaxSpeed(ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtByASourceToARecipient({{DamageSource[0]}}, APlayerOrAPermanent(Opponent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent))), [DealDamageInstead(Plus(WouldDealDamage_ThatMuchDamage, {{Digits[0]}}))]))"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect[WouldRollPlanarDice]}}": {
    "If you would roll one or more planar dice, instead roll that many planar dice plus one and ignore one": "ReplaceWouldRollPlanarDice(APlayerWouldRollANumberOfPlanarDice(SinglePlayer(You)), [WouldRollDice_RollThatManyPlusOneAndIgnoreOne])"
  },
  "{{StaticEffect}}": {
    "A player losing unspent mana causes that player to lose that much life": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [AsLoseUnspentMana(AnyUnspentMana, [PlayerAction(AsLoseUnspentMana_ThePlayerLosingMana, LoseLife(AsLoseUnspentMana_AmountOfUnspentMana))])])",
    "A player who controls more permanents than each other player can't play lands or cast {{PotentialSpells}}. That player may sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}} of their choice for that player to ignore this effect until end of turn": "PlayerEffect_PlayerMayPayToIgnoreEffectUntil(ControlsMorePermanentsThanEachPlayer(AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent), [CantPlayLands, CantCastSpells({{PotentialSpells[0]}})], SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), UntilEndOfTurn)",
    "Abilities you activate that aren't mana abilities cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate. This effect can't reduce the mana in that cost to less than one mana": "PlayerEffect(You, [ReduceManaCostOfActivatedAbilitiesNotLessThanOne(NonManaAbility, {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Abilities your opponents activate that target {{a}} {{Zombie}} you control cost {{ManaCost}} more to activate": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [IncreaseAbilityCost(TargetsAPermanent(And([IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])",
    "Activated abilities cost an additional \"{{SacrificeAPermanentCost}}\" to activate for each {{Black}} mana symbol in their activation costs": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(AnyAbility, AdditionalCostForEachColorManaSymbolInCosts({{SacrificeAPermanentCost[0]}}, {{Black[0]}}))",
    "Activated abilities cost {{ManaCost}} more to activate unless they're mana abilities": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(NonManaAbility, IncreaseManaCost({{ManaCost[0]}}))",
    "Activated abilities of {{Permanents}} can't be activated": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(AbilityOfAPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), CantBeActivated)",
    "Activated abilities of {{Permanents}} can't be activated unless they're mana abilities": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(And([AbilityOfAPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), NonManaAbility]), CantBeActivated)",
    "Activated abilities of {{Permanents}} cost an additional \"{{SacrificeAPermanentCost}}\" to activate": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(AbilityOfAPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), AdditionalCost({{SacrificeAPermanentCost[0]}}))",
    "Activated abilities of {{Permanents}} cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [ReduceManaCostOfActivatedAbilities(AbilityOfAPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Activated abilities of {{Permanents}} cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate. This effect can't reduce the mana in that cost to less than one mana": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [ReduceManaCostOfActivatedAbilitiesNotLessThanOne(AbilityOfAPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Activated abilities of {{Permanents}} cost {{ManaCost}} more to activate": "ActivatedAbilityEffect(AbilityOfAPermanent({{Permanents[0]}}), IncreaseManaCost({{ManaCost[0]}}))",
    "Activated abilities of {{SpecificCards}} in your graveyard cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [DecreaseAbilityCostOfCardsInPlayersGraveyard({{SpecificCards[0]}}, You, {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "After you roll a die, you may pay {{Digits}} life. If you do, increase or decrease the result by 1. Do this only once each turn": "PlayerEffect(You, [OnceEachTurnMayPayToIncrementOrDecrementADiceRoll(PayLife({{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "All cards that aren't on the battlefield, spells, and permanents are colorless": "CardEffect(AnyCard, [SetColor(Colorless)]), StackSpellsEffect(AnySpell, [SetColor(Colorless)]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(AnyPermanent, [SetColor(Colorless)])",
    "All damage is dealt as though its source had wither": "AllDamageIsDealtAsThoughItsSourceHadWither",
    "All morph costs cost {{ManaCost}} more": "IncreaseMorphCosts({{ManaCost[0]}})",
    "All permanents are artifacts in addition to their other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(AnyPermanent, [AddCardtype(Artifact)])",
    "All spells have split second": "StackSpellsEffect(AnySpell, [SplitSecond])",
    "All {{Creatures}} are {{Black}} and are {{Zombies}} in addition to their other creature types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [SetColor(TheChosenColor)])",
    "All {{Creatures}} attack each combat if able": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [MustAttack])",
    "All {{Creatures}} block each combat if able": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [MustBlock])",
    "All {{Creatures}} can attack your opponents and planeswalkers your opponents control as though those creatures had haste": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [CanAttackPlayersAndPlaneswalkersAsThoughItHadHaste(Opponent)])",
    "All {{Creatures}} get {{PTModX}}, where X is {{GameNumber}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, {{GameNumber[0]}})])",
    "All {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "All {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}} and have {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "All {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}} as long as {{Condition}}": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "All {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}} for each {{Eachable(ThatPermanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, {{Eachable(ThatPermanent=EachablePermanent)[0]}})])",
    "All {{Creatures}} have {{Hasable}} and attack each combat if able": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]), EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [MustAttack])",
    "All {{Creatures}} lose all abilities and have base power and toughness {{PT}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [LosesAllAbilities, SetPT({{PT[0]}})])",
    "All {{Lands}} and all {{Creatures}} are {{PT}} {{Black}} {{Zombie}} creatures and {{Swamp}} lands in addition to their other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(Or([{{Lands[0]}}, {{Creatures[0]}}]), [SetPT({{PT[0]}}), AddColor(SimpleColorList([{{Black[0]}}])), AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), AddCardtype(Creature), AddLandType({{Swamp[0]}}), AddCardtype(Land)])",
    "All {{Lands}} are {{PT}} creatures that are still lands": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Lands[0]}}, [SetPT({{PT[0]}}), AddCardtype(Creature)])",
    "All {{Lands}} are {{PT}} {{Black}} creatures that are still lands": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Lands[0]}}, [SetPT({{PT[0]}}), SetColor(SimpleColorList([{{Black[0]}}])), AddCardtype(Creature)])",
    "All {{Lands}} are {{Swamps}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Lands[0]}}, [SetLandType({{Swamps[0]}})])",
    "All {{Lands}} are {{Swamps}} in addition to their other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Lands[0]}}, [AddLandType({{Swamps[0]}})])",
    "All {{Permanents}} are colorless": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [SetColor(Colorless)])",
    "All {{Permanents}} are enchantments in addition to their other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddCardtype(Enchantment)])",
    "All {{Permanents}} are legendary": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddSupertype(Snow)])",
    "All {{Permanents}} are no longer snow": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [RemoveSupertype(Snow)])",
    "All {{Permanents}} are {{Black}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [SetColor(SimpleColorList([{{Black[0]}}]))])",
    "All {{Permanents}} are {{Black}} and have {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [SetColor(SimpleColorList([{{Black[0]}}])), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "All {{Permanents}} have \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])",
    "All {{Permanents}} have \"{{QuotedAbility}}\" and lose all other abilities": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [LosesAllAbilities, AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])",
    "All {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "All {{Permanents}} lose all abilities except mana abilities": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [LosesAbility(NonManaAbility)])",
    "All {{Permanents}} lose {{CheckHasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [LosesAbility({{CheckHasable[0]}})])",
    "All {{Permanents}} lose {{CheckHasable}} and {{CheckHasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [LosesAbility({{CheckHasable[0]}}), LosesAbility({{CheckHasable[1]}})])",
    "All {{Permanents}} untap during each player's untap step": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [UntapsDuringOtherPlayersUntapSteps(AnyPlayer)])",
    "Any player may cast {{PotentialSpells}} as though they had flash": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [MayCastSpellsAsThoughTheyHadFlash({{PotentialSpells[0]}})])",
    "Any player may cast {{PotentialSpells}} without paying their mana costs and as though they had flash": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [MayCastSpellsWithoutPayingAndAsThoughTheyHadFlash({{PotentialSpells[0]}})])",
    "Any time you could cast a sorcery, you may exile {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from your hand with X time counters on it, where X is its mana value. If the exiled card doesn't have suspend, it gains suspend": "PlayerEffect(You, [MaySuspendCardsFromHand({{SpecificCard[0]}})])",
    "Artifacts and creatures entering don't cause abilities to trigger": "PermanentsEnteringTheBattlefieldDontCauseAbilitiesToTrigger(Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Creature)]))",
    "As an additional cost to cast creature spells, you may pay any amount of mana. If you do, that creature enters with that many additional {{CounterType}} counters on it": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPayAdditionalCostToCastSpellsForEffect(IsCardtype(Creature), PayAnyAmountOfMana, [EntersWithNumberCounters(AmountOfManaPaidThisWay, {{CounterType[0]}})])])",
    "As an additional cost to cast {{PotentialSpells}}, you may pay {{Digits}} life. Those spells cost {{ManaCost}} less to cast if you paid life this way. This effect reduces only the amount of {{Black}} mana you pay": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPayToReduceColoredManaCostOfSpells(PayLife({{Digits[0]}}), {{ManaCost[0]}}, {{PotentialSpells[0]}})])",
    "As long as the top card of your library is a creature card, creatures you control that share a color with that card get {{PTMod}}": "If(TopCardOfPlayersLibraryPassesFilter(You, IsCardtype(Creature)), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), SharesAColorWithTheTopCardOfPlayersLibrary(You)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as the top card of your library is {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, you may look at it any time and you may cast it": "If(TopCardOfPlayersLibraryPassesFilter_Digital(You, {{SpecificCard[0]}}), [PlayerEffect(You, [MayLookAtTopCardOfLibraryAnyTime, MayCastSpellsFromTopOfLibrary(AnySpell)])])",
    "As long as there are {{Number}} or more card types among cards in your graveyard, each opponent's maximum hand size is equal to {{Number}} minus the number of those card types": "If(ThereAreNumberCardTypesInPlayersGraveyard(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Number[0]}}), You), [EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [SetMaximumHandSize(Minus({{Number[1]}}, TheNumberOfCardtypesAmongGraveyardCards(InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You)))))])])",
    "As long as you control exactly one creature, that creature gets {{PTMod}} and has {{Hasable}}": "If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, ControlsNum(EqualTo(Integer(1)), IsCardtype(Creature))), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as you control exactly one creature, that creature gets {{PTMod}} and has {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}}": "If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, ControlsNum(EqualTo(Integer(1)), IsCardtype(Creature))), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])])])",
    "As long as you control exactly one creature, that creature has {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}}": "If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, ControlsNum(EqualTo(Integer(1)), IsCardtype(Creature))), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition[TheTopCardOfYourLibrary]}}, {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}}": "If({{Condition[TheTopCardOfYourLibrary][0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, activated abilities of cards in your graveyard cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate. This effect can't reduce the mana in that ability's activation cost to less than one mana": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [ActivatedAbilityEffect(AbilityOfACardInPlayersGraveyard(AnyCard, You), ReduceManaCostNotLessThanOne({{CostReduce[0]}}))])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, all damage is dealt to you as though its source had infect": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDealDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [DealDamageAsThoughItHadInfect])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, damage doesn't cause you to lose life": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [PlayerEffect(You, [DamageDoesntCauseLifeLoss])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, damage that would reduce your life total to less than {{Digits}} reduces it to {{Digits}} instead": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [PlayerEffect(You, [DamageThatWouldReduceLifeTotalToLessThanNumberReducesItToThatNumberInstead({{Digits[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, each other {{Enchantment}} is a creature in addition to its other types and has base power and base toughness each equal to {{GameNumber(ThatPermanent)}}": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Enchantment[0]}}]), [AddCardtype(Creature), SetPowerAndToughnessBoth({{GameNumber(ThatPermanent=EachablePermanent)[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, each other {{Permanent}} enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanent[0]}}])), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has flashback. The flashback cost is equal to that card's mana cost": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Flashback(ItsManaCost)])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, if you would draw one or more cards, you draw that many cards plus one instead": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [ReplaceWouldDraw(APlayerWouldDrawOneOrMoreCards(SinglePlayer(You)), [DrawNumberCards(Plus(WouldDrawACard_ThatMany, Integer(1)))])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, other {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}}": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Creatures[0]}}]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, other {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}}": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanents[0]}}]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, prevent all damage that would be dealt to you": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [PreventThatDamage])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, you may cast {{PotentialSpells}} from the top of your library": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastSpellsFromTopOfLibrary({{PotentialSpells[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, you may pay {{ManaCost}} rather than pay cycling costs": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [PlayerEffect(You, [MayPayAlternateCyclingCosts({{ManaCost[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, you may play cards from the top of your library": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlayCardsFromTopOfLibrary])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, you may play lands from the top of your library": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlayLandsFromTopOfLibrary(AnyCard)])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}}": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}} and have {{Hasable}}": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, {{Permanents}} can't be blocked": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [CantBeBlocked])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, {{Permanents}} have \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}}": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{Condition}}, {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}}": "If({{Condition[0]}}, [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])])])",
    "As long as {{~Permanent}} is equipped, if a triggered ability of {{~Permanent}} or an Equipment attached to it triggers, that ability triggers an additional time": "If(PermanentPassesFilter(ThisPermanent, IsEquipped), [AbilitiesTriggerAnAdditionalTime(AbilityOfAPermanent(Or([SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent), And([IsArtifactType(Equipment), AttachedToPermanent(ThisPermanent)])])))])",
    "As you cascade, you may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among the exiled cards onto the battlefield tapped": "PlayerEffect(You, [AsTheyCascadeTheyMayPutACardFromAmongExiledCardsOnBattlefiled({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersTapped])])",
    "As {{a}} {{Permanent}} enters, it becomes {{a}} {{PT}} {{Zombie}} creature in addition to its other types": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield({{Permanent[0]}}), [EntersWithLayerEffect([SetPT({{PT[0]}}), AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), AddCardtype(Creature)])])",
    "Blitz costs you pay cost {{ManaCost}} less for each {{Eachable}}": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseBlitzCostsForEach({{ManaCost[0]}}, {{Eachable[0]}})])",
    "Boast abilities you activate cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate for each {{Eachable}}": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseBoastAbilityCostForEach({{CostReduce[0]}}, {{Eachable[0]}})])",
    "Buyback costs cost {{ManaCost}} less": "IncreaseBuybackCosts({{ManaCost[0]}})",
    "Cards in graveyards can't be the targets of {{PotentialSpellsOrAbilities}}": "EachCardInAGraveyardEffect(AnyCardInAnyGraveyard, AnyPlayer, [CantBeTheTargetOfSpellsOrAbilities({{PotentialSpellsOrAbilities[0]}})])",
    "Cards in graveyards lose all abilities": "EachCardInAGraveyardEffect(AnyCardInAnyGraveyard, AnyPlayer, [LosesAllAbilities])",
    "Colorless spells you cast from your hand with mana value {{Digits}} or greater have \"Cascade, cascade\"": "PlayerEffect(You, [SpellsCastFromHandHaveAbility(And([IsColorless, ManaValueIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))]), [Cascade, Cascade])])",
    "Colorless spells you cast with mana value {{Digits}} or greater cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(And([IsColorless, ManaValueIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Combat damage can't be prevented": "CombatDamageCantBePrevented",
    "Combat damage that would be dealt by {{Creatures}} can't be prevented": "CombatDamageOfCreaturesCantBePrevented({{Creatures[0]}})",
    "Counters can't be put on {{Permanents}}": "CountersCantBePutOnPermanents({{Permanents[0]}})",
    "Creature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield have flash": "CardEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddAbility([Flash])])",
    "Creature spells you cast gain offspring {{ManaCost}} as you cast them": "PlayerEffect(You, [SpellsCastGainAbility(AnySpell, [Offspring({{ManaCost[0]}})])])",
    "Creature spells you cast with mana value {{Digits}} or greater cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Creature spells you cast with power {{Digits}} or greater cost {{ManaCost}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [IncreaseSpellCost(And([IsCardtype(Creature), PowerIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))]), PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])",
    "Creatures can't attack a player unless that player cast a spell or put a nontoken permanent onto the battlefield during their last turn": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(IsCardtype(Creature), [CantAttackAPlayer(ExceptFor(Or([CastASpellDuringTheirLastTurn(AnySpell), PutAPermanentOnBattleDuringTheirLastTurn(IsNonToken)])))])",
    "Creatures entering don't cause abilities to trigger": "PermanentsEnteringTheBattlefieldDontCauseAbilitiesToTrigger(IsCardtype(Creature))",
    "Creatures entering or dying don't cause abilities to trigger": "PermanentsEnteringTheBattlefieldDontCauseAbilitiesToTrigger(IsCardtype(Creature)), PermanentsDyingDontCauseAbilitiesToTrigger(IsCardtype(Creature))",
    "Creatures with {{CheckHasable}} can be blocked as though they didn't have those abilities": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[0]}})]), [CanBeBlockedAsThoughItDidntHave({{CheckHasable[0]}})])",
    "Creatures with {{CheckHasable}} can be blocked as though they didn't have {{CheckHasable}}": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[0]}})]), [CanBeBlockedAsThoughItDidntHave({{CheckHasable[1]}})])",
    "Creatures you control are every creature type. The same is true for creature spells you control and creature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [HasAllCreatureTypes]), StackSpellsEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [HasAllCreatureTypes]), CardEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [HasAllCreatureTypes])",
    "Cycling abilities you activate cost {{ManaCost}} less to activate": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseCyclingCosts({{ManaCost[0]}})])",
    "Damage can't be prevented": "DamageCantBePrevented",
    "Damage isn't removed from this creature during cleanup steps": "DamageIsntRemovedFromCreaturesDuringCleanup(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent))",
    "Damage isn't removed from {{Creatures}} during cleanup steps": "DamageIsntRemovedFromCreaturesDuringCleanup({{Creatures[0]}})",
    "Damage that would reduce your life total to less than {{Digits}} reduces it to {{Digits}} instead": "PlayerEffect(You, [DamageThatWouldReduceLifeTotalToLessThanNumberReducesItToThatNumberInstead({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "Dash costs you pay cost {{CostReduce}} less (as long as this creature is on the battlefield)": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseDashCost({{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "During combat, players can't cast {{PotentialSpells}} or activate abilities that aren't mana abilities": "If(IsDuringCombat, [EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [CantCastSpells({{PotentialSpells[0]}}), CantActivateNonManaAbilities])])",
    "During each of your turns, you may play a land and cast a permanent spell of each permanent type from your graveyard": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlayALandOrCastASpellFromTheirGraveyardOfEachPermanentTypeDuringPlayersTurn(You)])",
    "During each of your turns, you may play a land and cast a spell from among cards in graveyards that were put there from libraries this turn": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlayALandOrCastASpellFromAmongCardsInGraveyardsOnceEachTurn(WasPutIntoGraveyardFromLibraryThisTurn, AnyPlayer)])])",
    "During each opponent's end step, you may cast {{PotentialSpells}} as though they had flash": "If(And([IsAPlayersTurn(Opponent), IsDuringEndStep]), [PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastSpellsAsThoughTheyHadFlash({{PotentialSpells[0]}})])])",
    "During turns other than yours, {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}}": "If(IsAPlayersTurn(Other(You)), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "During turns other than yours, {{Creatures}} have {{Hasable}}": "If(IsAPlayersTurn(Other(You)), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "During turns other than yours, {{PotentialSpells}} you cast cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "If(IsAPlayersTurn(Other(You)), [PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost({{PotentialSpells[0]}}, {{CostReduce[0]}})])])",
    "During your end step, {{Permanents}} have \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "If(And([IsPlayersTurn(You), IsDuringEndStep]), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])])",
    "During your turn, each {{Creature}} assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AssignsToughnessCombatDamage])])",
    "During your turn, each {{Permanent}} is {{a}} {{PT}} {{Zombie}} creature in addition to its other types and has {{Hasable}}, {{Hasable}}, and \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [SetPT({{PT[0]}}), AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), AddCardtype(Creature), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}]), AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])])",
    "During your turn, each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has flashback {{ManaCost}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Flashback(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])])",
    "During your turn, each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has flashback. Its flashback cost is equal to its mana cost": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Flashback(ItsManaCost)])])])",
    "During your turn, each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has flashback. The flashback cost is equal to that card's mana cost": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Flashback(ItsManaCost)])])])",
    "During your turn, other {{Permanents}} get {{PTMod}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanents[0]}}]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "During your turn, other {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanents[0]}}]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "During your turn, prevent all damage that would be dealt to you": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [PreventDamage(DamageWouldBeDealtToRecipient(Player(You)), [PreventThatDamage])])",
    "During your turn, spells you cast cost {{CostReduce}} less to cast for each {{Eachable}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCostForEach(AnySpell, {{CostReduce[0]}}, {{Eachable[0]}})])])",
    "During your turn, spells you cast from your hand with mana value X or less have cascade, where X is {{GameNumber}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [StackSpellsEffect(And([CastByPlayerFromHand(You, You), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{GameNumber[0]}}))]), [Cascade])])",
    "During your turn, spells your opponents cast cost {{ManaCost}} more to cast and abilities your opponents activate cost {{ManaCost}} more to activate unless they're mana abilities": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [IncreaseSpellCost(AnySpell, PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), IncreaseAbilityCost(NonManaAbility, PayMana({{ManaCost[1]}}))])])",
    "During your turn, you may activate equip abilities any time you could cast an instant": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [PlayerEffect(You, [MayActivateEquipAbilitiesAnyTimeTheyCouldCastAnInstant])])",
    "During your turn, you may cast creature spells with power or toughness {{Digits}} or less from your graveyard. If you cast a spell this way, that creature enters with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [PlayerEffect(You, [MayCastSpellsFromGraveyardWithEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), Or([PowerIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}})), ToughnessIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))])]), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You)), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])])])",
    "During your turn, you may play cards from your graveyard": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlayGraveyardCards(InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You)))])])",
    "During your turn, you may play cards you don't own with {{CounterType}} counters on them from exile, and mana of any type can be spent to cast those spells": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlayExiledCardsAndMaySpendManaAsThoughAnyTypeToCast(And([OwnedByAPlayer(Other(You)), HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})]))])])",
    "During your turn, your opponents can't cast spells or activate abilities of artifacts, creatures, or enchantments": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantCastSpells(AnySpell), CantActivateAbilities(AbilityOfAPermanent(Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Creature), IsCardtype(Enchantment)])))])])",
    "During your turn, {{Artifacts}} are Foods in addition to their other types and have \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Artifacts[0]}}, [AddArtifactType(Food), AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])])",
    "During your turn, {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])])",
    "During your turn, {{Creatures}} get {{PTMod}} and have {{Hasable}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creatures[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "During your turn, {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])])",
    "During your turn, {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}} and equip abilities you activate cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]), PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseEquipAbilityCost({{CostReduce[0]}})])])",
    "During your turn, {{Permanents}} have {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}}": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])])])",
    "During your turn, {{SpecificCards}} in your graveyard have retrace": "If(IsPlayersTurn(You), [EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCards[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Retrace])])])",
    "Each Saga spell you cast has replicate. The replicate cost is equal to its mana cost": "StackSpellsEffect(And([IsEnchantmentType(Saga), CastByPlayer(You)]), [Replicate(ItsManaCost)])",
    "Each Vehicle you control gets {{PTMod}} as long as it's a creature": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsArtifactType(Vehicle), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsCardtype(Creature)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Each creature card in your graveyard that's {{a}} {{Zombie}}, {{Zombie}}, {{Zombie}}, and/or {{Zombie}} has unearth {{ManaCost}}": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), Or([IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[1]}}), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[2]}}), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[3]}})])]), You, [AddAbility([Unearth(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "Each creature spell you cast costs {{CostReduce}} less to cast if it has {{CheckHasable}}": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(And([IsCardtype(Creature), HasAbility({{CheckHasable[0]}})]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Each creature spell you cast has emerge. The emerge cost is equal to its mana cost": "StackSpellsEffect(And([IsEnchantmentType(Saga), CastByPlayer(You)]), [Emerge(ItsManaCost)])",
    "Each creature spell you cast with mana value {{Digits}} or greater has blitz. The blitz cost is equal to its mana cost": "PlayerEffect(You, [SpellsCastHaveAbility(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}}))]), [Blitz(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each creature spell you cast with toughness greater than its power costs {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(And([IsCardtype(Creature), PowerIsLessThanToughness]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Each creature you control has {{Hasable}} if it's {{Black}}, {{Hasable}} if it's {{Black}}, {{Hasable}} if it's {{Black}}, {{Hasable}} if it's {{Black}}, and {{Hasable}} if it's {{Black}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsColor({{Black[0]}})]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsColor({{Black[1]}})]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsColor({{Black[2]}})]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[2]}}])]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsColor({{Black[3]}})]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[3]}}])]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), IsColor({{Black[4]}})]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[4]}}])])",
    "Each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard has flashback. The flashback cost is equal to that card's mana cost": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect(Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), You, [AddAbility([Flashback(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard that's exactly two colors has jump-start": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect(And([Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), IsNumberColors(EqualTo(Integer(2)))]), You, [AddAbility([JumpStart])])",
    "Each instant and sorcery spell you cast has replicate. The replicate cost is equal to its mana cost": "PlayerEffect(You, [SpellsCastHaveAbility(Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), [Replicate(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each land gets {{PTMod}} as long as it's a creature": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([IsCardtype(Land), IsCardtype(Creature)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Each legendary spell you cast that's one or more colors has web-slinging {{ManaCost}}": "StackSpellsEffect(And([IsSupertype(Legendary), CastByPlayer(You), IsNumberColors(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(Integer(1)))]), [WebSlinging(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])",
    "Each nonland card in your graveyard has mayhem. The mayhem cost is equal to its mana cost": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect(IsNonCardtype(Land), You, [AddAbility([Mayhem(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each nonland card in your hand without foretell has foretell. Its foretell cost is equal to its mana cost reduced by {{CostReduce}}": "EachCardInPlayersHandEffect(And([IsNonCardtype(Land), DoesntHaveAbility(AnyForetell)]), You, [AddAbility([Foretell(ItsManaCostReducedBy({{CostReduce[0]}}))])])",
    "Each opponent can cast spells only any time they could cast a sorcery": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CanCastSpellsOnlyAnyTimeTheyCouldCastASorcery])",
    "Each opponent can't cast more than one {{PotentialSpell}} each turn": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantCastMoreThanNumberSpellsEachTurn(Integer(1), {{PotentialSpell[0]}})])",
    "Each opponent can't cast {{PotentialSpells(ThatPlayer)}}": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantCastSpells({{PotentialSpells(ThatPlayer=EachablePlayer)[0]}})])",
    "Each opponent can't draw more than one card each turn": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantDrawMoreThanOneCardEachTurn])",
    "Each opponent can't venture into the dungeon more than once each turn": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CantVentureIntoTheDungeonMoreThanOnceEachTurn])",
    "Each opponent must attack with at least one creature each combat if able": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [MustAttackWithANumberOfCreatures(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(Integer(1)), IsCardtype(Creature))])",
    "Each opponent must attack you or a planeswalker you control with at least one creature each combat if able": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [MustAttackPlayerOrPlaneswalkersControlledBy(You)])",
    "Each opponent who attacked with a creature this turn can't cast {{PotentialSpells}}": "EachPlayerEffect(And([Opponent, AttackedWithACreatureThisTurn(IsCardtype(Creature))]), [CantCastSpells({{PotentialSpells[0]}})])",
    "Each opponent who attacked you or a planeswalker you control this turn can't cast spells": "EachPlayerEffect(And([Opponent, Or([AttackedPlayerThisTurn(You), AttackedAPlaneswalkerThisTurn(And([IsCardtype(Planeswalker), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))])]), [CantCastSpells(AnySpell)])",
    "Each opponent who cast a spell this turn can't attack with creatures": "EachPlayerEffect(And([Opponent, CastASpellThisTurn(AnySpell)]), [CantAttackWithCreatures(AnyPermanent)])",
    "Each opponent who controls more creatures than you can't cast creature spells. The same is true for artifacts and enchantments": "EachPlayerEffect(ControlsMorePermanentThanPlayer(You, IsCardtype(Creature)), [CantCastSpells(IsCardtype(Creature))]), EachPlayerEffect(ControlsMorePermanentThanPlayer(You, IsCardtype(Artifact)), [CantCastSpells(IsCardtype(Artifact))]), EachPlayerEffect(ControlsMorePermanentThanPlayer(You, IsCardtype(Enchantment)), [CantCastSpells(IsCardtype(Enchantment))])",
    "Each opponent who controls more lands than you can't play lands": "EachPlayerEffect(And([Opponent, ControlsMorePermanentThanPlayer(You, IsCardtype(Land))]), [CantPlayLands])",
    "Each opponent's maximum hand size is reduced by {{Number}}": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [ReduceMaximumHandSize({{Number[0]}})])",
    "Each other {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Creature[0]}}]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Each other {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}} and has {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Creature[0]}}]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Each other {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}} for each {{Eachable(ThatPermanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Creature[0]}}]), [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, {{Eachable(ThatPermanent=EachablePermanent)[0]}})])",
    "Each other {{Enchantment}} is a creature in addition to its other types and has base power and base toughness each equal to {{GameNumber(ThatPermanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Enchantment[0]}}]), [AddCardtype(Creature), SetPowerAndToughnessBoth({{GameNumber(ThatPermanent=EachablePermanent)[0]}})])",
    "Each other {{Permanent}} enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanent[0]}}])), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "Each other {{Permanent}} enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it for each {{Zombie}} you already control": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanent[0]}}])), [EntersWithNumberCounters(TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([Other(ThatEnteringPermanent), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), {{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "Each other {{Permanent}} enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it if its mana value is {{Digits}} or less. Otherwise, it enters with {{Number}} additional {{CounterType}} counters on it": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanent[0]}}])), [IfPassesFilter(ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}})), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})]), IfPassesFilter(ManaValueIs(GreaterThan({{Digits[0]}})), [EntersWithNumberCounters({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[1]}})])])",
    "Each other {{Permanent}} has {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanent[0]}}]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Each player can't cast more than one {{PotentialSpell}} each turn": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [CantCastMoreThanNumberSpellsEachTurn(Integer(1), {{PotentialSpell[0]}})])",
    "Each player can't draw more than one card each turn": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [CantDrawMoreThanOneCardEachTurn])",
    "Each player may attack only the nearest opponent in the last chosen direction and planeswalkers controlled by that opponent": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [MayAttackOnlyPlayerOrPlaneswalkersControlledBy(NearestPlayerInChosenDirection(Opponent))])",
    "Each player may play an additional land during each of their turns": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [MayPlayAnAdditionalLand])",
    "Each player may play an additional land on each of their turns": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [MayPlayAnAdditionalLand])",
    "Each player skips their untap step": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [SkipsUntapStep])",
    "Each player who has cast {{a}} {{Spell}} this turn can't cast additional {{PotentialSpells}}": "EachPlayerEffect(CastASpellThisTurn({{Spell[0]}}), [CantCastSpells({{PotentialSpells[0]}})])",
    "Each spell a player casts costs {{ManaCost}} more to cast for each other spell that player has cast this turn": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [IncreaseSpellCostForEach(AnySpell, PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), NumSpellsCastByPlayerThisTurn(AnySpell, EachablePlayer))])",
    "Each spell costs {{ManaCost}} more to cast except during its controller's turn": "EachPlayerEffect(Other(TheActivePlayer), [IncreaseSpellCost(AnySpell, PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])",
    "Each spell you cast has split second if mana from an artifact was spent to cast it": "StackSpellsEffect(And([CastByPlayer(You), ManaFromAPermanentWasSpentToCastIt(IsCardtype(Artifact))]), [SplitSecond])",
    "Each spell you cast that's exactly {{Number}} colors has replicate {{ManaCost}}": "PlayerEffect(You, [SpellsCastHaveAbility(IsNumberColors(EqualTo({{Number[0]}})), [Replicate(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "Each spell you cast that's {{Black}} or {{Black}} costs {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(Or([IsColor({{Black[0]}}), IsColor({{Black[1]}})]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Each spell you cast that's {{a}} {{Zombie}}, {{Zombie}}, or {{Zombie}} costs {{CostReduce}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCost(Or([IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[1]}}), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[2]}})]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Artifact}} is an Equipment with equip {{ManaCostX}} and \"{{EquippedCreature}} gets {{PTModX}}\", where X is that artifact's mana value": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Artifact[0]}}, [AddAbility([Equip(IsCardtype(Creature), PayManaX({{ManaCostX[0]}}, ManaValueOfPermanent(EachPermanentEffect_It)))]), AddAbility([PermanentLayerEffect(HostPermanent, [AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, ManaValueOfPermanent(EachPermanentEffect_It))])])])",
    "Each {{Artifact}} is an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to {{GameNumber(ThatPermanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Artifact[0]}}, [AddCardtype(Artifact), AddCardtype(Creature), SetPowerAndToughnessBoth({{GameNumber(ThatPermanent=EachablePermanent)[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Creature}} assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AssignsToughnessCombatDamage])",
    "Each {{Creature}} assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power and can attack as though it didn't have defender": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AssignsToughnessCombatDamage, CanAttackAsThoughItDidntHaveDefender])",
    "Each {{Creature}} can block an additional creature each combat": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [CanBlockAnAdditionalCreature])",
    "Each {{Creature}} can't attack you or planeswalkers you control": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [CantAttackPlayerOrPlaneswalkerControlledBy(You)])",
    "Each {{Creature}} can't attack you or planeswalkers you control unless its controller pays {{ManaCostX}}, where X is {{GameNumber(ThatCreature)}}": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [CantAttackPlayerOrPlaneswalkerControlledByUnlessCost(You, PayManaX({{ManaCostX[0]}}, {{GameNumber(ThatCreature=EachablePermanent)[0]}}))])",
    "Each {{Creature}} can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an artifact land": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [CantBeBlockedIfDefendingPlayer(ControlsA(And([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Land)])))])",
    "Each {{Creature}} can't be blocked by more than one creature": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [CantBeBlockedByMoreThanOne])",
    "Each {{Creature}} can't be blocked except by {{Number}} or more {{Creatures}}": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [CantBeBlockedExceptByMultipleDefenders(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Number[0]}}), {{Creatures[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}} and has {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Each {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}} as long as it's not attacking": "EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([{{Creature[0]}}, IsntAttacking]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}} for each of its creature types, to a maximum of {{Digits}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, MinimumOf(TheNumberOfCreatureTypesAmongPermanents(SinglePermanent(EachablePermanent)), {{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "Each {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}} for each {{Eachable(ThatPermanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AdjustPTForEach({{PTMod[0]}}, {{Eachable(ThatPermanent=EachablePermanent)[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}}, has {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}}, and is {{a}} {{Zombie}} in addition to its other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}]), AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Creature}} is every creature type": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [HasAllCreatureTypes])",
    "Each {{Creature}} is {{a}} {{Zombie}} in addition to its other creature types and has \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])",
    "Each {{Creature}} is {{a}} {{Zombie}} in addition to its other creature types and has {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Each {{Creature}} is {{a}} {{Zombie}} in addition to its other types and has \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [AddCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])",
    "Each {{Creature}} must be blocked if able": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [MustBeBlocked])",
    "Each {{Creature}} stations permanents using its toughness rather than its power": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Creature[0]}}, [StationsPermanentsUsingToughnessRatherThanPower])",
    "Each {{Land}} is every land type in addition to its other types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Land[0]}}, [HasAllLandTypes])",
    "Each {{Land}} is {{a}} {{Swamp}} in addition to its other land types": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Land[0]}}, [AddLandType({{Swamp[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} crews Vehicles and stations permanents as though its power were {{Digits}} greater": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [CrewsVehiclesAsThoughPowerWereGreater({{Digits[0]}}), StationsPermanentsAsThoughPowerWereGreater({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} doesn't untap during its controller's untap step": "EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [DoesntUntapDuringControllersUntap])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield({{Permanent[0]}}), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it for each mana from an artifact source spent to cast it": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield({{Permanent[0]}}), [EntersWithNumberCounters(TheAmountOfManaFromSourcesSpentToCastIt(IsCardtype(Artifact)), {{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it for each {{Eachable}}": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefield({{Permanent[0]}}), [EntersWithNumberCounters({{Eachable[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} has \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} has protection from its colors": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [AddAbility([Protection(FromColor(ItsOwnColors))])])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} has {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} has {{Hasable}}, attacks each combat if able, and gets {{PTModX}}, where X is {{GameNumber(ThatPermanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, {{GameNumber(ThatPermanent=EachablePermanent)[0]}})]), EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [MustAttack])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} has {{Hasable}}, {{Hasable}}, and {{Hasable}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[2]}}])])",
    "Each {{Permanent}} is all colors": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanent[0]}}, [SetColor(AllColors)])",
    "Each {{Planeswalker}} loses all abilities and is a creature with power and toughness each equal to {{GameNumber(ThatPermanent)}}": "EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Planeswalker[0]}}, [LosesAllAbilities, SetCardtype(Creature), SetPowerAndToughnessBoth({{GameNumber(ThatPermanent=EachablePermanent)[0]}})])",
    "Each {{PotentialSpell}} costs {{ManaCost}} more to cast for each artifact its controller controls": "StackSpellsEffect({{PotentialSpell[0]}}, [IncreaseManaCostForEach({{ManaCost[0]}}, TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Artifact), ControlledByPlayer(ThatSpellsController)])))])",
    "Each {{PotentialSpell}} you cast costs {{CostReduce}} less to cast for each creature it targets": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseSpellCostForEach({{PotentialSpell[0]}}, {{CostReduce[0]}}, PermanentItTargets(IsCardtype(Creature)))])",
    "Each {{PotentialSpell}} you cast from exile has conspire": "PlayerEffect(You, [SpellsCastFromExileHaveAbility({{PotentialSpell[0]}}, [Conspire])])",
    "Each {{PotentialSpell}} you cast has casualty {{Digits}}": "StackSpellsEffect(And([{{PotentialSpell[0]}}, CastByPlayer(You)]), [Casualty({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "Each {{PotentialSpell}} you cast has conspire": "StackSpellsEffect(And([{{PotentialSpell[0]}}, CastByPlayer(You)]), [Conspire])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in each player's hand has slivercycling {{ManaCost}}": "EachCardInEachPlayersHandEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, AnyPlayer, [AddAbility([TypeCycling(IsCreatureType(Sliver), PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has embalm. Its embalm cost is equal to its mana cost": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Embalm(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has encore {X}, where X is its mana value": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Encore(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has encore. Its encore cost is equal to its mana cost": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Encore(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has escape. The escape cost is equal to the card's mana cost plus exile {{Number}} other cards from your graveyard": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Escape(And([ItsManaCost, ExileNumberGraveyardCards({{Number[0]}}, And([Other(ThisGraveyardCard), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))]))])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has scavenge. The scavenge cost is equal to its mana cost": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Scavenge(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard has unearth {{ManaCost}}": "EachCardInGraveyardEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Unearth(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your hand has cycling {{ManaCost}}": "EachCardInPlayersHandEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Cycling(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your hand has miracle {{ManaCost}}": "EachCardInPlayersHandEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Miracle(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your hand has miracle. Its miracle cost is equal to its mana cost reduced by {{CostReduce}}": "EachCardInPlayersHandEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Miracle(ItsManaCostReducedBy({{CostReduce[0]}}))])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} in your hand has ninjutsu {{ManaCost}}": "EachCardInPlayersHandEffect({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [AddAbility([Ninjutsu(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])])",
    "Each {{SpecificCard}} you own that isn't on the battlefield has madness. The madness cost is equal to its mana cost": "CardEffect(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, OwnedByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddAbility([Madness(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Each {{Zombie}} spell you cast has replicate. The replicate cost is equal to its mana cost": "PlayerEffect(You, [SpellsCastHaveAbility(IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), [Replicate(ItsManaCost)])])",
    "Equip abilities you activate cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseEquipAbilityCost({{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Equip costs you pay cost {{CostReduce}} less": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseEquipAbilityCost({{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Except for {{Creatures}} and {{Creatures}}, {{Creatures}} can't attack": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([ExceptFor({{Creatures[0]}}), ExceptFor({{Creatures[1]}}), {{Creatures[2]}}]), [CantAttack])",
    "Exhaust abilities of other permanents you control cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [ReduceActivatedCost(And([ExhaustAbility, AbilityOfAPermanent(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsPermanent, ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Power-up abilities of other creatures you control cost {{CostReduce}} less to activate": "EachPlayerEffect(AnyPlayer, [ReduceActivatedCost(And([PowerUpAbility, AbilityOfAPermanent(And([Other(ThisPermanent), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))]), {{CostReduce[0]}})])",
    "Flashback costs you pay cost {{ManaCost}} less": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseFlashbackCosts({{ManaCost[0]}})])",
    "Flashback costs your opponents pay cost {{ManaCost}} more": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [IncreaseFlashBackCosts({{ManaCost[0]}})])",
    "For each creature you control with no abilities, you may have that creature assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), HasNoAbilities]), [MayAssignCombatDamageAsThoughNotBlocked])",
    "For each non-{{Zombie}} creature you control, you may have that creature assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked": "EachPermanentRuleEffect(And([IsNonCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)), HasNoAbilities]), [MayAssignCombatDamageAsThoughNotBlocked])",
    "For each {{ManaCostSymbol}} in a cost, you may pay {{Digits}} life rather than pay that mana": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPayLifeRatherThanMana({{Digits[0]}}, {{ManaCostSymbol[0]}})])",
    "Foretelling cards from your hand costs {{ManaCost}} less and can be done on any player's turn": "PlayerEffect(You, [DecreaseCostOfForetellingCardsFromHand({{ManaCost[0]}}), CanForetellCardsDuringEachPlayersTurn(AnyPlayer)])",
    "If a basic land you control is tapped for mana, it produces mana of a color of your choice instead of any other type": "ReplaceWouldProduceMana(TappingAPermanentWouldProduceMana(And([IsSupertype(Basic), IsCardtype(Land), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), [WouldProduceMana_ReplaceType(AnyManaColor)])",
    "If a card or token would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(WouldPutACardOrTokenInAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(AnyCard, AnyPlayer), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a card or token would be put into your graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(WouldPutACardOrTokenInAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(AnyCard, SinglePlayer(You)), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a card would be put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(WouldPutACardInAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(AnyCard, Opponent), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a card would be put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, instead exile it with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(WouldPutACardInAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(AnyCard, Opponent), [ExileItWithACounterInstead({{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "If a card would be put into your graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(WouldPutACardInPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(AnyCard, You), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a card would be put into your graveyard from anywhere, exile that card instead": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(WouldPutACardInPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(AnyCard, You), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a card you didn't control would be put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(WouldPutACardInAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(ControlledByAPlayer(Other(You)), Opponent), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a creature attacking causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentAttackingCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(IsCardtype(Creature), AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a creature dying causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentDyingCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(IsCardtype(Creature), AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a creature would die, instead exile it and that creature's controller loses {{Digits}} life": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(APermanentWouldDie(IsCardtype(Creature)), [ExileItInstead, PlayerAction(ControllerOfPermanent(WouldDie_ThatPermanent), LoseLife({{Digits[0]}}))])",
    "If a creature you control attacking causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentAttackingCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a creature you control becoming the target of a spell or ability causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentBecomingTheTargetOfASpellOrAbilityCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), AnySpellOrAbility, AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a creature you control being dealt damage causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentBeingDealtDamageCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a creature you control would connive, instead you draw a card, then that creature connives": "ReplaceWouldConnive(APermanentWouldConnive(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), [DrawACard, CreatureConnives(WouldConnive_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If a creature you control would untap during your untap step, put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on it instead": "ReplaceWouldUntap(APermanentWouldUntapDuringsItsControllersUntapStep(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), [PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[0]}}, WouldUntapDuringsItsControllersUntapStep_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If a land entering causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentEnteringTheBattlefieldCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(IsCardtype(Land), AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a land is tapped for mana, it produces colorless mana instead of any other type": "ReplaceWouldProduceMana(TappingAPermanentWouldProduceMana(IsCardtype(Land)), [WouldProduceMana_ReplaceType(ManaProduceC)])",
    "If a land is tapped for mana, it produces {{ManaProduceSymbol}} instead of any other type": "ReplaceWouldProduceMana(TappingAPermanentWouldProduceMana(IsCardtype(Land)), [WouldProduceMana_ReplaceType({{ManaProduceSymbol[0]}})])",
    "If a land is tapped for mana, it produces {{ManaProduceSymbol}} instead of any other type and amount": "ReplaceWouldProduceMana(TappingAPermanentWouldProduceMana(IsCardtype(Land)), [WouldProduceMana_AddMana({{ManaProduceSymbol[0]}})])",
    "If a land is tapped for two or more mana, it produces {{ManaProduceSymbol}} instead of any other type and amount": "ReplaceWouldProduceMana(TappingAPermanentWouldProduceTwoOrMoreMana(IsCardtype(Land)), [WouldProduceMana_AddMana({{ManaProduceSymbol[0]}})])",
    "If a land or {{Zombie}} you control entering causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentEnteringTheBattlefieldCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(And([Or([IsCardtype(Land), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})]), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a legendary permanent or an artifact entering or leaving the battlefield causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentEnteringTheBattlefieldCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(Or([And([IsSupertype(Legendary), IsPermanent]), IsCardtype(Artifact)]), AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)))), APermanentLeavingTheBattlefieldCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(Or([And([IsSupertype(Legendary), IsPermanent]), IsCardtype(Artifact)]), AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a modular triggered ability would put one or more {{CounterType}} counters on a creature you control, that many plus {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters are put on it instead": "ReplaceWouldPutCounters(AnAbilityWouldPutCountersOfTypeOnAPermanent(And([ModularAbility, TriggeredAbility]), {{CounterType[0]}}, And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), [PutNewAmountOfType(Plus(WouldPutCounters_NumberOfCounters, {{Number[0]}}), {{CounterType[0]}})])",
    "If a nontoken creature an opponent controls would die, exile it instead. When you do, you may pay {{ManaCost}}. If you do, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with \"{{TokenQuotedAbility}}\"": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(APermanentWouldDie(And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)])), [MustCost(ExileItInstead), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(ActionList([MayCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{TokenQuotedAbility[0]}}])])])]))])])",
    "If a nontoken creature an opponent controls would die, instead exile it and you gain {{Digits}} life": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(APermanentWouldDie(And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)])), [ExileItInstead, GainLife({{Digits[0]}})])",
    "If a nontoken creature an opponent controls would die, instead exile that card and create a {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(APermanentWouldDie(And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)])), [ExileItInstead, CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])])",
    "If a nontoken creature an opponent owns would die or a creature card not on the battlefield would be put into an opponent's graveyard, exile that card instead": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(Or([APermanentWouldDie(And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature), OwnedByAPlayer(Opponent)])), WouldPutACardInAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhereOtherThanBattlefield(IsCardtype(Creature), Opponent)]), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a nontoken creature would enter and it wasn't cast, exile it instead": "ReplaceWouldEnter(APermanentWouldEnterTheBattlefieldAndWasntCast(And([IsNonToken, IsCardtype(Creature)])), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a permanent entering causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APermanentEnteringTheBattlefieldCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(AnyPermanent, AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a permanent with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it would untap during its controller's untap step, remove all {{CounterType}} counters from it instead": "ReplaceWouldUntap(APermanentWouldUntapDuringsItsControllersUntapStep(HasACounterOfType({{CounterType[0]}})), [RemoveAllCountersOfTypeFromPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, WouldUntapDuringsItsControllersUntapStep_ThatPermanent)])",
    "If a permanent would be put into a graveyard, exile it instead": "ReplaceWouldPutIntoGraveyard(WouldPutAPermanentIntoAPlayersGraveyard(AnyPermanent, AnyPlayer), [ExileItInstead])",
    "If a player drawing a card causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time": "APlayerDrawingACardCausesAbilitiesToTriggerAnAdditionalTime(AnyPlayer, AbilityOfAPermanent(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))))",
    "If a player would begin an extra turn, that player skips that turn instead": "ReplaceWouldBeginATurn(APlayerWouldBeginAnExtraTurn(AnyPlayer), [SkipTurn])",
    "If a player would draw a card except the first one they draw in each of their draw steps, that player discards a card instead. If the player discards a card this way, they draw a card. If the player doesn't discard a card this way, they mill a card": "ReplaceWouldDraw(APlayerWouldDrawExceptFirstDrawStepDraw(AnyPlayer), [PlayerMustCost(WouldDrawACard_ThatPlayer, DiscardACard), IfElse(CostWasPaid, [PlayerAction(WouldDrawACard_ThatPlayer, DrawACard)], [PlayerAction(WouldDrawACard_ThatPlayer, MillACard)])])",
    "If a player would draw a card, instead they draw a card and reveal it. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, that player discards it unless they pay {{Digits}} life": "ReplaceWouldDraw(APlayerWouldDrawACard(AnyPlayer), [PlayerActions(WouldDrawACard_ThatPlayer, [DrawACard, RevealTheCardDrawnThisWay, If(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [DiscardTheCardDrawnThisWay])])])",
    "If a player would draw a card, that player exiles that card face up instead": "ReplaceWouldDraw(APlayerWouldDrawACard(AnyPlayer), [PlayerAction(WouldDrawACard_ThatPlayer, ExileTopCardOfLibrary)])",
    "If a player would draw a card, that player exiles the top card of one of their opponents' libraries face down instead": "ReplaceWouldDraw(APlayerWouldDrawACard(AnyPlayer), [PlayerAction(WouldDrawACard_ThatPlayer, ChooseAPlayer(OpponentOf(WouldDrawACard_ThatPlayer))), PlayerAction(WouldDrawACard_ThatPlayer, ExileTheTopCardOfPlayersLibrary(TheChosenPlayer))])",
