    "You may pay {{ManaCostX}} rather than pay the mana cost for {{PotentialSpells}} you cast, where X is that spell's mana value": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPayAlternateCostForSpells(PayManaX({{ManaCostX[0]}}, ItsManaValue), {{PotentialSpells[0]}})])",
    "You may pay {{ManaCost}} rather than pay the cycling cost of the first card you cycle each turn": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPayAlternateCostForFirstCyclingCostEachTurn({{ManaCost[0]}})])",
