    "You may play lands and cast {{Zombie}}, {{Zombie}}, or {{Zombie}} spells from the top of your library. If you cast a creature spell this way, that creature enters with an additional {{CounterType}} counter on it": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlayLandsFromTopOfLibrary(AnyCard), MayCastSpellsFromTopOfLibraryAndSpellsOfTypeWithEffect(Or([IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[1]}}), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[2]}})]), IsCardtype(Creature), [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])])",
    "You may play lands from the top of your library": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlayLandsFromTopOfLibrary(AnyCard)])",
