    "You may plot nonland cards from the top of your library": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayPlotCardsFromTheTopOfTheirLibrary(IsNonCardtype(Land))])",
    "You may reveal the first card you draw each turn as you draw it. Whenever you reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} this way, copy that card and you may cast the copy. That copy costs {{ManaCost}} less to cast": "PlayerEffect(You, [MayRevealFirstCardDrawnDuringEachPlayersTurn(AnyPlayer)]), TriggerA(WhenAPlayerRevealsFirstCardDrawn(SinglePlayer(You), {{SpecificCard[0]}}), ActionList([CopyCardInHand(TheCardInHandRevealedThisWay), MayAction(CastCopiedCardForReducedCost({{ManaCost[0]}}))]))",
