    "You, {{Permanents}}, and other {{Permanents}} have hexproof": "PlayerEffect(You, [Hexproof]), EachPermanentLayerEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [AddAbility([Hexproof])]), EachPermanentLayerEffect(And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Permanents[1]}}]), [AddAbility([Hexproof])])",
