    "Your opponents and {{Permanents}} can be the targets of spells and abilities you control as though they didn't have hexproof": "EachPlayerEffect(Opponent, [CanBeTheTargetOfSpellsAndAbilitiesAsThoughTheyDidntHaveHexproof(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)))]), EachPermanentRuleEffect({{Permanents[0]}}, [CanBeTheTargetOfSpellsAndAbilitiesAsThoughTheyDidntHaveHexproof(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You)))])",
