    "create a tapped and attacking token that's a copy of up to one other target {{Permanent}}. You get {{Energy}}. At the beginning of the next end step, sacrifice that token unless you pay an amount of {{EnergyCounters}} equal to its mana value": "Targeted([UptoOneTargetPermanent(And([Other({{ThatPermanent}}), {{Permanent[0]}}]))], ActionList([CreateTokensWithFlags([TokenCopyOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent, NoTokenCopyEffects)], [EntersTapped, EntersAttacking]), GetEnergy(Integer({{Energy[0]}})), CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheBeginningOfTheNextEndStep, ActionList([MayCost(PayEnergy(ManaValueOfPermanent(TheTokenCreatedThisWay))), Unless(CostWasntPaid, [SacrificePermanent(TheTokenCreatedThisWay)])]))]))",
    "create a token that's a copy of another target {{Creature}} and that's tapped and attacking. Exile the token at end of combat": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([Other({{ThatPermanent}}), {{Creature[0]}}]))], ActionList([CreateTokensWithFlags([TokenCopyOfPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent, NoTokenCopyEffects)], [EntersTapped, EntersAttacking]), CreateFutureTrigger(AtTheNextEndOfCombat, ActionList([ExilePermanent(TheCreatedToken)]))]))",
