    "double the power of each other creature you control until end of turn. Those creatures gain {{Hasable}} until end of turn": "ActionList([DoubleEachCreaturesPowerUntilEndOfTurn(And([Other({{ThatPermanent}}), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(And([Other({{ThatPermanent}}), IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)])",
