    "choose target creature an opponent controls. Exile that creature until {{ThisPermanent}} leaves the battlefield. If {{ThisPermanent}}'s sneak cost was paid, instead exile the chosen creature": "Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)]))], ActionList([IfElse(EnteringPermanentPassesFilter(SneakCostWasPaid), [ExilePermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)], [ExilePermanentUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent, UntilPermanentLeavesBattlefield(ThisPermanent))])]))",
