    "scry {{Digits}} and you gain {{Digits}} life. Then if {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, exile it. When you do, take an extra turn after this one": "ActionList([Scry({{Digits[0]}}), GainLife({{Digits[1]}}), If({{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, [MustCost(ExilePermanent({{~Permanent}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(ActionList([TakeAnExtraTurn]))])])])",
