    "scry {{Digits}}, then reveal the top card of your library. This creature gets {{PTModX}} until end of turn, where X is that card's mana value": "ActionList([Scry({{Digits[0]}}), RevealTopCardOfLibrary, CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil({{~Permanent}}, [AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, ManaValueOfTheCardRevealedThisWay)], UntilEndOfTurn)])",
