    "starting with you, each player votes for carnage or homage. If carnage gets more votes, sacrifice this artifact and destroy all {{Permanents}}. If homage gets more votes or the vote is tied, draw a card": "ActionList([VoteForAWord([\"Carnage\", \"Homage\"]), If(MostVotesForWordIs(\"Carnage\"), [SacrificePermanent({{~Permanent}}), DestroyEachPermanent({{Permanents[0]}})]), If(MostVotesOrTiedForMostVotesForWordIs(\"Homage\"), [DrawACard])])",
