    "return another target non-{{Zombie}} creature card with equal or lesser power from your graveyard to the battlefield": "Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([Other(Trigger_ThatGraveyardCard), IsNonCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), IsCardtype(Creature), ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo(ManaValueOfDeadPermanent)), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [EntersNormally])]))",
