    "exile a permanent card from your graveyard at random, then create a tapped token that's a copy of that card. If the exiled card is a land card, repeat this process": "ActionList([RepeatableActions([ExileACardFromPlayersGraveyardAtRandom(IsPermanent, You), CreateTokensWithFlags([TokenCopyOfExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay, NoTokenCopyEffects)], [EntersTapped]), If(ACardWasExiledThisWay(IsCardtype(Land)), [RepeatThisProcess])])])",
