    "look at the top X cards of your library, where X is your devotion to {{Black}}. Put up to one of them on top of your library and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. If X is greater than or equal to {{GameNumber}}, you win the game": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(PlayerDevotionTo(You, {{Black[0]}}), [PutAGenericCardOnTopOfLibrary, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, DevotionToColorsIs([{{Black[0]}}], GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{GameNumber[0]}}))), [WinTheGame])])",
