    "look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put any number of Equipment cards from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. When you put one or more Equipment onto the battlefield this way, you may attach one of them to {{a}} {{Permanent}}": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutAnyNumberOfCardsOntoTheBattlefield(IsArtifactType(Equipment), [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder]), If(APermanentOfTypeWasPutOntoTheBattlefieldThisWay(IsArtifactType(Equipment)), [ReflexiveTrigger(ActionList([MayAction(AttachAPermanentToAPermanent(ThePermanentsPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay, {{Permanent[0]}}))]))])])",
