    "look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield tapped. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersTapped]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them onto the battlefield. If an Equipment is put onto the battlefield this way, you may attach it to {{a}} {{Permanent}}. Put the rest of those cards on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), If(APermanentWasPutOntoTheBattlefieldThisWay(IsArtifactType(Equipment)), [MayAction(AttachPermanentToAPermanent(ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay, {{Permanent[0]}}))]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
