    "look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them. You may put it onto the battlefield if {{Condition}}. If you don't put it onto the battlefield, put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayCost(RevealACardOfType({{SpecificCard[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [If({{Condition[0]}}, [MayPutFoundCardOntoBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutFoundCardIntoHand])]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} or {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayRevealACardOfTypeAndPutIntoHand(Or([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, {{SpecificCard[1]}}])), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
