    "reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost. Put all revealed cards not cast this way on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealCardsFromTheTopOfLibraryUntilACardOfTypeIsRevealed({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [MayCastTheCardFoundThisWayWithoutPaying, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. You may put that card onto the battlefield. If you don't, put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealCardsFromTheTopOfLibraryUntilACardOfTypeIsRevealed({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [MayPutTheCardFoundThisWayOntoTheBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutTheCardFoundThisWayIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. You may put that card onto the battlefield. Then shuffle": "ActionList([RevealCardsFromTheTopOfLibraryUntilACardOfTypeIsRevealed({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [MayPutTheCardFoundThisWayOntoTheBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsBackIntoLibraryAndShuffle])])",
    "reveal cards from the top of your planar deck until you reveal a plane card. Chaos ensues on that plane. Then put all cards revealed this way on the bottom of your planar deck in any order": "ActionList([RevealCardsFromTheTopOfPlanarDeckUntilRevealAPlaneCardThenChaosEnsuresOnThatPlaneThenPutAllCardsOnBottomInAnyOrder])",
    "reveal cards from the top of your planar deck until you reveal a plane card. Planeswalk to it, except don't planeswalk away from any plane. Put the rest of the revealed cards on the bottom of your planar deck in any order": "ActionList([RevealCardsFromTheTopOfPlanarDeckUntilRevealAPlaneCardThenPlaneswalkToItWhileNotPlaneswalkingAwayAndPutTheRestOnBottomInAnyOrder])",
