    "reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is {{GameNumber}}. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{GameNumber[0]}}, [APlayerSeparatesThoseCardsIntoTwoPiles(Opponent), PutAPileIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is {{GameNumber}}. You may put {{a}} {{Black}} permanent card with mana value X or less from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([CreateValueX({{GameNumber[0]}}), RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(ValueX, [MayPutACardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield(And([IsColor({{Black[0]}}), IsPermanent, ManaValueIs(LessThanOrEqualTo(ValueX))]), [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "reveal the top card of your library and put it into your hand. Each opponent loses X life and you gain X life, where X is that card's mana value": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, PutTopOfLibraryInHand, CreateValueX(ManaValueOfTheCardRevealedThisWay), EachPlayerAction(Opponent, LoseLife(ValueX)), GainLife(ValueX)])",
    "reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. Each opponent loses life equal to that card's mana value": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, PutTopOfLibraryInHand, EachPlayerAction(Opponent, LoseLife(ManaValueOfTheCardRevealedThisWay))])",
    "reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You gain life equal to its mana value": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, PutTopOfLibraryInHand, GainLife(ManaValueOfTheCardRevealedThisWay)])",
    "reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You lose life equal to its mana value": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, PutTopOfLibraryInHand, LoseLife(ManaValueOfTheCardRevealedThisWay)])",
    "reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You lose life equal to that card's mana value": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, PutTopOfLibraryInHand, LoseLife(ManaValueOfTheCardRevealedThisWay)])",
    "reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You lose life equal to the card's mana value": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, PutTopOfLibraryInHand, LoseLife(ManaValueOfTheCardRevealedThisWay)])",
    "reveal the top card of your library. If it's a nonland card, you may cast it by paying {{ManaCost}} rather than paying its mana cost. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, IfElse(ACardWasRevealedThisWay(IsNonCardtype(Land)), [MayAction(CastTopCardOfLibraryForAlternateCost({{ManaCost[0]}}))], [PutTopOfLibraryOnBattlefield([EntersNormally])])])",
    "reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it into your graveyard and repeat this process": "ActionList([RepeatableActions([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, If(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [PutTopOfLibraryInHand, RepeatThisProcess])])])",
