    "reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it into your hand. Otherwise, you may put it into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, IfElse(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [PutTopOfLibraryInHand], [MayAction(PutTopOfLibraryInGraveyard)])])",
    "reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it into your hand. Otherwise, you may put it on the bottom of your library": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, IfElse(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [PutTopOfLibraryInHand], [MayAction(PutTopOfLibraryOnBottomOfLibrary)])])",
    "reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your hand": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, IfElse(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [PutTopOfLibraryOnBattlefield([EntersNormally])], [PutTopOfLibraryInHand])])",
