    "reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, you may put that card on the bottom of your library": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, IfElse(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [PutTopOfLibraryOnBattlefield([EntersNormally])], [MayAction(PutTopOfLibraryOnBottomOfLibrary)])])",
