    "reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, you may put it onto the battlefield with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it. That permanent is an enchantment in addition to its other types": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, If(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [MayAction(PutTopOfLibraryOnBattlefield([EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}}), EntersWithLayerEffect([AddCardtype(Enchantment)])]))])])",
    "reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, you may put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, you may put it on the bottom of your library": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, IfElse(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [MayAction(PutTopOfLibraryOnBattlefield([EntersNormally]))], [MayAction(PutTopOfLibraryOnBottomOfLibrary)])])",
    "reveal the top card of your library. You may cast it without paying its mana cost if its mana value is odd. If you don't cast it, draw a card": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, IfElse(ACardWasRevealedThisWay(ManaValueIs(Odd)), [MayCost(CastTopCardOfLibraryWithoutPaying), Unless(CostWasPaid, [DrawACard])], [DrawACard])])",
    "reveal the top card of your library. You may play it without paying its mana cost": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, MayAction(PlayTopCardOfLibraryWithoutPaying)])",
    "reveal the top card of your library. You may put that card onto the battlefield if it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. Otherwise, put that card into your hand": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfLibrary, MayCost(PutTopCardOfLibraryOfTypeOnBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally])), Unless(CostWasPaid, [PutTopOfLibraryInHand])])",
    "reveal the top card of your planar deck. You may put it on the bottom of your planar deck": "ActionList([RevealTopCardOfPlanarDeck, MayAction(PutTopOfPlanarDeckOnBottomOfPlanarDeck)])",
