    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [APlayerSeparatesThoseCardsIntoTwoPiles(Opponent), PutAPileIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. For each card type among noncreature spells you've cast this turn, you may put a card of that type from among the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfEachCardtypeAmongSpellsCastThisTurnIntoHand(And([IsNonCardtype(Creature), CastByPlayer(You)])), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. For each card type, you may put a card of that type from among the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutACardOfEachCardtypeIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
