    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put all {{SpecificCards}} revealed this way into your graveyard and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutEachCardOfTypeIntoGraveyard({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put all {{SpecificCards}} revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutEachCardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoGraveyard])])",
