    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put all {{SpecificCards}} revealed this way onto the battlefield and the rest into your hand": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutEachCardOfTypeOntoTheBattlefield({{SpecificCards[0]}}, [EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsIntoHand])])",
    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put any number of {{SpecificCards}} from among them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutAnyNumberOfCardsOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from among them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutACardOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
