    "reveal the top {{Number}} cards of your library. You may put any number of {{SpecificCards}} from among them into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([RevealTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [MayPutAnyNumberOfCardsOfTypeIntoHand({{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])",
