    "scry {{Digits}}, then exile the top card of your library. You may play that card this turn. When you exile a card this way, target creature you control gets {{PTModX}} until end of turn, where X is that card's mana value": "ActionList([Scry({{Digits[0]}}), MayCost(ExileTopCardOfLibrary), If(CostWasPaid, [CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay)], UntilEndOfTurn), ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent, [AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, ManaValueOfExiled(TheCardExiledThisWay))], UntilEndOfTurn)])))])])",
    "scry {{Digits}}, then reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, draw a card": "ActionList([Scry({{Digits[0]}}), RevealTopCardOfLibrary, If(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [DrawACard])])",
    "scry {{Digits}}, then reveal the top card of your library. If it's {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it into your hand": "ActionList([Scry({{Digits[0]}}), RevealTopCardOfLibrary, If(ACardWasRevealedThisWay({{SpecificCard[0]}}), [PutTopOfLibraryInHand])])",
