    "shuffle your library": "ActionList([Shuffle])",
    "starting with you, each player may choose {{a}} {{Permanent}}. Destroy each permanent chosen this way": "ActionList([EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [ChooseAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})]), DestroyEachPermanent(TheChosenPermanents)])",
    "starting with you, each player may put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from their hand onto the battlefield": "ActionList([EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [PutACardFromHandOnBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [EntersNormally])])])",
    "starting with you, each player votes for dominion or guidance. If dominion gets more votes, the Ring tempts you, then you put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on your Ring-bearer. If guidance gets more votes or the vote is tied, draw a card": "ActionList([EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [VoteForAWord([\"Dominion\", \"Guidance\"])]), If(MostVotesForWordIs(\"Dominion\"), [TemptWithRing, PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, PlayersRingBearer(You))]), If(MostVotesOrTiedForMostVotesForWordIs(\"Guidance\"), [DrawACard])])",
    "starting with you, each player votes for evidence or bribery. For each evidence vote, investigate. For each bribery vote, create a Treasure token": "ActionList([EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [VoteForAWord([\"Evidence\", \"Bribery\"])]), InvestigateTimes(TheNumberOfVotesForWord(\"Evidence\")), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(TheNumberOfVotesForWord(\"Bribery\"), TreasureToken)])])",
    "starting with you, each player votes for profit or security. You create a number of Treasure tokens equal to twice the number of profit votes. Put a number of {{CounterType}} counters on each {{Permanent}} equal to the number of security votes": "ActionList([EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [VoteForAWord([\"Profit\", \"Security\"])]), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(Twice(TheNumberOfVotesForWord(\"Profit\")), TreasureToken)]), PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnEachPermanent(TheNumberOfVotesForWord(\"Security\"), {{CounterType[0]}}, {{Permanent[0]}})])",
    "starting with you, each player votes for {{a}} {{Creature}}. Exile each creature with the most votes or tied for most votes": "ActionList([EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [VoteForAPermanent({{Creature[0]}})]), ExileEachPermanent(HasTheMostVotesOrTiedForTheMostVotes)])",
    "starting with you, each player votes for {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard. Return each card with the most votes or tied for most votes to your hand": "ActionList([EachPlayerStartingWithAction(AnyPlayer, You, [VoteForACardInGraveyard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))]), PutEachGraveyardCardIntoHand(GraveyardCardWithMostVotesOrTiedForMostVotes)])",
    "support {{Digits}}": "Targeted([UptoNumberTargetPermanents({{Digits[0]}}, IsCardtype(Creature))], ActionList([Support(Ref_TargetPermanents)]))",
    "surveil X, where X is {{GameNumber}}": "ActionList([Surveil({{GameNumber[0]}})])",
