    "surveil {{Digits}} if this is the first time this ability has resolved this turn. If it's the second time, each opponent discards a card. If it's the third time, put {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control": "ActionList([If(TimesThisAbilityHasResolvedThisTurnIs(EqualTo(Integer(1))), [Surveil({{Digits[0]}})]), If(TimesThisAbilityHasResolvedThisTurnIs(EqualTo(Integer(2))), [EachPlayerAction(Opponent, DiscardACard)]), If(TimesThisAbilityHasResolvedThisTurnIs(EqualTo(Integer(3))), [PutACardFromAGraveyardOnBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, AnyPlayer, [EntersUnderPlayersControl(You)])])])",
    "surveil {{Digits}}, then you may return {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped": "ActionList([Surveil({{Digits[0]}}), MayAction(PutACardFromPlayersGraveyardOnBattlefield({{SpecificCard[0]}}, You, [EntersTapped]))])",
    "surveil {{Digits}}. Then for each card you put on top of your library, you draw a card and you lose {{Digits}} life": "ActionList([Surveil({{Digits[0]}}), DrawNumberCards(TheNumberOfCardsScryedOnTopOfLibraryThisWay), LoseLifeForEach({{Digits[0]}}, TheNumberOfCardsScryedOnTopOfLibraryThisWay)])",
    "surveil {{Digits}}. Then you may cast {{a}} {{PotentialSpell}} from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead": "ActionList([Surveil({{Digits[0]}}), MayAction(CastASpellFromPlayersGraveyardWithoutPayingIntoExile({{PotentialSpell[0]}}, You))])",
    "surveil {{Digits}}. When you do, you may return target {{Permanent}} to its owner's hand": "ActionList([MustCost(Surveil({{Digits[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([MayAction(PutPermanentIntoItsOwnersHand(Ref_TargetPermanent))])))])])",
