    "switch the power and toughness of each of any number of target {{Creatures}} until end of turn": "Targeted([AnyNumberOfTargetPermanents({{Creatures[0]}})], ActionList([CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanents, [SwitchPT], UntilEndOfTurn)]))",
