    "tap target {{Land}}. That land doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Land[0]}})], ActionList([TapPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), PermanentDoesntUntapDuringControllersNextUntap(ThePermanentTappedThisWay)]))",
