    "tap target {{Permanent}}. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step": "Targeted([TargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})], ActionList([TapPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), PermanentDoesntUntapDuringControllersNextUntap(ThePermanentTappedThisWay)]))",
