    "target opponent chooses a creature you don't control and puts it on top of its owner's library, then repeats this process for an artifact, an enchantment, and a land. Then the owner of each permanent chosen this way shuffles": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([ActionForEachCardtype([Creature, Artifact, Enchantment, Land], [PlayerActions(Ref_TargetPlayer, [ChooseAPermanent(And([IsCardtypeVariable(EachableCardtype), ControlledByAPlayer(Other(You))])), PutPermanentOnTopOfOwnersLibrary(TheChosenPermanent)])]), EachPlayerAction(OwnedAPermanentChosenThisWay, Shuffle)]))",
    "target opponent chooses a player. Until your next turn, only you and the chosen player can cast spells and attack with creatures": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, ChooseAPlayer(AnyPlayer)), OnlyAllowedAttackingPlayersUntilEndOfTurn(Or([SinglePlayer(You), SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer)])), OnlyAllowedCastingPlayersUntilEndOfTurn(Or([SinglePlayer(You), SinglePlayer(TheChosenPlayer)]))]))",
    "target opponent chooses self or others. If that player chooses self, that player discards {{Number}} cards. If the player chooses others, each of your other opponents discards {{Number}} cards": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, ChooseANamedAction([NamedAction(\"Self\", [PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, DiscardNumberCards({{Number[0]}}))]), NamedAction(\"Others\", [EachPlayerAction(And([Other(Ref_TargetPlayer), Opponent]), DiscardNumberCards({{Number[0]}}))])]))]))",
    "target opponent chooses self or others. If that player chooses self, that player sacrifices {{Number}} {{Permanents}} of their choice. If the player chooses others, each of your other opponents sacrifices {{a}} {{Permanent}} of their choice": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, ChooseANamedAction([NamedAction(\"Self\", [PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, SacrificeNumberPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{Permanents[0]}}))]), NamedAction(\"Others\", [EachPlayerAction(And([Other(Ref_TargetPlayer), Opponent]), SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}))])]))]))",
    "target opponent chooses self or others. If that player chooses self, the player sacrifices {{Number}} {{Permanents}} of their choice. If the player chooses others, each of your other opponents sacrifices {{a}} {{Permanent}} of their choice": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, ChooseANamedAction([NamedAction(\"Self\", [PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, SacrificeNumberPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{Permanents[0]}}))]), NamedAction(\"Others\", [EachPlayerAction(And([Other(Ref_TargetPlayer), Opponent]), SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}))])]))]))",
    "target opponent chooses {{a}} {{Permanent}} they control at random and sacrifices it. If {{a}} {{Permanent}} is sacrificed this way, repeat this process": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([RepeatableActions([PlayerActions(Ref_TargetPlayer, [ChooseAPermanentAtRandom(And([{{Permanent[0]}}, ControlledByPlayer(PlayerAction_ThatPlayer)])), SacrificePermanent(TheChosenPermanent)]), If(APermanentWasSacrificedThisWay({{Permanent[0]}}), [RepeatThisProcess])])]))",
    "target opponent chooses {{a}} {{Permanent}} they control. Destroy that creature": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, ChooseAPermanent(And([{{Permanent[0]}}, ControlledByPlayer(PlayerAction_ThatPlayer)]))), DestroyPermanent(TheChosenPermanent)]))",
    "target opponent creates {{NamedCard}}, a legendary {{PT}} {{Black}} {{Zombie}} {{Zombie}} creature token with {{Hasable}}, {{Hasable}}, and \"{{TokenQuotedAbility}}\"": "Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, CreateTokens([NamedTokenWithPT({{NamedCard[0]}}, {{PT[0]}}, Colors([{{Black[0]}}]), [Legendary], [Creature], SubtypesList([{{Zombie[0]}}, {{Zombie[1]}}]), [{{Hasable[0]}}, {{Hasable[1]}}, {{TokenQuotedAbility[0]}}])]))]))",
