    "until a player planeswalks, you can't lose the game and your opponents can't win the game": "ActionList([CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [CantLoseTheGame], UntilAPlayerPlaneswalks(AnyPlayer)), CreateEachPlayerEffectUntil(Opponent, [CantWinTheGame], UntilAPlayerPlaneswalks(AnyPlayer))])",
    "until end of turn, damage that would reduce your life total to less than {{Digits}} reduces it to {{Digits}} instead": "ActionList([CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [DamageThatWouldReduceLifeTotalToLessThanNumberReducesItToThatNumberInstead({{Digits[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)])",
    "until end of turn, each other {{Creature}} gets {{PTMod}} if it has {{CheckHasable}}, {{PTMod}} if it has {{CheckHasable}}, and so on for {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, {{CheckHasable}}, and {{CheckHasable}}": "ActionList([ActionForEachCheckableAbility([{{CheckHasable[0]}}, {{CheckHasable[1]}}, {{CheckHasable[2]}}, {{CheckHasable[3]}}, {{CheckHasable[4]}}, {{CheckHasable[5]}}, {{CheckHasable[6]}}, {{CheckHasable[7]}}, {{CheckHasable[8]}}, {{CheckHasable[9]}}, {{CheckHasable[10]}}, {{CheckHasable[11]}}, {{CheckHasable[12]}}, {{CheckHasable[13]}}], [CreateEachPermanentLayerEffectUntil(And([And([Other(ThisPermanent), {{Creature[0]}}]), HasAbility(EachableAbility)]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)])])",
