    "you may discard a card. If you do, search your library for {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle": "ActionList([MayCost(DiscardACard), If(CostWasPaid, [SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType({{SpecificCard[0]}}), RevealFoundCards, PutFoundCardsIntoHand, Shuffle])])])",
    "you may discard a card. If you do, seek a card with greater mana value and exile it. Until the end of your next turn, you may play the exiled card": "ActionList([MayCost(DiscardACard), If(CostWasPaid, [SeekACard(ManaValueIs(GreaterThan(ManaValueOfTheDiscardedCard))), ExileCardFromHand(TheCardSeekedThisWay), CreatePlayerEffectUntil(You, [MayPlayExiledCard(TheCardExiledThisWay)], UntilEndOfNextTurn(You))])])",
