    "you may pay {{ManaCostX}}. When you do, distribute X {{CounterType}} counters among any number of target {{Permanents}}": "ActionList([MayCost(PayManaAnyX({{ManaCostX[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(TargetedDistributed([UptoNumberTargetPermanents(ValueX, {{Permanents[0]}})], DistributeNumberAmongTargets(ValueX), ActionList([PutDistributedCounters({{CounterType[0]}})])))])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCostX}}. When you do, return target {{SpecificCard}} with mana value X from your graveyard to the battlefield with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it. If that creature would leave the battlefield, exile it instead of putting it anywhere else": "ActionList([MayCost(PayManaAnyX({{ManaCostX[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, ManaValueIs(EqualTo(ValueX)), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})]), CreateReplaceWouldLeaveTheBattlefieldUntil(PermanentWouldLeaveTheBattlefield(ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay), [ExileItInstead], UntilPermanentLeavesBattlefield(ThePermanentPutOnTheBattlefieldThisWay))])))])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}} and discard a card. If you do, draw a card": "ActionList([MayCost(And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), DiscardACard])), If(CostWasPaid, [DrawACard])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}} and sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}": "ActionList([MayCost(And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})])), If(CostWasPaid, [CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])])])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}} and sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}}": "ActionList([MayCost(And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})])), If(CostWasPaid, [CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}])])])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}} and sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}. Put that card onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "ActionList([MayCost(And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})])), If(CostWasPaid, [RevealCardsFromTheTopOfLibraryUntilACardOfTypeIsRevealed({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [PutTheCardFoundThisWayOntoTheBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}} and {{Digits}} life. If you do, draw a card": "ActionList([MayCost(And([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), PayLife({{Digits[0]}})])), If(CostWasPaid, [DrawACard])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}} and {{Digits}} life. When you do, return target {{SpecificCard}} from your graveyard to the battlefield with {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on it": "ActionList([MayCost(Or([PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}), PayLife({{Digits[0]}})])), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [EntersWithACounter({{CounterType[0]}})])])))])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}} up to three times. When you pay this cost one or more times, choose up to that many -\n* {{TriggerActions_Modal}}.\n* {{TriggerActions_Modal}}.\n* {{TriggerActions_Modal}}": "ActionList([MayCost(PayManaUptoNumberTimes({{ManaCost[0]}}, Integer(3))), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(Modal_ChooseUptoNumber(NumTimesPaidMana, [{{TriggerActions_Modal[0]}}, {{TriggerActions_Modal[1]}}, {{TriggerActions_Modal[2]}}]))])])",
