    "you may pay {{ManaCost}}. If you do, amass Zombies {{Digits}}": "ActionList([MayCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [Amass({{Digits[0]}}, Zombie)])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}}. If you do, choose a color, then create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} for each permanent of that color": "ActionList([MayCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ChooseAColor(AnyColor), CreateTokens([NumberTokens(TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(IsColor(TheChosenColor)), TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, []))])])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}}. If you do, choose a color, then return all creatures of that color to their owners' hands": "ActionList([MayCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ChooseAColor(AnyColor), PutEachPermanentIntoItsOwnersHand(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsColor(TheChosenColor)]))])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}}. If you do, choose a color, then you gain {{Digits}} life for each permanent of that color": "ActionList([MayCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ChooseAColor(AnyColor), GainLifeForEach({{Digits[0]}}, TheNumberOfPermanentsOnTheBattlefield(IsColor(TheChosenColor)))])])",
    "you may pay {{ManaCost}}. If you do, copy all spells you control, then copy all other activated and triggered abilities you control. You may choose new targets for the copies": "ActionList([MayCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [CopyEachSpellAndMayChooseNewTargets(ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))), CopyEachAbilityAndMayChooseNewTargets(And([Other(ThisAbility), Or([ActivatedAbility, TriggeredAbility]), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))])])",
