    "you may sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle all other cards revealed this way into your library": "ActionList([MayCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [RevealCardsFromTheTopOfLibraryUntilACardOfTypeIsRevealed({{SpecificCard[0]}}, [PutTheCardFoundThisWayOntoTheBattlefield([EntersNormally]), PutTheRemainingCardsBackIntoLibraryAndShuffle])])])",
    "you may sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, search your library for up to {{Number}} {{SpecificCards}}, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle": "ActionList([MayCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [SearchLibrary([FindNumberCardsOfType({{Number[0]}}, {{SpecificCards[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])])])",
    "you may sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, take an extra turn after this one": "ActionList([MayCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [TakeAnExtraTurn])])",
    "you may sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. If you do, you draw {{Number}} cards and each opponent loses {{Digits}} life": "ActionList([MayCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [DrawNumberCards({{Number[0]}}), EachPlayerAction(Opponent, LoseLife({{Digits[0]}}))])])",
