    "you may sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. When you do, choose a nonland card name, then target player reveals their hand and discards all cards with that name": "ActionList([MayCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([ChooseACardName(IsNonCardtype(Land)), PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, RevealHandAndDiscardEachCard(IsNamed(TheChosenName)))])))])])",
