    "you may sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. When you do, put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on each {{Permanent}}": "ActionList([MayCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(ActionList([PutACounterOfTypeOnEachPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, {{Permanent[1]}})]))])])",
