    "you may sacrifice {{a}} {{Permanent}}. When you do, target {{SpecificCard}} in your graveyard gains flashback {{ManaCost}} until end of turn": "ActionList([MayCost(SacrificeAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [ReflexiveTrigger(Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([CreateGraveyardCardEffectUntil(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [AddAbility([Flashback(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}}))])], UntilEndOfTurn)])))])])",
