    "you may tap any number of untapped creatures you control. You gain {{Digits}} life for each creature tapped this way": "ActionList([TapAnyNumberOfPermanents(And([IsUntapped, IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), GainLifeForEach({{Digits[0]}}, TheNumberOfPermanentsTappedThisWay)])",
