    "you may tap {{Number}} {{Permanents}}. If you do, discover {{Digits}}": "ActionList([MayCost(TapNumberPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{Permanents[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [Discover({{Digits[0]}})])])",
    "you may tap {{Number}} {{Permanents}}. If you do, draw a card": "ActionList([MayCost(TapNumberPermanents({{Number[0]}}, {{Permanents[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [DrawACard])])",
