    "At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(Opponent), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersDrawStep(AnyPlayer), {{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of each player's end step, if {{Condition(ThatPlayer)}}, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersEndStep(AnyPlayer), {{Condition(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}}, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
