    "At the beginning of each player's end step, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersEndStep(AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
