    "When {{~Permanent}} enters, if they were cast using web-slinging, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), PermanentPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatPermanent, WasCastUsingWebSlinging), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "When {{~Permanent}} enters, if you cast them and {{Condition}}, create a token that's a copy of {{~Permanent}}, except it's not legendary": "TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), And([PermanentPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatPermanent, WasCast), {{Condition[0]}}]), ActionList([CreateTokens([TokenCopyOfPermanent(ThisPermanent, TokenCopyEffects([RemoveSupertypes([Legendary])]))])]))",
