    "When {{~Permanent}} enters, if you have fewer than {{Number}} cards in hand, draw cards equal to the difference": "TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), PlayerPassesFilter(You, NumCardsInHandIs(LessThan({{Number[0]}}))), ActionList([DrawNumberCards(Minus({{Number[0]}}, TheNumberOfCardsInPlayersHand(You)))]))",
