    "When {{~Permanent}} enters, if {{Condition[ThatEnteringPermanent]}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{Condition[ThatEnteringPermanent][0]}}, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
