    "Whenever a Vehicle crewed by {{~Permanent}} this turn attacks, if {{Condition}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(WhenACreatureAttacks(And([IsArtifactType(Vehicle), WasCrewedByACreatureThisTurn(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}))])), {{Condition[0]}}, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Whenever a card is put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, if {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerI(WhenACardIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(AnyCard, Opponent), {{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
