    "Whenever a card is put into your graveyard from anywhere, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenACardIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere(AnyCard, SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever a creature an opponent controls dies, put a number of {{CounterType}} counters on {{~Permanent}} equal to that creature's power": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)])), ActionList([PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(PowerOfPermanent(Trigger_ThatPermanent), {{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent)]))",
