    "Whenever a creature stations {{ThisPermanent}}, that creature perpetually gains {{PerpetualHasable}} and {{PerpetualHasable}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentStationsAPermanent(IsCardtype(Creature), SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), ActionList([CreatePerpetualPermanentEffect(Trigger_ThatPermanent, [AddAbility([{{PerpetualHasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{PerpetualHasable[1]}}])])]))",
    "Whenever a creature you control enters, you may pay {{ManaCost}}. If you do, attach {{ThisPermanent}} to that creature": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))])), ActionList([MayCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [AttachPermanentToPermanent(ThisPermanent, Trigger_ThatPermanent)])]))",
