    "Whenever a player casts a spell, if the amount of mana spent to cast it was less than its mana value, {{~Permanent}} deals {{Digits}} damage to that player": "TriggerI(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(AnyPlayer, AnySpell), SpellPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatSpell, ManaSpentIsLessThanManaValue), Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage(ThisPermanent, {{Digits[0]}}, Player(Trigger_ThatPlayer))])))",
    "Whenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell that targets only a single {{Zombie}}, that player copies that spell for each other {{Zombie}} that spell could target. Each copy targets a different one of those {{Zombies}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(AnyPlayer, And([Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), TargetsOnlyASinglePermanent(IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}))])), ActionList([PlayerAction(Trigger_ThatPlayer, CopySpellForEachPermanentAndMustChooseItAsNewTarget(Trigger_ThatSpell, And([Other(SingleTargetPermanentOfSpell(Trigger_ThatSpell)), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})])))]))",
