    "Whenever a player casts {{a}} {{Spell}} from their hand, exile it instead of putting it into a graveyard as it resolves": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(AnyPlayer, And([{{Spell[0]}}, WasCastFromTheirHand])), ActionList([CreateSpellEffect(Trigger_ThatSpell, [AsResolves([ExileResolvingSpell])])]))",
