    "Whenever you attack with {{~Permanent}} and another {{Creature}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerAttacksWithASingleCreatureAndANumberOfOtherCreatures(SinglePlayer(You), SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), GreaterThanOrEqualTo(Integer(1)), {{Creature[0]}}), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Whenever you attack, each opponent loses X life and you gain X life, where X is {{GameNumber}}. If {{~Permanent}} and a creature named {{NamedCard}} are attacking, and you both own and control them, exile them, then meld them into {{NamedCard}}. It enters tapped and attacking": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerAttacks(SinglePlayer(You)), ActionList([CreateValueX({{GameNumber[0]}}), EachPlayerAction(Opponent, LoseLife(ValueX)), GainLife(ValueX), If(And([PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsAttacking), APermanentPassesFilter(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsNamed(NamedCard({{NamedCard[0]}}))]), IsAttacking), PlayerPassesFilter(You, And([OwnsAndControls({{~Permanent}}), OwnsAndControlsA(And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsNamed(NamedCard({{NamedCard[0]}})), IsAttacking]))]))]), [ExilePermanentsAndMeldIntoNewPermanent(ThisPermanent, And([IsCardtype(Creature), IsNamed(NamedCard({{NamedCard[0]}})), IsAttacking]), {{NamedCard[1]}}, [EntersTapped, EntersAttacking])])]))",
