    "Whenever you cast a spell with mana value equal to {{GameNumber(~Permanent)}}, this enchantment deals that much damage to any target. Then put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on this enchantment": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), ManaValueIs(EqualTo({{GameNumber(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}))), Targeted([AnyTarget], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage({{~Permanent}}, WhenAPlayerCastsASpell_ManaValueOfThatSpell, Ref_AnyTarget), PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])))",
    "Whenever you cast a spell, if it's the first instant spell, the first sorcery spell, or the first {{Zombie}} spell other than {{~Spell}} you've cast this turn, {{TriggerActions(ThatSpell)}}": "TriggerI(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), AnySpell), SpellPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatSpell, Or([TheNthSpellCastByPlayerThisTurn(Integer(1), IsCardtype(Instant), You), TheNthSpellCastByPlayerThisTurn(Integer(1), IsCardtype(Sorcery), You), TheNthSpellCastByPlayerThisTurn(Integer(1), And([IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}}), Other(ThisSpell)]), You)])), {{TriggerActions(ThatSpell=Trigger_ThatSpell)[0]}})",
