    "Whenever you play a card with the same name as one of the exiled cards, you may put one of those cards with that name into its owner's hand. Then if there are no cards exiled with this enchantment, sacrifice it. If you do, take an extra turn after this one": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerPlaysACard(SinglePlayer(You), SharesANameWithAnExiled(TheExiledCards)), ActionList([MayAction(PutAnExiledCardIntoOwnersHand(And([SharesANameWithThePlayedCard, WasExiledWithPermanent({{~Permanent}})]))), If(NumCardsInExileIs(EqualTo(Integer(0)), WasExiledWithPermanent({{~Permanent}})), [MustCost(SacrificePermanent({{~Permanent}})), If(CostWasPaid, [TakeAnExtraTurn])])]))",
    "Whenever you play a land from exile or cast a spell from exile, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenAPlayerPlaysALandFromExile(SinglePlayer(You), IsCardtype(Land)), WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), WasCastFromExile)]), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
