    "Whenever you play a land, if it wasn't the first land you played this turn, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerI(WhenAPlayerPlaysALand(SinglePlayer(You), IsCardtype(Land)), PermanentPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatLand, IsFirstLandPlayedByPlayerThisTurn), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever you play {{a}} {{Land}}, if this permanent is a creature, it becomes an enchantment": "TriggerI(WhenAPlayerPlaysALand(SinglePlayer(You), {{Land[0]}}), PermanentPassesFilter(ThisPermanent, IsCardtype(Creature)), ActionList([CreatePermanentLayerEffect(ThisPermanent, [SetCardtype(Enchantment)])]))",
