    "Whenever you put one or more {{CounterType}} counters on this creature, {{TriggerActions}}. This ability triggers only once each turn": "TriggerOnceEachTurn(WhenAPlayerPutsAnyNumberOfCountersOfTypeOnAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), {{CounterType[0]}}, SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Whenever you put one or more {{CounterType}} counters on {{a}} {{Permanent}}, you may draw that many cards. Do this only once each turn": "TriggerMayOnceEachTurn(WhenAPlayerPutsAnyNumberOfCountersOfTypeOnAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), {{CounterType[0]}}, {{Permanent[0]}}), ActionList([DrawNumberCards(Trigger_ThatMuch)]))",
    "Whenever you put one or more {{CounterType}} counters on {{a}} {{Permanent}}, you may gain that much life. Do this only once each turn": "TriggerMayOnceEachTurn(WhenAPlayerPutsAnyNumberOfCountersOfTypeOnAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), {{CounterType[0]}}, {{Permanent[0]}}), ActionList([GainLife(Trigger_ThatMuch)]))",
