    "Whenever you put one or more {{CounterType}} counters on {{a}} {{Permanent}}, {{~Permanent}} deals that much damage to target opponent": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerPutsAnyNumberOfCountersOfTypeOnAPermanent(SinglePlayer(You), {{CounterType[0]}}, {{Permanent[0]}}), Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage(ThisPermanent, Trigger_ThatMuch, Player(Ref_TargetPlayer))])))",
