    "Whenever you roll a 1 or 2, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatMuch)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerRollsAValueOnADie(SinglePlayer(You), OneOf([1, 2])), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatMuch=Trigger_ThatMuch)[0]}})",
    "Whenever you roll a 3 or higher, {{~Permanent}} gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn. If the roll was 4 or higher, it gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn. If the roll was 5 or higher, it gains {{Hasable}} until end of turn": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerRollsAValueOnADie(SinglePlayer(You), GreaterThanOrEqualTo(Integer(3))), ActionList([CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn), If(TriggerDiceResultIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(Integer(4))), [CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)]), If(TriggerDiceResultIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(Integer(5))), [CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[2]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn)])]))",
    "Whenever you roll a die, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerRollsADie(SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
