    "Whenever you roll one or more dice, {{~Permanent}} gains {{Hasable}} and {{Hasable}} until end of turn. If any of those results was {{Digits}} or higher, draw a card": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerRollsAnyNumberOfDice(SinglePlayer(You)), ActionList([CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil({{~Permanent}}, [AddAbility([{{Hasable[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{Hasable[1]}}])], UntilEndOfTurn), If(WhenAPlayerRollsAnyNumberOfDice_AnyDiceResultIs(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Digits[0]}})), [DrawACard])]))",
