    "Whenever you scry, if {{~Permanent}} is tapped, you may untap it. Do this only once each turn": "TriggerMayOnceEachTurnI(WhenAPlayerScrys(SinglePlayer(You)), PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsTapped), ActionList([UntapPermanent({{~Permanent}})]))",
