    "Whenever you waterbend, earthbend, firebend, or airbend, draw a card. Then if you've done all four this turn, transform {{~Permanent}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerWaterEarthFireOrAirBends(SinglePlayer(You)), ActionList([DrawACard, If(PlayerPassesFilter(You, HasWaterEarthFireAndAirBendedThisTurn), [TransformPermanent(ThisPermanent)])]))",
