    "Whenever your commander enters or attacks, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(IsYourCommander), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}), TriggerA(WhenACreatureAttacks(IsYourCommander), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
