    "Whenever {{Number}} or more {{Creatures}} attack you and aren't blocked, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(WhenANumberOfCreaturesAttacksAPlayerAndArentBlocked(GreaterThanOrEqualTo({{Number[0]}}), {{Creatures[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
