    "Whenever {{a}} {{Creature}} dies, if it had power greater than {{~Permanent}}'s power, put a number of {{CounterType}} counters on {{~Permanent}} equal to the difference": "TriggerI(WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies({{Creature[0]}}), DeadPermanentPassesFilter(PowerIs(GreaterThan(PowerOfPermanent(ThisPermanent)))), ActionList([PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent(Minus(PowerOfDeadPermanent, PowerOfPermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})]))",
