    "Whenever {{a}} {{Creature}} enters, if its power is greater than this creature's power or its toughness is greater than this creature's toughness, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield({{Creature[0]}}), PermanentPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatPermanent, Or([PowerIs(GreaterThan(PowerOfPermanent({{~Permanent}}))), ToughnessIs(GreaterThan(ToughnessOfPermanent({{~Permanent}})))])), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
