    "Whenever {{a}} {{Creature}} enters, if {{~Permanent}} has counters on it, put the same number of each kind of counter on that creature": "TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield({{Creature[0]}}), PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, HasACounter), ActionList([PutCopyOfEachCounterOnPermanentOnPermanent({{~Permanent}}, Trigger_ThatPermanent)]))",
