    "Whenever {{a}} {{Creature}} is dealt damage, you may have {{~Permanent}} deal that much damage to any target. Do this only once each turn":
      "TriggerMayOnceEachTurn(WhenAPermanentIsDealtDamage({{Creature[0]}}), Targeted([AnyTarget], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage(ThisPermanent, Trigger_ThatMuch, Ref_AnyTarget)])))",
