    "Whenever {{a}} {{DamageSource}} deals damage to another player, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatMuch)}}": "TriggerA(WhenASourceDealsDamageToAPlayer({{DamageSource[0]}}, Other(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatMuch=Trigger_ThatMuch)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{DamageSource}} deals damage to one or more permanents and/or players, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenASourceDealsDamageToAnyNumberOfPlayersAndOrPermanents({{DamageSource[0]}}, AnyPlayer, AnyPermanent), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
