    "Whenever {{a}} {{DamageSource}} deals damage to this creature, {{TriggerActions[WhenASourceDealsDamage]}}": "TriggerA(WhenASourceDealsDamageToAPermanent({{DamageSource[0]}}, SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{TriggerActions[WhenASourceDealsDamage][0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{DamageSource}} deals damage to this creature, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(WhenASourceDealsDamageToAPermanent({{DamageSource[0]}}, SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{DamageSource}} deals damage to you or {{a}} {{Permanent}}, {{TriggerActions[WhenASourceDealsDamage](~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenASourceDealsDamageToAPlayer({{DamageSource[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), WhenASourceDealsDamageToAPermanent({{DamageSource[0]}}, {{Permanent[0]}})]), {{TriggerActions[WhenASourceDealsDamage](~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{DamageSource}} deals damage to you or {{a}} {{Permanent}}, {{TriggerActions[WhenASourceDealsDamage]}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenASourceDealsDamageToAPlayer({{DamageSource[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), WhenASourceDealsDamageToAPermanent({{DamageSource[0]}}, {{Permanent[0]}})]), {{TriggerActions[WhenASourceDealsDamage][0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{DamageSource}} deals damage to you, if {{Condition(~Permanent)}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(WhenASourceDealsDamageToAPlayer({{DamageSource[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), {{Condition(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}}, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
