    "Whenever {{a}} {{DamageSource}} deals noncombat damage to an opponent, if {{Condition}}, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatMuch,ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerI(WhenASourceDealsNoncombatDamageToAPlayer({{DamageSource[0]}}, Opponent), {{Condition[0]}}, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatMuch=Trigger_ThatMuch,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
