    "Whenever {{a}} {{Land}} enters, put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on this creature. If that land is {{a}} {{Swamp}}, put {{Number}} {{CounterType}} counters on this creature instead": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield({{Land[0]}}), ActionList([IfElse(PermanentPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatPermanent, IsLandType({{Swamp[0]}})), [PutNumberCountersOfTypeOnPermanent({{Number[0]}}, {{CounterType[1]}}, {{~Permanent}})], [PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, {{~Permanent}})])]))",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Land}} enters, this artifact deals {{Digits}} damage to that land's controller": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield({{Land[0]}}), ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage({{~Permanent}}, {{Digits[0]}}, Player(ControllerOfPermanent(Trigger_ThatPermanent)))]))",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Land}} enters, this creature deals {{Digits}} damage to any target. If that land is {{a}} {{Swamp}}, this creature deals {{Digits}} damage instead": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield({{Land[0]}}), Targeted([AnyTarget], ActionList([IfElse(PermanentPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatPermanent, IsLandType({{Swamp[0]}})), [PermanentDealsDamage({{~Permanent}}, {{Digits[1]}}, Ref_AnyTarget)], [PermanentDealsDamage({{~Permanent}}, {{Digits[0]}}, Ref_AnyTarget)])])))",
