    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} an opponent controls is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyard(And([{{Permanent[0]}}, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)]), AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ControllerOfThatPermanent)[0]}})",
