    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentBecomesTheTargetOfASpellOrAbility({{Permanent[0]}}, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ControllerOfThatSpellOrAbility)[0]}})",
