    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, its controller conjures a card named {{NamedCard}} onto the battlefield tapped": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyard({{Permanent[0]}}, AnyPlayer), ActionList([PlayerAction(ControllerOfPermanent(Trigger_ThatPermanent), ConjureCardOntoBattlefield({{NamedCard[0]}}, [EntersTapped]))]))",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyard({{Permanent[0]}}, AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyard({{Permanent[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, {{TriggerActions[WhenAPermanentIsPutIntoAGraveyard](~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyard({{Permanent[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions[WhenAPermanentIsPutIntoAGraveyard](~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} is sacrificed or destroyed, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenAPermanentIsSacrificed({{Permanent[0]}}), WhenAPermanentIsDestroyed({{Permanent[0]}})]), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} is turned face up, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentIsTurnedFaceUp({{Permanent[0]}}), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
