    "Whenever {{a}} {{Permanent}} leaves the battlefield, if it had a counter on it, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(WhenAPermanentLeavesTheBattlefield({{Permanent[0]}}), LeavingPermanentPassesFilter(HasACounter), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
