    "Whenever {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} is put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, you may have {{~Permanent}} become a copy of that card, except its name is {{NamedCard}}, it's legendary in addition to its other types, and it has {{Hasable}} and this ability": "TriggerA(WhenACardIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere({{SpecificCard[0]}}, Opponent), ActionList([MayAction(CreatePermanentLayerEffect({{~Permanent}}, [IsACopyOfGraveyardCard(Trigger_ThatGraveyardCard, CopyEffects([SetName({{NamedCard[0]}}), AddSupertypes([Legendary]), AddAbilityVariable(ThisAbility)]))]))]))",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} is put into your graveyard from anywhere, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenACardIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere({{SpecificCard[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} leaves your graveyard, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAGraveyardCardLeaves(And([{{SpecificCard[0]}}, InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))])), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} or {{a}} {{SpecificCard}} is put into your graveyard from anywhere, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenACardIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere({{SpecificCard[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), WhenACardIsPutIntoAPlayersGraveyardFromAnywhere({{SpecificCard[1]}}, SinglePlayer(You))]), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{a}} {{Spell}} causes you to gain life, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenASpellCausesAPlayerToGainLife({{Spell[0]}}, SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
