    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks or dies, choose a card at random exiled with {{~Permanent}} and put that card into its owner's hand": "TriggerA(Or([WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}))]), ActionList([ChooseAnExiledCardAtRandom(TheExiledCards), PutExiledCardIntoOwnersHand(TheChosenExiledCard)]))",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks or dies, choose two. Each mode must target a different player.\n* {{TriggerActions_Modal}}.\n* {{~PermanentOrDead}} deals {{Digits}} damage to target player and they create {{Number}} Treasure tokens.\n* {{~PermanentOrDead}} deals {{Digits}} damage to each {{Creature}} target player controls. Those creatures perpetually get {{PTMod}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}))]), Modal_ChooseTwo_DifferentTargets([{{TriggerActions_Modal[0]}}, Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([PermanentOrDeadPermanentDealsDamage({{Digits[0]}}, Player(Ref_TargetPlayer)), PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, CreateTokens([NumberTokens({{Number[0]}}, TreasureToken)]))])), Targeted([TargetPlayer(AnyPlayer)], ActionList([PermanentOrDeadPermanentDealsDamage({{Digits[1]}}, EachPermanent(And([{{Creature[0]}}, ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(Ref_TargetPlayer))]))), CreatePerpetualEachPermanentEffect(And([{{Creature[0]}}, ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(Ref_TargetPlayer))]), [AdjustPT({{PTMod[0]}})])]))]))",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks or dies, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}))]), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks while saddled, {{TriggerActions(ThatPermanent)}}": "TriggerA(If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsSaddled), WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}))), {{TriggerActions(ThatPermanent=Trigger_ThatPermanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks while saddled, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(If(PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsSaddled), WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}))), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks while {{Condition}}, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(If({{Condition[0]}}, WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}))), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks while {{Condition}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(If({{Condition[0]}}, WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}))), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks, attach up to one target {{Permanent}} to her. Then up to one other target {{Permanent}} gets {{PTModX}} until end of turn, where X is {{GameNumber(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), Targeted([UptoOneTargetPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}), UptoOneTargetPermanent(And([Other(Ref_TargetPermanent1), {{Permanent[1]}}]))], ActionList([AttachPermanentToPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent1, Trigger_ThatPermanent), CreatePermanentLayerEffectUntil(Ref_TargetPermanent2, [AdjustPTX({{PTModX[0]}}, {{GameNumber(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})], UntilEndOfTurn)])))",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks, if {{Condition(ThatPermanent)}}, {{TriggerActions(ThatCreature)}}": "TriggerI(WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{Condition(ThatPermanent=Trigger_ThatCreature)[0]}}, {{TriggerActions(ThatCreature=Trigger_ThatCreature)[0]}})",
