    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} attacks, it deals {{Digits}} damage to any target. If {{~Permanent}} is saddled and a creature was dealt damage this way, that creature perpetually gains \"{{PerpetualQuotedAbility}}\" and \"{{PerpetualQuotedAbility}}\"": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), Targeted([AnyTarget], ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage({{~Permanent}}, {{Digits[0]}}, Ref_AnyTarget), If(And([PermanentPassesFilter({{~Permanent}}, IsSaddled), ACreatureOrPlaneswalkerWasDealtDamageThisWay(IsCardtype(Creature))]), [CreatePerpetualEachPermanentEffect(And([IsCardtype(Creature), WasDealtDamageThisWay]), [AddAbility([{{PerpetualQuotedAbility[0]}}]), AddAbility([{{PerpetualQuotedAbility[1]}}])])])])))",
