    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} becomes the target of a spell or ability you control for the first time each turn, {{TriggerActions(ThatPermanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentBecomesTheTargetOfASpellOrAbilityForTheFirstTimeEachTurn(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))), {{TriggerActions(ThatPermanent=Trigger_ThatPermanent)[0]}})",
