    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} becomes the target of an ability that targets only it, you may pay {{ManaCost}}. If you do, copy that ability for each other {{Creature}} that ability could target. Each copy targets a different one of those creatures": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentBecomesTheTargetOfAnAbility(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), TargetsOnlySinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), ActionList([MayCost(PayMana({{ManaCost[0]}})), If(CostWasPaid, [CopyAbilityForEachPermanentItCouldTarget(Trigger_ThatAbility, And([Other({{~Permanent}}), {{Creature[0]}}]))])]))",
