    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} deals combat damage to a player, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}}. Then if {{Condition}}, that player loses half their life, rounded up": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent), AnyPlayer), ActionList([CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [])]), If({{Condition[0]}}, [PlayerAction(Trigger_ThatPlayer, LoseLife(HalfRoundedUp(LifeTotalOfPlayer(Trigger_ThatPlayer))))])]))",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} deals combat damage to a player, destroy up to one target artifact that player controls and put {{a}} {{CounterType}} counter on {{~Permanent}}": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent), AnyPlayer), Targeted([UptoOneTargetPermanent(And([IsCardtype(Artifact), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(Trigger_ThatPlayer))]))], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent), PutACounterOfTypeOnPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, ThisPermanent)])))",
