    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} deals combat damage to a player, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand. If her sneak cost was paid this turn, instead return that card to the battlefield": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), AnyPlayer), Targeted([TargetGraveyardCard(And([IsCardtype(Creature), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([IfElse(PermanentPassesFilter(ThisPermanent, SneakCostWasPaidThisTurn), [PutGraveyardCardOntoBattlefield(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard, [EntersNormally])], [PutGraveyardCardIntoHand(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard)])])))",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} deals combat damage to a player, surveil X, where X is the amount of damage it dealt to that player": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), AnyPlayer), ActionList([Surveil(Trigger_ThatMuch)]))",
    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} deals combat damage to a player, you may remove a counter from her. When you do, destroy target artifact or enchantment that player controls": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), AnyPlayer), ActionList([MayReflexiveActionTrigger(RemoveACounterFromPermanent(ThisPermanent), Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([Or([IsCardtype(Artifact), IsCardtype(Enchantment)]), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(Trigger_ThatPlayer))]))], ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanent)])))]))",
