    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} deals damage to {{a}} {{Zombie}}, destroy that creature": "TriggerA(WhenAPermanentDealsDamageToAPermanent(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), IsCreatureType({{Zombie[0]}})), ActionList([DestroyPermanent(Trigger_ThatOtherPermanent)]))",
