    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} or another {{Creature}} dies or deals combat damage to a player, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), WhenACreatureOrPlaneswalkerDies(And([Other({{~Permanent}}), {{Creature[0]}}])), WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), AnyPlayer), WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(And([Other({{~Permanent}}), {{Creature[0]}}]), AnyPlayer)]), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
