    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} or another {{Creature}} enters, you may discover X, where X is that creature's toughness. Do this only once each turn": "TriggerMayOnceEachTurn(Or([WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(And([Other({{~Permanent}}), {{Creature[0]}}]))]), ActionList([Discover(ToughnessOfPermanent(Trigger_ThatPermanent))]))",
