    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} or another {{Permanent}} is turned face up, {{TriggerActions}}. This ability triggers only once": "TriggerOnce(WhenAPermanentIsTurnedFaceUp(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{TriggerActions[0]}}), TriggerA(WhenAPermanentIsTurnedFaceUp(And([Other({{~Permanent}}), {{Permanent[0]}}])), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
