    "Whenever {{~Permanent}} or {{a}} {{Creature}} deals combat damage to a player, you may create a token that's a copy of {{a}} {{Permanent}}. Do this only once each turn": "TriggerMayOnceEachTurn(Or([WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), AnyPlayer), WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer({{Creature[0]}}, AnyPlayer)]), ActionList([CreateTokens([TokenCopyOfAPermanent({{Permanent[0]}}, NoTokenCopyEffects)])]))",
