  "{{TriggerEffect(~Plane)}}": {
    "At the beginning of your end step, if you planeswalked to {{~Plane}} this turn, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersEndStep(SinglePlayer(You)), PlayerPassesFilter(You, PlaneswalkedToAPlaneThisTurn(SinglePlane({{~Plane}}))), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of your end step, {{TriggerActions(~Plane)}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersEndStep(SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Plane=^~Plane)[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of your upkeep, {{TriggerActions(~Plane)}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Plane=^~Plane)[0]}})",
    "When chaos ensues, {{TriggerActions(~Plane)}}": "TriggerA(WhenChaosEnsues, {{TriggerActions(~Plane=^~Plane)[0]}})",
