    "Whenever chaos ensues, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(WhenChaosEnsues, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "Whenever you play a land or cast a spell from among cards exiled with {{~Plane}}, that card's owner loses {{Digits}} life and exiles the top card of their library": "TriggerA(Or([WhenAPlayerPlaysALandFromAmongCardsInExile(SinglePlayer(You), IsCardtype(Land), WasExiledWithPlane({{~Plane}})), WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), And([AnySpell, WasCastFromAmongCardsInExile(TheExiledCards)]))]), ActionList([PlayerActions(OwnerOfExiledCard(Trigger_ThatExiledCard), [LoseLife({{Digits[0]}}), ExileTopCardOfLibrary])]))",
    "Whenever you roll a blank on the planar die, {{TriggerActions(~Plane)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerRollsABlankOnThePlanarDie(SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions(~Plane=^~Plane)[0]}})",
