    "At the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(SinglePlayer(HostController)), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
