    "At the beginning of your upkeep and whenever {{EnchantedPermanent}} becomes tapped, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(Or([AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(SinglePlayer(You)), WhenAPermanentBecomesTapped(SinglePermanent(HostPermanent))]), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
    "When the last {{CounterType}} counter is removed from this Aura, {{TriggerActions[EnchantedPermanent](~Permanent)}}": "TriggerA(WhenTheLastCounterOfTypeIsRemovedFromAPermanent({{CounterType[0]}}, SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}})), {{TriggerActions[EnchantedPermanent](~Permanent=^~Permanent)[0]}})",
