    "When {{ThisPermanent}} enters, if enchanted creature has {{CheckHasable}}, {{ThisPermanent}} deals {{Digits}} damage to that creature and {{ThisPermanent}} gains \"{{QuotedAbility}}\"": "TriggerI(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefield(SinglePermanent(ThisPermanent)), PermanentPassesFilter(HostPermanent, HasAbility({{CheckHasable[0]}})), ActionList([PermanentDealsDamage(ThisPermanent, {{Digits[0]}}, Permanent(HostPermanent)), CreatePermanentLayerEffect(ThisPermanent, [AddAbility([{{QuotedAbility[0]}}])])]))",
    "Whenever a player activates an ability of {{EnchantedPermanent}} with {T} in its activation cost that isn't a mana ability, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatActivatedAbility)}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerActivatesAnAbility(AnyPlayer, And([AbilityOfPermanent(HostPermanent), HasTapSelfInCost, NonManaAbility])), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatActivatedAbility=Trigger_ThatActivatedAbility)[0]}})",
