    "Whenever this creature or {{EnchantedPermanent}} deals combat damage to a player, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent({{~Permanent}}), AnyPlayer), WhenACreatureDealsCombatDamageToAPlayer(SinglePermanent(HostPermanent), AnyPlayer)]), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
