    "Whenever {{EnchantedCreature}} attacks or blocks, attach any number of target {{Permanents}} to it":
      "TriggerA(Or([WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent(HostPermanent)), WhenACreatureBlocks(SinglePermanent(HostPermanent))]), Targeted([AnyNumberOfTargetPermanents({{Permanents[0]}})], ActionList([AttachEachPermanentToPermanent(Ref_TargetPermanents, HostPermanent)])))",

    "Whenever {{EnchantedCreature}} attacks or blocks, {{TriggerActions(~Permanent,ThatCreature)}}": "TriggerA(Or([WhenACreatureAttacks(SinglePermanent(HostPermanent)), WhenACreatureBlocks(SinglePermanent(HostPermanent))]), {{TriggerActions(~Permanent=^~Permanent,ThatCreature=Trigger_ThatCreature)[0]}})",
