    "Whenever {{EnchantedCreature}} attacks and isn't blocked, its controller may have it deal damage equal to {{GameNumber(ThatCreature)}} plus {{Digits}} to another target creature. If that player does, the attacking creature assigns no combat damage this turn": "TriggerA(WhenACreatureAttacksAndIsntBlocked(SinglePermanent(HostPermanent)), Targeted([TargetPermanent(And([Other(Trigger_ThatCreature), IsCardtype(Creature)]))], ActionList([PlayerMayCost(ControllerOfPermanent(Trigger_ThatCreature), HavePermanentDealDamage(Trigger_ThatCreature, Plus({{GameNumber(ThatCreature=Trigger_ThatCreature)[0]}}, {{Digits[0]}}), Permanent(Ref_TargetPermanent))), If(CostWasPaid, [CreatePermanentRuleEffectUntil(Trigger_ThatPermanent, [AssignsNoCombatDamage], UntilEndOfTurn)])])))",
