    "Whenever you cast {{a}} {{Spell}}, {{TriggerActions[EquippedCreature]}}": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), {{Spell[0]}}), {{TriggerActions[EquippedCreature][0]}})",
