    "At the beginning of each player's first main phase, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersFirstMainPhase(AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, if {{Condition(ThatPlayer)}}, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(AnyPlayer), {{Condition(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}}, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, if {{Condition(ThatPlayer)}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(AnyPlayer), {{Condition(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}}, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of each postcombat main phase, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersPostcombatMainPhase(AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of each upkeep, if {{Condition}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(AnyPlayer), {{Condition[0]}}, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of each upkeep, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersUpkeep(AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of the end step, if {{Condition}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersEndStep(AnyPlayer), {{Condition[0]}}, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of the end step, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersEndStep(AnyPlayer), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of the first upkeep, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfTheFirstUpkeepOfTheGame, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of the game, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfTheGame, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of the monarch's end step, {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer)}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersEndStep(IsTheMonarch), {{TriggerActions(ThatPlayer=Trigger_ThatPlayer)[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of your draw step, if {{Condition}}, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerI(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersDrawStep(SinglePlayer(You)), {{Condition[0]}}, {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of your draw step, {{TriggerActions}}": "TriggerA(AtTheBeginningOfAPlayersDrawStep(SinglePlayer(You)), {{TriggerActions[0]}})",
    "At the beginning of your end step, if a land entered the battlefield under your control this turn and you control a prime number of lands, create {{NamedCard}}, a legendary {{PT}} {{Black}} and {{Black}} {{Zombie}} creature token, then put that many {{CounterType}} counters on it":
