    "Whenever one or more {{Permanents}} enter under an opponent's control without being played, you may search your library for {{a}} {{SpecificCard}}, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Do this only once each turn": "TriggerMayOnceEachTurn(WhenAPermanentEntersTheBattlefieldUnderAPlayersControlWithoutBeingPlayed({{Permanents[0]}}, Opponent), ActionList([SearchLibrary([FindACardOfType({{SpecificCard[0]}}), PutFoundCardsOntoBattlefield([EntersTapped]), Shuffle])]))",
