    "Whenever one or more {{Zombies}} you control deal combat damage to a player or battle, look at the top {{Number}} cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order. You may return one of those {{Zombies}} to its owner's hand": "TriggerA(Or([WhenAnyNumberOfCreaturesDealCombatDamageToAPlayer(And([IsCreatureType({{Zombies[0]}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), AnyPlayer), WhenAnyNumberOfCreaturesDealCombatDamageToAPermanent(And([IsCreatureType({{Zombies[0]}}), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]), IsCardtype(Battle))]), ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary({{Number[0]}}, [PutAGenericCardIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInAnyOrder]), MayAction(PutAPermanentIntoItsOwnersHand(Trigger_ThoseCreatures))]))",
