    "Whenever you activate an ability that isn't a mana ability, copy it. You may choose new targets for the copy": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerActivatesAnAbility(SinglePlayer(You), NonManaAbility), ActionList([CopyAbilityAndMayChooseNewTargets(Trigger_ThatActivatedAbility)]))",
    "Whenever you activate an ability that isn't a mana ability, if life was paid to activate it, you may pay that much life again. If you do, copy that ability. You may choose new targets for the copy": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerPaysLifeToActivateAnAbility(SinglePlayer(You), NonManaAbility), ActionList([MayCost(PayLife(Trigger_ThatMuch)), If(CostWasPaid, [CopyAbilityAndMayChooseNewTargets(Trigger_ThatActivatedAbility)])]))",
