    "Whenever you cast a creature spell, that creature enters with X additional {{CounterType}} counters on it, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast it": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), IsCardtype(Creature)), ActionList([CreateSpellEffect(Trigger_ThatSpell, [EntersWithNumberCounters(NumColorsManaSpentToCastSpell(Trigger_ThatSpell), {{CounterType[0]}})])]))",
