    "Whenever you cast a spell that targets only a single creature you control, create {{a}} {{PT}} {{CreatureToken}} with {{Hasable}}, then copy that spell. The copy targets that token": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), TargetsOnlyASinglePermanent(And([IsCardtype(Creature), ControlledByAPlayer(SinglePlayer(You))]))), ActionList([CreateTokens([TokenWithPT({{PT[0]}}, {{CreatureToken[0]}}, [{{Hasable[0]}}])]), CopySpellForEachPermanentAndMustChooseItAsNewTarget(Trigger_ThatSpell, TheTokensCreatedThisWay)]))",
    "Whenever you cast a spell that targets only a single {{ArtifactOrCreature}}, create a token that's a copy of that artifact or creature, except it's not legendary": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), TargetsOnlyASinglePermanent({{ArtifactOrCreature[0]}})), ActionList([CreateTokens([TokenCopyOfPermanent(SingleTargetPermanentOfSpell(Trigger_ThatSpell), TokenCopyEffects([RemoveSupertypes([Legendary])]))])]))",
