    "Whenever you cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, look at the top X cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), HasXInCost), ActionList([LookAtTheTopNumberCardsOfLibrary(Trigger_ValueXOfThatSpell, [PutAGenericCardIntoHand, PutTheRemainingCardsOnTheBottomOfLibraryInARandomOrder])]))",
