    "Whenever you cast a spell, if the amount of mana spent to cast it was less than its mana value, target opponent loses life equal to the difference": "TriggerI(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), AnySpell), SpellPassesFilter(Trigger_ThatSpell, ManaSpentIsLessThanManaValue), Targeted([TargetPlayer(Opponent)], ActionList([PlayerAction(Ref_TargetPlayer, LoseLife(TheManaValueMinusTheManaSpentOnSpell(Trigger_ThatSpell)))])))",
    "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell from your hand, you may cast up to one target card of the other type from your graveyard. If a spell cast from your graveyard this way would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead": "TriggerA(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), And([Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), WasCastFromTheirHand])), Targeted([UptoOneTargetGraveyardCard(And([Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), DoesntSharesACardtypeWithSpell(Trigger_ThatSpell), InAPlayersGraveyard(SinglePlayer(You))]))], ActionList([MayAction(CastGraveyardCardIntoExile(Ref_TargetGraveyardCard))])))",
    "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell that targets only a single nonland permanent an opponent controls, if another opponent controls one or more nonland permanents that spell could target, choose one of those permanents. Copy that spell. The copy targets the chosen permanent": "TriggerI(WhenAPlayerCastsASpell(SinglePlayer(You), And([Or([IsCardtype(Instant), IsCardtype(Sorcery)]), TargetsOnlyASinglePermanent(And([IsNonCardtype(Land), IsPermanent, ControlledByAPlayer(Opponent)]))])), APlayerPassesFilter(And([Other(ControllerOfPermanent(SingleTargetPermanentOfSpell(Trigger_ThatSpell))), Opponent]), ControlsA(And([IsNonCardtype(Land), IsPermanent, CouldBeTargetedBySpell(Trigger_ThatSpell)]))), ActionList([ChooseAPermanent(And([IsNonCardtype(Land), IsPermanent, CouldBeTargetedBySpell(Trigger_ThatSpell), ControlledByAPlayer(And([Other(ControllerOfPermanent(SingleTargetPermanentOfSpell(Trigger_ThatSpell))), Opponent]))])), CopySpellAndMustChooseNewTarget(Trigger_ThatSpell, ThePermanentChosenThisWay)]))",
